<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h1">Bhak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha 1 Bhakolongwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Bhakolongwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Bhakolongwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Bhakolongwa bha Kutumbula</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Bhakolongwa</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya 1 Bhakolongwa na 2 Bhakolongwa pakutumbula hapa yakabhi chitabu chimu chikolongwa. Kwa mala ja kutumbula yakagabhinywi na kubha itabu ibheli mu litoleu la Kiebulania lelilowakeka Bibilia ja Seputuaginti, litoleu ambalu nde la mwande nakanopi la Lulaghilu lwa Mwande mu lugha ja Kigiliki. Ngacheimanyikana kwa uchakaka kubha nde nane joakailembiki itabu ya 1 Bhakolongwa na 2 Bhakolongwa, au kuibheka mu mpangiliu ghoubhi nayu. Mlemba wa itabu ya Bhakolongwa akatumili malembu ghangi gha mwande mu chikahi cha kuilemba (linga 1 Bhakolongwa 11:41, 14:19 na 14:29 ngati milenganesu jejilongalela uchakaka aghoghu. Bhelabhela ngacheimanyikana kwa uchakaka kubha nde chaka bholi itabu yenu payalembakiki au kubhekakeka mu mpangiliu waki. Nde chakaka kubha yakakamiliki kulembakeka baada jaka nkolongwa Yekonia kulekakewa kuhuma ku utumwa ku Babeli mu chaka cha 561 K. K. Maghambu lijambu aleli lilembakiki kwa uchakaka mu chitabu cha 2 Bhakolongwa 25:27. Bhasomi bhamaheli bha mambu gha Bibilia bhahobhale kubha pandu pakolongwa pa itabu yenjenu yakalembakiki hyaka yamaheli mangani ja chikahi chenihechi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Itabu ya 1 Bhakolongwa na 2 Bhakolongwa alongalela malobhi gha kila nkolongwa wa Izilaeli na Yuda kutumbu mu chikahi cha utawala waka Solomoni, chikahi inchi ayeyi ibheli payakabhi yakali ilombine. Itabu ya 1 Bhakolongwa na 2 Bhakolongwa ilongalela ntundu ukolongwa wa Izilaeli jejakalombini moukagabhanakili na kubha ngolongwa ibheli yeyakajengalili mu mielekeu jibheli jejilekine, mbaka chikahi chela ngolongwa ayeyi payakalepali na bhandu bha inchi nayenge, na bhandu bhaki kutolakeka kujenda kugheni. Mlemba wa itabu yenu alolakela uhusianu waka kila nkolongwa na Chapanga nahuli kumanya ngati akunjengali Chapanga kwa uchakaka au la. Bhakolongwa bhakumu bhahengiki “ghambone palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga” (2 Bhakolongwa 18:3). Bhangi bhakahengiki “ghaghabhi mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga” (2 Bhakolongwa 21:2). Mlemba alanda kwa mkati nakanopi malobhi gha utawala wa bhakolongwa bhabhakahengiki ghamboni palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga na kulangi kubha kuneng'anela kwa kila inchi kukabhokini na ulongwana waka nkolongwa kwaka Chapanga. Mu 2 Bhakolongwa 17:7, tusoma kubha bhandu bha inchi ja Izilaeli bhakatolakiki kwa makili na kupelekwa kugheni ngati bhatumwa kwa ndandi ayeyi: “Ghakahengakiki ghanihagha maghambu bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakahengiki mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga” na bhelabhela kwa kubha “bhakaijojabhi ichapanga nayenge.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ja 1-11 ilandila ntundu Solomoni mwana waka Daudi moakapati kubha nkolongwa na malobhi gha utawala wa ukolongwa wa Izilaeli jejilombanike.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ja 12-16 tusoma panani ja kugabhanika kwa ukolongwa wa Izilaeli na Yuda, na bhelabhela bhakolongwa bhakumu bha inchi ayeyi ibheli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ja 17-19 ilandila malobhi gha lihengu laka mlota Eliya na nakanopi panani ja mihutanu jejakabhi pachilanda jaki na Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sula ja 20-22 ilongalela ujomukelu wa utawala waka nkolongwa Ahabu panani ja Izilaeli, bhelabhela malobhi gha bhakolongwa bhangi bhabhakatawili baada jaka jombi, papamu na malobhi gha bhakolongwa bha Yuda.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Nkolongwa Daudi paakabhi mzee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Chikahi nkolongwa Daudi paakabhi mzee nakanopi, bhatumika bhaki bhakamuyekiki libulangeti, nambu hata bhela ngacheakapatiki upyohu. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Bhela bhatumika bhaki bhakumpwaghi, “Bambo witu, nde mbanga tundonda mwali bikila akutumakya unkolongwa na kukughoha. Mwali hoju aweza kughonela punkeghi jaku nahuli bambo witu nkolongwa upata upyohu.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Bhela, bhakundondiki mwali mnyahi ku inchi jokapi ja Izilaeli. Bhakumpatiki mwali jumu mnyahi joakalowakiki Abishagi, kuhuma ku muchi wa Shunami, nabhombi bhakumpeliki kwaka nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Mwali bikila hoju akabhi mnyahi namaa, bhela akatumbwili kungoha nkolongwa na kuntumakila, nambu nkolongwa ngacheakaghoni naku kihyegha.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adoniya atokulela ukolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Chikahi chenihechi, Adoniya, mwana waka Daudi, ambaju mabhu waki akalowakiki Hagiti, akalighambiki na kupwagha, “Nepani anangubha nunkolongwa.” Bhela akabhekiki wichu magali gha kuhutakika na falasi na bhabhajendesha falasi, papamu na bhandu hamsini bhabhakabhi bhundongulela palongi jaki. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />Nambu Daudi tati waka Adoniya, akabhi ngacheakalabhali kundakalila mwana waki hoju hata mala punkamu wala kundalukila, “Bho, maghambu kiki utenda anana?” Adoniya akabhi nkombu mnyahi namaa, na akunjengali Abisalomu kwa kubhelakeka. <verse eid="1KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adoniya akajetanganili na Yoabu, mwana waka Seluya, na mpenganyambiku Abiasali, nabhombi bhakajetakili kunjangatila. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Nambu mpenganyambiku Sadoki, na Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, na mlota Nasani, Shimei, Lei, papamu na bholonda bhaka Daudi ngachebhakabhi upambala waka Adoniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Lichobha limu, Adoniya akabhohiki nyambiku ya mambeleli, ng'ombi na matoli ghaghanenipi pa Liganga la Zoheleti, lelibhi pambipi na chemichemi jejilowakeka Eni Logeli. Akabhalohiki bhalongu bhaki bhokapi, bhana bhokapi bhaka nkolongwa na ihongozi bhokapi bha likabila laka Yuda na bhatumika bhaka nkolongwa, <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />nambu Adoniya ngacheakundohiki mlota Nasani, Benaya, bhalonda bhaka nkolongwa, wala Solomoni ndongu waki.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni ahimikwa kubha nkolongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Panihapa, Nasani akapiti kwaka Batisheba, mabhu waka Solomoni na kundulukila, “Bho, ngacheujowini kubha Adoniya, mwana waka Hagiti, abhi nkolongwa panga bambo witu Daudi kumanya lijambu lenihele? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Bhela ngati anaupala kughakengalela matamu ghaku na matamu ghaka mwana waku Solomoni, nukupwaghi anana: <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Unjendila nkolongwa Daudi na kumpwaghila, ‘Bambo wangu nkolongwa, bho, ngachewanapili nepani mtumika waku, ukapwaghaje, “Chakaka mwana waku Solomoni anakubha nkolongwa pandu pangu, na jombi nde jonaatamaje panani ja chitehu changu cha ukolongwa?” Bho, henu maghambu kiki Adoniya abhi nkolongwa?’ ” <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Nasani akajendali kupwagha, “Lingalyaje, chikahi pawikubha ulonge na nkolongwa Daudi, nepani ananyingalaje na kughalandila kwa uchakaka malobhi ghaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Bhela, Betisheba akapiti kumbona nkolongwa kuchumba chaki, chikahi hechi nkolongwa akabhi mzee namaa. Abishagi, kuhuma ku muchi wa Shunami, akabhi antumakila. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Betisheba akajinimi na kuchikama palongi jaka nkolongwa. Najombi nkolongwa akundalukile, “Upala kike?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Betisheba akamuyangiki, “Bambo wangu, wehapa wamweti ukanapili nepani mtumika waku kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ukapwaghaje, ‘Solomoni mwana waku anaakubha nkolongwa pandu pangu, na nde jonaatamaje pa chitehu changu cha ukolongwa.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Nambu lingalyaje, Adoniya abhi nkolongwa, na wehapa, bambo wangu nkolongwa ngacheumanyi mambu ghanihagha. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Abhohiki nyambiku yamaheli ya ng'ombi, matoli ghaghanenipi na mambeleli, najombi abhakokiki bhana bhaku bhokapi, mpenganyambiku Abiasali, na Yoabu nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli, nambu ngacheankokiki mtumika waku Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Bambo wangu nkolongwa, mihu gha Bhaizilaeli bhokapi ghakulingalila wehapa nahuli ubhapwaghilaje jola jonaatamaje panani ja chitehu chaku pandu paku, wenga wa bambo wangu nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Ngati ngabhela, chikahi pela pawikubha upotili na kutaghakika pandu pabhakataghakiki akatati bhaku, nepani na mwana wangu Solomoni anatubhalangika kubha bhana mahakau.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Bhela, chikahi Betisheba paakabhi akona kulonge na nkolongwa, mlota Nasani akahikike. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Bhakumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Mlota Nasani abhi pambane.” Panihapa mlota Nasani akapiti palongi jaka nkolongwa, akajinimi ukutama na kuchikama mbaka pamihu jaki jakagusiki paluhombi. <verse eid="1KI 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Nasani akapwaghike, “Wenga wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, bho, utangizi le kubha Adoniya anakubha nkolongwa pandu paku na kubha anaatama pachitehu chaku cha ukolongwa? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Maghambu lalenu ahelili na kubhoha nyambiku yamaheli ya ng'ombi, matoli ghaghanenipi na mambeleli. Najombi abhakokiki bhana bhaku bhokapi, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli na mpenganyambiku Abiasali. Sajenu, bhatenda uwangalalu na kujamalila bhakapwaghaje, ‘Atamaje matamu malachu, nkolongwa Adoniya!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Nambu nepani mtumika waku, mpenganyambiku Sadoki, Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, na mtumika waku Solomoni ngacheatukokike. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Bho, ghokapi hagha le ughahengiki wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, panga kutumanyiha tepani bhatumika bhaku mundu joanatama pa chitehu chaka bambo wangu nkolongwa baada jako?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Panihapa nkolongwa Daudi akapwaghike, “Munohilaje Betisheba, ajingala mkati.” Betisheba akapiti kwaka nkolongwa na kujema palongi jaki. <verse eid="1KI 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Najombi nkolongwa akalapiki akapwaghaje, “Chakaka ngati Bambo Chapanga moatamila, joangengalili kuhuma mu mang'ahiku ghangu ghokapi, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />chakaka ananhenga lalenu bhela chela chenakakulapile kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli nakapwaghaje, ‘Mwana waku Solomoni anakubha nkolongwa pandu pangu,’ najombi anatama pa chitehu changu cha ukolongwa badala jangu.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Bhela Betisheba akajinimi na kuchikama palongi jaka nkolongwa mbaka chibhongi chaki chakagusiki paluhombi, akapwaghaje, “Bambo wangu nkolongwa Daudi na utama mileli!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Nkolongwa Daudi akapwaghike, “Munohilaje mpenganyambiku Sodoki, mlota Nasani na Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada.” Nabhombi pabhakahikiki palongi jaka nkolongwa, <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />nkolongwa akabhapwaghile, “Njendaje na bhatumika bhangu nepani bambo winu, mukuntamika mwana wangu Solomoni panani ja liponda langu, na mukumpelaka mbaka ku chemichemi ja Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Konihoku mpenganyambiku Sodoki na mlota Nasani bhunjeghala mahuta nahuli kunhimika kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli. Bhela, muhona mbata na njamalyaje kwa sauti ngolongwa, mkapwaghaje, ‘Nkolongwa Solomoni na atama matamu malachu!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Ananjomwi kutenda ghanihagha, mwikwela papamu naku, najombi anahika na kutama pa chitehu changu cha ukolongwa na kutawala pandu pangu. Jonihoju nde jonunhawili kubha mtawala wa Izilaeli na Yuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Panihapa Benaya, mwana waka Yehoyada, akamuyangiki nkolongwa, “Amina! Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku wehapa wa bambo wangu nkolongwa, na alitenda haleli lihengakikaje. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Ngati bhela Bambo Chapanga moakabhelili na bambo wangu nkolongwa, bhela bhela na akubha na Solomoni, na kuchitenda chitehu chaki cha ukolongwa kubha chikolongwa kupeta chela chaka bambo wangu nkolongwa Daudi!”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Bhela, mpenganyambiku Sodoki, mlota Nasani, Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, Bhakeleti na Bhapeleti bhabhakabhi bhalonda bhaka nkolongwa, bhakunkwehiki Solomoni panani ja liponda laka nkolongwa Daudi, nabhombi bhakunhindaki mbaka ku chemichemi ja Gihoni. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Mpenganyambiku Sodoki akatoliki linyelu lelakabhi na mahuta kuhuma mu Lihema Lihuhu na kunjeghe Solomoni mahuta. Panihapa bhakahoniki mbata na bhandu bhokapi bhakajamalili kwa sauti ngolongwa, bhakapwaghaje, “Nkolongwa Solomoni na atama matamu malachu!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Bhela, bhandu bhokapi bhakakweliki koni bhakunjengalyaje, bhakabhi bhahona filimbi na kuhekalela namaa, mbaka inchi jakanyukiki kwa sauti yabhu.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Bhela, Adoniya papamu na bhagheni bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu naku bhakajowini sauti heji pabhakabhi bhajomulela uwangalalu wabhu. Pabhakajowini sauti ja mbata, Yoabu akalalukile, “Bho, manjobhela ghanihgha ghabhi na ndandi ja kike kumbwani hoko?” <verse eid="1KI 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Najombi paakabhi alongela ghanihagha, Yonasani mwana waka mpenganyambiku Abiasali akahikike. Adoniya akapwaghike, “Ujingala mkati. Maghambu wehapa nde mundu wambone, uleta malobhi ghamboni.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Panihapa Yonasani akamuyangiki Adoniya, “Ngabhela, chakaka nkolongwa Daudi bambo witu anhimiki Solomoni kubha nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Nkolongwa antumiki papamu na mpenganyambiku Sadoki, mlota Nasani, Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, Bhakeleti na Bhapeleti bhalonda bhaka nkolongwa, nabhombi bhunkwehiki panani ja liponda laka nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />Bhela mpenganyambiku Sadoki na mlota Nasani bhunjeghi mahuta Solomoni ku chemichemi ja Gihoni hoku, nahuli akubha nkolongwa. Kutumbula panihapa bhajendalela kuhekalela na sauti ijaghanili pambwani pokapi. Jeniheji nde ndandi ja njobhela yeujowana. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, sajenu Solomoni atami panani ja chitehu cha ukolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Bhelabhela bhatumika bhaka nkolongwa bhahikiki nahuli kumpengalela bambo witu nkolongwa Daudi bhakapwaghaje, ‘Chapanga waku na alitendaje lihina laka Solomoni limanyikanaje nakanopi kupeta laku, na chitehu chaki cha ukolongwa chibya na makili kupeta chaku!’ Najombi nkolongwa akajinimi na kujojabhela panani ja chitanda chaki. <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />Na alobhiki akapwaghaje, ‘Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, joantendiki jumu wa bhabhelakeka bhangu kubha nkolongwa pandu pangu, na joambeki matamu mbaka naghaweni aghagha ghapitalila.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Bhela, bhagheni bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu na Adoniya bhakajowipi namaa, bhakapechangini kwa choghoi, kila mundu na indela jaki. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Nambu Adoniya kwa kunjoghopa Solomoni, akapiti na kujingi mu Lihema laka Bambo Chapanga na kukamula mu manyelu gha meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akapwaghakike, “Adoniya anjoghopa nkolongwa Solomoni na akamulakili mu manyelu gha meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, akapwaghaje, ‘Nkolongwa Solomoni na anapila lalenu kubha ngaankomi mtumika waki kwa lipanga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Solomoni akayangike, “Ngati ananumbweni kubha nde mtumika ndongwana, njeta hata lijunju laki leanalihabhuka panani ja luhombi, nambu ngati uhakau anaubhonakini mkati jaki, anapotilaje.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni akabhatumiki bhandu kundoha Adoniya kuhuma mu Lihema, bhakumbohiki kuhuma pandu pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku. Najombi Adoniya akahiki palongi jaka nkolongwa, na kunjinamila nkolongwa Solomoni kwa utopelu. Nkolongwa akumpwaghi Adoniya, “Ujenda kunyumba jaku.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ampeke Solomoni malaghalakilu gha kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Chikahi Daudi paakaheghali kupotela, akundohiki mwana waki Solomoni na kumpeke lilaghalakilu, akapwaghaje: <verse eid="1KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />“Mwanango, ngati moubhelili ntetu kwa ihumbi yokapi kupotela, machobha ghangu ghajomwike. Bhela ukangamalaje na ukubha na makile. <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />Ukamulaje malaghalakilu ghaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku: Ujendaje mu indela yaki, ukamula malaghalakilu na amuli yaki, shelia yaki na ndemulu yaki, ngati moilembakiki mu Shelia yaka Musa, nahuli upata kuneng'anela mu mambu ghokapi ghautenda na pokapi paujenda, <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />nahuli Bambo Chapanga awezaje kulangiha chilanga chaki cheakabhohiki chikahi paakambwaghile, ‘Ngati bhana bhaku anabhakamwili amuli yangu na kundumakila kwa ulongwana, kwa mitima jabhu jokapi na kwa roho yabhu yokapi, ngapilepi kubha na jumu wabhu wa kutawala mu Izilaeli ng'o.’<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, wehapa ughamanyi mambu ghala ghaakahengiki Yoabu, mwana waka Seluya, ntundu moakabhahengile manjolinjoli bhakolongwa bhabheli bha Izilaeli, Abineli mwana waka Neli, na Amasa mwana waka Yeteli. Akabhakomiki chikahi cha lukwali koni akapala kulepa kisasi ngati kubha bhakabhi mu chikahi cha ngondo. Akabhakomiki bhandu bhangakubha na hatia, na sajenu nepani mbata lawama kubhokana na chitendu chaki cheakahengiki hechi, na kunetela mang'ahiku. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Bhela, wehapa unhengilaje lijambu lela leubhona kubha nde lamboni kwaku, nambu ngawandeka kusejeka na kupotela kwa lukwali.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />“Nambu ubhatendila ghamboni bhana bhaka Balizilai wa ku muchi wa Gileadi na ubhabhekaje bhakubha pachilanda ja bhala bhabhakula chilebhi pameza jaku. Kwa ndandi bhakandendili ghamboni chikahi panakabhi nuntila ndongu waku Abisalomu.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />“Ukombukaje, ubhi naku Shimei mwana waka Gela, Mbenyamini kuhuma ku Bahulimu, ambaju akambeki masolu namaa mu lichobha lenakapiti ku muchi wa Mahanaimu. Paakahelili kunyopalela ku nkoka Yoludani hoku, nakundapili kwaka Bambo Chapanga, ‘Nepani nganukukomi kwa lipanga!’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Nambu wehapa ngawandeka panga kuntemula. Wehapa nde wa mundu weubhi na malangu, anaumanya lijambu la kuntendela. Unkomaje hata ngati jombi atehi kusejeka.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Bhela, Daudi akapotili, najombi akataghakiki mu muchi ghoukalowakiki muchi Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Daudi akatawili mu inchi ja Izilaeli kwa hyaka alobaini: Ku Hebuloni hoku akatawili kwa hyaka saba, na mu Yelusalemu akatawili kwa hyaka selasini na itatu. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Bhela, Solomoni akatami pa chitehu cha ukolongwa badala jaka tati waki Daudi, na ukolongwa waki ukajemakakili namaa.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Adoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Bhela, Adoniya, mwana waka Hagiti, akapiti kwaka Betisheba, mabhu waka Solomoni. Betisheba akundalukile, “Bho, uhikiki le kwa lukwale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Adoniya akayangike, “Ena, nhikiki kwa lukwale.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Nambu, “Mili na lilobhi limu pela la kukupwaghila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Betisheba akayangike, “Upwagha pela.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Adoniya akumpwaghile, “Ngati moumanyila, ukolongwa ukabhi wangu. Bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakaningalili nepani ngati nkolongwa wabhu, nambu mambu ghakang'anambwiki, na ukolongwa upiti kwaka ndongu wangu, maghambu ghanihagha nde ghaghakabhi mapalu ghaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Nambu minalu lilobhu limu pela lenukulobha. Chondi ngawinganila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Betisheba akupwaghike, “Upwagha pela.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Najombi akajendali kupwagha, “Chondi undobha nkolongwa Solomoni, anyetakyaje nuntola Abishagi, Mshunami, akubha nhwanu wangu, mili na chakaka kwaku wehapa ngaakukanile.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Betisheba akayangike, “Wichu namaa, ananongila na nkolongwa kwa ndandi jaku.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Bhela, Betisheba paakapiti kwaka nkolongwa Solomoni nahuli kulonge naku kwa ndandi jaka Adoniya, nkolongwa akajemiki kunjopalela mabhu waki, akunjinamili na kutama pachitehu chaki cha ukolongwa. Akalaghalakili chitehu chengi cha kikolongwa chiletakikaje kwa ndandi jaka mabhu waka nkolongwa, najombi mabhu waki akatami upambala wa kumalelelu waka nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Betisheba akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Mili na lilobhu limu lichokopi la kukulobha, chondi ngawinganila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Nkolongwa akayangike, “Ulobhaje, mabhu wangu, nganukukanile.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Najombi akapwaghike, “Unjetakalyaje ndongu waku Adoniya antoghula Abishagi, Mshunami hoju.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akamuyangiki mabhu waki, “Bho, maghambu kiki upala Adoniya numpekya Abishagi, Mshunami? Uweza kundobhela na ukolongwa wangu kwa ndandi jaki! Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, jombi nde ndongu wangu nkolongwa, na ukombuka kubha mpenganyambiku Abiasali, na linjolinjoli nkolongwa Yoabu, mwana waka Seluya, bhabhi upambala wake!” <verse eid="1KI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Panihapa nkolongwa Solomoni akalapiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Chapanga ungomila kutali, panga na chiha, ngati nganunkomi Adoniya kwa ndandi ja kubhoha lilobhu lenu! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Bhela, ngati Bambo Chapanga moatamila, joambeki ukangamalu mu ukolongwa waka tati wangu, najombi ambekihi ukolongwa wa kutamakila nepani na bhabhelakeka bhangu ngati moakalaghile, napa kubha Adoniya anakomakika lalenu!”<verse eid="1KI 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Panihapa nkolongwa Solomoni akabhohiki amuli kwaka Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, najombi akapiti kundapu Adoniya, mbaka kupotela.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomakeka kwaka Yoabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akumpwaghi mpenganyambiku Abiasali, “Ubhokaje ujendaye kungonda waku, ku muchi wa Anatoti hoku. Wehapa ikupalika kupotela, nambu nganukukomi sajenu, kwa ndandi ukalitoliki Lisanduku laka Bambo Chapanga palongi jaka tati wangu Daudi na kuhinakila mang'ahiku ghokapi papamu na tati wangu.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni akuntopwi Abiasali ngayikubha mpenganyambiku waka Bambo Chapanga, bhela lakapitalili chakaka lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga leakabhi alonguli kulipwagha ku muchi wa Shilo hoku kwa ndandi jaka mpenganyambiku Eli, na bhabhelakeka bhaki.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Yoabu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akatilili mu Lihema laka Bambo Chapanga na kukamulakila mu manyelu gha meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, maghambu akabhi chindu chimu na Adoniya, nambu ngacheakunjengali Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Nkolongwa Solomoni paakajowini kubha Yoabu abhi mu Lihema laka Bambo Chapanga na akamulakili manyelu gha meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, panihapa Solomoni akuntumiki Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, akapwaghaje, “Ujendaje ukunkomaje.” <verse eid="1KI 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Bhela, Benaya akajingili mu Lihema laka Bambo Chapanga na kumpwaghi Yoabu: Nkolongwa apwagha, “Upita kunja.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Yoabu akayangike, “Nepani ngapiti kunja, ananhwelila pambane.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaya akakelawiki kwaka nkolongwa, na kumpwaghi ghaakayangiki Yoabu.<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Bhela, nkolongwa akundaghalaki Benaya, “Utenda ngati moapwaghile. Unkoma na kuntagha, nahuli umokiha nepani na nyumba jaka tati wangu Daudi mahoku ghaakatendiki Yoabu kwa kubhakoma bhandu bhangakubha na mahakau. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />Najombi Bambo Chapanga anaantemula Yoabu kwa kubhakoma bhandu panga kumanya tati wangu Daudi, akabhalapwili bhandu bhabheli habha na kubhakoma kwa lipanga. Abineli mwana waka Neli, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli gha Izilaeli, na Amasa mwana waka Yeseli, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli gha Yuda, bhandu bhanihabha bhakabhi bhamboni na bhabhajetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga kupeta jombi. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Utemulu wa makomakeku ghanihagha anaghakubha panani jaka Yoabu na bhabhelakeka bhaki mileli. Nambu kwaka Daudi na bhabhelakeka bhaki, bhandu bha munyumba jaki na chitehu chaki cha ukolongwa, anakukubha na lukwali lwa mileli kuhuma kwaka Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Bhela, Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, akapiti ku Lihema laka Bambo Chapanga na kundapu na kunkoma Yoabu, najombi akuntaghiki kunyumba jaki mweni jejibhi kuchingwenji. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Nkolongwa akumbekiki Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, kubha nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli pandu paka Yoabu, na Sodoki akabhi mpenganyambiku pandu paka Abiasali.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Shimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Bhela, nkolongwa akatumiki ubholu kwaka Shimei na kumpwaghila, “Ulichengila nyumba pani pa Yelusalemu na utama monihomu, nambu ngawijenda pandu pangi pokapi pala kunja ja muchi. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Lichobha lewibhokaje kulomboka libondi la kikoka cha Kiduloni, nukupwaghi chakaka anaupotilaje, kupotela kwaku anakukubha kwa kulipali wamwete.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Shimei akamuyangiki nkolongwa, “Upwaghiki lijambu lamboni. Mtumika waku ananyenda kutama ngati bambo wangu nkolongwa moupwaghile.” Najombi Shimei akatami ku muchi wa Yelusalemu kwa chikahi chilachu.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Nambu payapetiki hyaka itatu, bhatumwa bhabheli bhaka Shimei bhakatiliki na kujenda kwaka Akishi mwana waka Maaka, nkolongwa wa muchi wa Gati, najombi Shimei akapwaghakike, “Bhatumwa bhaku bhabhi ku muchi wa Gati.” <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Panihapa Shimei akabhokiki, na kutama panani ja liponda laki, akapiti ku muchi wa Gati kwaka nkolongwa Akishi, nahuli kubhalonda bhatumwa bhaki. Bhela, paakabhahimanili, akabhakelawihi kunyumba jaki. <verse eid="1KI 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Chikahi nkolongwa Solomoni paakajowini kubha Shimei abhokiki ku muchi wa Yelusalemu na kujenda ku muchi wa Gati na ajomwi kukelabhuka, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />nkolongwa akundohiki Shimei na kumpwaghila, “Bho, ngachenakakulapili kwaka Bambo Chapanga na kukulakalila, ‘Lichobha lewibhokaje na kujenda pandu pangi pokapi pala kunja ja muchi, umanya kubha chakaka anaupotilaje?’ Chikahi chela ukambwaghi, ‘Upwaghiki lijambu lamboni!’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Bho, henu maghambu kiki uhekiti kulapa kwaku kwaka Bambo Chapanga, na kukotoka kutii amuli jenukupekihe?” <verse eid="1KI 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Kabheti nkolongwa akumpwaghi Shimei, “Ughamani hotuhotu mahakau ghauntendi tati wangu Daudi. Bhela Bambo Chapanga anaakulepa uhakau waku kwa ndandi ja mahakau ghaku ghautendiki. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Nambu nkolongwa Solomoni anapengalikaje, na chitehu chaki cha ukolongwa chaka Daudi anachijemakya kwa ukangamalu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga mileli.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Panihapa nkolongwa akabhohiki amuli kwaka Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada, najombi akabhokiki na kujenda kundapu Shimei na kunkoma. Bhela ukolongwa ukakangamili pahi ja utawala waka Solomoni.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni alobha kupekewa mbulau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 1:3-12">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 1:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Bhela, Solomoni akatendiki majetanganelu na nkolongwa Falao wa ku inchi ja Misili na kuntogho mwali waki. Akundetiki mwali hoju mu muchi waka Daudi mbaka paakajomwi kuchenga nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa na Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, papamu na kuchenga lumatu kuyongolota muchi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Mbaka kuhika pa chikahi chenihechi, bhandu bhakabhi bhakali bhabhoha nyambiku ya kujochakeka mu tutombi, kwa ndandi Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga jakabhi jakona ngakuchengakeka. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomoni akalangihi upalu waki kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa kukamulakila wichu amuli yeakapekiwi na tati waki Daudi, nambu jombi mweni akabhohiki nyambiku ya kujochakeka na kuhuwa ubani pa tutombi.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Lichobha limu nkolongwa Solomoni akapiti kubhoha nyambiku ku muchi wa Gibeoni, maghambu pakabhi nde pandu pa katombi papamanyakini pa kujojabhela, najombi Solomoni akabhohiki nyambiku elufu jimu ya kujochakeka panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku hapa. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Bambo Chapanga akumpitali Solomoni ku muchi wa Gibeoni hoku chikahi cha ikilu mu ndoto, najombi Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ulobha chokapi cheupala, nanatu ananukupekyaje.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Solomoni akayangike, “Untendili mtumika waku, Daudi tati wangu, upalu wangakujomoka, kwa ndandi akabhi ndongwana kwaku na joajetakalewa palongi jaku, na akabhi na mtima wamboni. Nanau ujendalili kumpekeha upalu ghoni wangakubha na ujomukelu kwa kumpeke mwana wa kutama pa chitehu chaki cha ukolongwa, ngati mokubheli lalenu. <verse eid="1KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />Bhela, wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, umekiki nepani mtumika waku kubha nkolongwa pandu paka tati wangu Daudi, nambu nepani nde nunkombu nchoku pela, na ngachemanyi ntundu wa kutawala. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Mtumika waku abhi pambani pachilanda ja bhandu bhaubhahawile, nabhombi nde bhamaheli namaa, hata ngacheiwezikana kubhabhalanga kwa ntundu mobhabheli bhamaheli. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Bhela, umpekya mtumika waku mtima wa umanyi nahuli nhweza kubhatawala bhandu bhaku na kumanya kughayekula pachilanda ja ghamboni na mahakau. Maghambu bho, nde nane joaweza kubhatawala bhandu bhaku abhabha bhabhabhi bhamaheli anana?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Lilobhu leniheli laka Solomoni lakabhi lamboni palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Bhela Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Kwa kubha ulobhiki lilobhi lenu na ngacheulobhiki matamu malachu au upata hindu yamaheli kwa ndandi jaku, wala ngacheulobhiki maadui bhaku bhayonangikikaje, nambu ulobhiki umanyi wa kubhoha utemulu ngati moipalakila, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />bhela, anandenda lela leulobhike. Lingalyaje, ananukupekya mtima wa mbulau na mtima wa umanyi, ambayu mangani jaku ngachepalabhali kubha na mundu ngati wehapa, wala palongi jaku ngapikubhi na mundu ngati wehapa. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Nyonjeka ja ghanihagha, ananukupekya ghala ambaghu ngacheulobhiki: Ananukupekya wamaheli wa hindu na utopelu nakanopi jaka nkolongwa jongi jokapi jola wa chikahi chaku. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Kabheti ngati anaujengalili indela yangu, na malaghalakilu ghangu na kukamula amuli yangu ngati tati waku Daudi moakatendili, ananukupekya matamu malachu.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Solomoni akajumwiki, na kumanya kubha jakabhi ndoto. Akakelawiki ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, na kujema palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, najombi akabhohiki nyambiku ya kujochakeka na nyambiku ya lukwali. Bhela akabhatendili bhatumika bhaki bhokapi uwangalalu.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni atemula kwa mbulau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Bhela lichobha limu akambomba bhabheli bhakemi, bhakapiti kujema palongi jaka nkolongwa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Mbomba jumu akapwaghike, “Wenga wa bambo wangu, nepani na mbomba hajoju tutama mu nyumba jimu. Nepani nakalibhopwi mwana panakabhi papamu naku kunyumba. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Panilibhopwi nepani ghakapetiki machobha ghatatu na mbomba ajoju najombi akalibhopwi mwana. Tukabhi kanjika jitu, na ngachepakabhi na mundu jongi papamu na tepani panyumba, nambu tepani tabhabheli pela. <verse eid="1KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />Bhela ikilu jimu, mwana waka mbomba ajoju akapotile, maghambu akatei kungonalela. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Bhela akajumwiki ikilu pamahiku, akuntoliki mwana wangu kuhuma pachihimba changu chikahi nepani panakabhi ng'ochi lughonu, na kungoneka pachihimba changu mwana waki joapoti jola. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Panakajumwiki lukela nahuli kunjongeha mwana wangu, mwana akabhi apotile! Nambu panakundingalaki wichu, nakamanyi kubha ngacheakabhi mwana wangu jonumbeliki.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Nambu mbomba jongi jola akapwaghike, “Ngabhela! Mwana joabhi mwomi nde wangu, na joapoti nde waku wehapa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Nambu mbomba wa kutumbula jola akajomalakile, “Ngabhela! Mwana joapoti nde waku wehapa, na joabhi mwomi nde wangu nepani.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Bhenibhela nde mobhakajendali kulochana palongi jaka nkolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Panihapa nkolongwa Solomoni akapwaghike, “Kila jumu winu ajomalake kubha, mwana waki nde joabhi mwomi, na kubha mwana joapoti nga waki.” <verse eid="1KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Bhela nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Mnetila lipanga.” Panihapa bhakundeti nkolongwa lipanga. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Bhela nkolongwa akapwaghike, “Unhekata mwana joabhi mwomi ipandi ibheli, umpekya ajoju nusu, na jongi nusu.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Mbomba ambaju mwana waki akabhi mwomi jola akakamuliki na chiha kwa ndandi jaka mwana waki, bhela akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Chondi bambo wangu, umpekya jombi mwana joabhi mwomi hoju! Ngawankoma!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Nambu mbomba jongi jola akapwaghike, “Unhekata ipandi ibheli. Mwana ngaikubha wangu nepani, wala ngaikubha waka jombi!”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akapwaghike, “Ngawankoma mwana! Umpekya mbomba wa kutumbula antolaje, maghambu jombi chakaka nde mabhu waki.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhakajowini panani ja utemulu ghoakabhohiki nkolongwa Solomoni, bhakunjowipi nkolongwa, ndandi bhakamanyi kubha akabhi na mbulau yaka Chapanga yeyakuntendiki kubhoha utemulu ghoujetakalewa palongi jaka Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Bhatumika bhaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Bhela nkolongwa Solomoni akabhi mtawala wa inchi jokapi ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Abhabha nde bhabhakabhi ihongozi bhabhakabhi pahi jaki: Mpenganyambiku Azalia, mwana waka Sadoki. <verse eid="1KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Eliholefu na Ahiya, bhana bhaka Shisha: Bhakabhi bhalemba. Yehoshafati mwana, waka Ahiludi: Akabhi ngoha kombukombu ya mambu. <verse eid="1KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaya mwana waka Yehoyada: Akabhi nkolongwa wa manjolonjoli, Sadoki na Abiasali: Bhakabhi bhapenganyambiku. <verse eid="1KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Azalia mwana waka Nasani: Akabhi njemalela nkolongwa wa ihongozi bha Izilaeli. Zabudi mwana waka Nasani: Akabhi mpenganyambiku, na mshauli waka nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahishali: Akabhi njemalela wa nyumba ja kikolongwa, Adolamu mwana waka Abuda: Akabhi njemalela wa lihengu la kujomalakela.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Solomoni akabhahawili ihongozi bha pahi jaki komi na bhabheli kwa inchi jokapi ja Izilaeli. Bhanihabha bhakapekiwi lihengu la kubhongana na kupeleka chilebhi kwa ndandi jaka nkolongwa na nyumba jaki. Kila jumu wabhu akaletiki chilebhi kuhuma ku wilaya jaki kwa mwehi ghumu kila chaka. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Aghagha nde mahina gha ihongozi bhanihbha: Mwana waka Huli, akabhi chiongozi wa pandu pa itombi yaka Efulahimu. <verse eid="1KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Mwana waka Dekeli, akabhi chiongozi wa michi ja Makasi, Shaalibimu, Betishemeshi na Eloni Betihanani. <verse eid="1KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Mwana waka Hesedi, akabhi chiongozi wa michi ja Aluboti, bhelabhela akajemalili muchi wa Soko na pandu pokapi pa muchi wa Hefeli. <verse eid="1KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Mwana waka Abinadabu, ndomi waka Tafati, joakabhi mwali waka Solomoni, akajemali muchi wa Nafati Doli. <verse eid="1KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana, mwana waka Ahiludi, akajemali michi ja Taanaki na Megido, na pandu pokapi pa Beti Sheani ghoubhi pambipi na muchi wa Saletani kunkachi ja muchi wa Yezileeli, na kutumbu ku Beti Sheani mbaka ku muchi wa Abeli Mehola, na kupeta mbaka ku muchi wa Yokimeamu. <verse eid="1KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Mwana waka Gebeli, akabhi chiongozi wa muchi wa Lamoti Gileadi papamu na ijiji ya Gileadi yeyakabhi pahi jaka Yaili, mwana waka Manase, bhelabhela akajemali mkoa wa Aligobu ghoubhi ku Bashani na michi jaki mikolongwa sitini jejiyongalitwi na lumatu lolubhi na makabali gha shaba. <verse eid="1KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadabu mwana waka Ido, akabhi chiongozi wa pandu pa Mahanaimu. <verse eid="1KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaasi, joakuntowi Basemati, mwali jongi waka Solomoni, akabhi chiongozi wa pandu pa Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana, mwana waka Hushai, akabhi chiongozi wa muchi wa Asheli na muchi wa Bealoti. <verse eid="1KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehoshafati mwana waka Palua, akabhi chiongozi wa pandu pa Isakali. <verse eid="1KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Shimei mwana waka Ela, akabhi chiongozi wa pandu pa Benyamini. <verse eid="1KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Gebeli mwana waka Uri, akabhi chiongozi wa pandu pa Gileadi, inchi jejakalabhali kutawaliwa na Sihoni, nkolongwa wa Bhaamoli, na Ogu nkolongwa wa Bashani. Najombi akabhi chiongozi wa kanjika mu inchi jeniheji jokapi.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuneng'anela kwa utawala waka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Bhandu bha Yuda na Izilaeli bhakabhi bhamaheli ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku ja bahali, nabhombi bhakabhi na chilebhi chamaheli, bhakabhi bhakula, bhakunywa na kuhekalela. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akatawili mu ngolongwa yokapi kutumbu nkoka Eufulati mbaka ku inchi ja Bhafilisti, mbaka mu malindakilu gha Misili. Bhandu bha inchi yeniheyi bhakuntumakili na kuleta kode na ikabhi pahi jaka Solomoni, machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaki.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Chilebhi chaka Solomoni kwa lichobha limu, chakabhi uhembi laini madebi mia tatu sitini, na uhembi wa kawaida madebi mia saba na ishilini, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />ng'ombi komi yeinenipi, na ng'ombi ishilini yeidimakika, mambeleli na mbuhi mia jimu, papamu na holoku, mbabhala, swala na ingoku yeinonike.<verse eid="1KI 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Solomoni akatawili inchi jokapi kolijibhi lyobha wa nkoka Eufulati, kutumbu ku Tifusa mbaka ku muchi wa Gaza, jakabhi pahi ja utawala waki. Bhakolongwa bhokapi bha kolijibhi lyobha wa nkoka Eufulati bhakabhi pahi jaki, na akatami kwa lukwali na inchi yokapi ya pambipi. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Machobha ghokapi gha ukolongwa waka Solomoni, bhandu bha Yuda na bhandu bha Izilaeli, kutumbu ku muchi wa Dani mbaka ku Beeli Sheba, bhakatami kwa lukwali, kila mundu akabhi ahenga lihengu mu mighonda jaki ja mikongu ja mizabibu na mikongu ja mitini.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Solomoni akabhi na indamba elufu alubaini kwa ndandi ja kubheka magali ghaghahutakika na falasi, na manjolinjoli bhabhajendeha falasi elufu komi na ibheli. <verse eid="1KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Ihongozi komi na bhabheli bhala, kila jumu kwa mwehi waki ghoakapangiwi, bhakabhongini na kupeleka chilebhi cha kujaghanila kwa ndandi jaka nkolongwa Solomoni na bhokapi bhabhakula mu nyumba jaki. Machobha ghokapi ngachepakepiki chindu chokapi chela. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Zamu ja kila jumu wabhu pajahikiki bhakapeliki shaili na manyonyoli gha kulehakeha falasi yeihuta magali gha kuhutwa, na falasi yengi.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Chapanga akumpeki Solomoni mbulau na malangu ghamaheli namaa, bhelabhela akumpeki umanyi ukolongwa wangakupemeka ngati luhanga lwa mumaheku ja bahali. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Mbulau yaka Solomoni yakabhi ikolongwa kupeta mbulau ya bhandu bhokapi bha kolipitila lyobha na yakabhi ikolongwa kupeta mbulau ya ku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Akabhaweziki bhandu bhokapi kwa mbulau, akabhaweziki Esani, Mwezilahi jola, Hemani, Kalikoli na Dalida, bhana bhaka Maholi. Kumanyikana kwaki kukajaghanili ku inchi yokapi ya pambipi. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Najombi akatongiki mesali elufu itatu, na nyembu yaki yakabhi elufu jimu na nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Akalongalili matamu gha mikongu kutumbu mwelezi wa ku Lebanoni mbaka hisopu ghoumela mu lumatu. Bhelabhela akabholiki kubhokana na hinyama na injuni, hindu yeikwabha, na homba. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Bhandu bha kuhuma ku inchi yokapi bhakahikiki kujowanela malobhi gha mbulau yaka Solomoni, bhabhakatumakiki na bhakolongwa bhokapi bha pundema, bhabhakabhi bhajowini kubhokana na mbulau yaki.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni aliandaa kuchenga Nyumba jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:1-18">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 2:1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Najombi nkolongwa Hilamu, wa ku muchi wa Tilo, joakabhi nkochi waka Daudi, paakajowini malobhi kubha Solomoni abhi nkolongwa pandu paka tati waki, akabhatumiki bhatumika bhaki kwaka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Bhela Solomoni akapeliki ubholu aghoghu kwaka Hilamu: <verse eid="1KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Umanyi kwa ndandi ja ngondo yeakakomini tati wangu Daudi kuhuma ku ipambala yokapi, ngacheakaweziki kuchenga nyumba kwa ndandi ja lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, mbaka chikahi Bambo Chapanga paakunjangati kubhaweza maadui bhaki. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Nambu sajenu Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, ambekihi lukwali kila upambala, njeta adui wala lijambu lihakau. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Bhela mbala kuchenga Nyumba kwa ndandi ja lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakumpwaghi tati wangu Daudi, chikahi paakapwaghiki, ‘Mwana waku joananumbeka pa chitehu cha ukolongwa pandu paku, nde joanachenga Nyumba kwa ndandi ja lihina langu.’ <verse eid="1KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />Bhela, ubhalaghalakya bhandu bhaku nahuli mielezi ja ku Lebanoni jihekatwaje kwa ndandi jangu. Bhandu bhangu anabhalilomba na bhandu bhaku mu lihengu leniheli, nanatu ananabhalepa bhatumika bhaku ngati mowipwaghilaje. Kwa ndandi umanyi kubha ngachetubhi na mundu jokapi joabhi na umanyi wa kuheketa mikongu ngati mwehapa Bhasidoni.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Hilamu paakajowini ubholu waka Solomoni, akahekali namaa, akapwaghike, “Alumbalika Bambo Chapanga lalenu, kwa kumpeke Daudi mwana joabhi na mbulau ya kubhatawala bhandu bha inchi ajeji ngolongwa!” <verse eid="1KI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Bhela, Hilamu akumpelaki Solomoni ubholu, akapwaghaje, “Nyopalili ubholu ghounetile, nanatu anandenda ghokapi ghaupala mu kukupekeha mikongu ja mielezi na misonobali. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Bhandu bhangu anabhaheliya mapendi kuhuma ku Lebanoni mbaka ku bahali na kughakonga malundu malundu ghajebhalaje panani ja machi mbaka pandu pawinangihaje. Konihoku, anaghaghopuliwaji, na wehapa anaughajopalyaje. Kwa upambala waku, wehapa wimbekya chilebhi kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha munyumba jangu.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Bhela Hilamu akumpeki Solomoni mikongu jokapi ja mielezi na mikongu ja misonobali ngati moakapalile. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Najombi Solomoni akumpeki Hilamu ingano madebi laki ibheli na elufu alobaini, na mahuta manyahi gha zeituni madebi mia ibheli kila chaka, kwa ndandi ja bhandu bha munyumba jaki.<verse eid="1KI 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpeki Solomoni mbulau, ngati moakumpwaghile. Pakabhi na majonganu gha lukwali pachilanda jaka Hilamu na Solomoni, na bhokapi bhabheli bhakatendiki majetanganelu.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akabhongini bhandu elufu selasini kuhuma kila pandu mu inchi ja Izilaeli, nahuli bhatenda lihengu la kujomalakewa. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Akumbekiki Adonilamu kubha njemalela wabhu. Akabhaghabhiki bhandu bhanihabha mu mapogha ghatatu, bhandu elufu komi mu kila lipogha limu, aghapelakaje mapogha ghanihagha kwa zamu, mwehi ghumu ku Lebanoni na myehi jibheli kunyumba. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Solomoni akabhi na bhatotola hibwahila elufu sabini, na bhahongola maganga elufu semanini ku hitombi hoku, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />papamu na bhajemalela elufu itatu na mia itatu ambabhu bhakajemalili lihengu leniheli na kubhalongoha bhahengalihengu bhokapi. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Kwa amuli jaka nkolongwa, bhakahembiki maganga makolongwa na maganga manyahi nakanopi, nahuli ghahonguliwaje kwa ndandi ja kuchengela luhuli lwa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Bhela, bhenibhela nde mafundi bhaka Solomoni na mafundi bhaka Hilamu na bhandu bha muchi wa Gebali mobhakahongwili maganga na mbau ya kuchengela Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni achenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Solomoni akatumbwi kuchenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga mu chaka cha mia nchechi na semanini baada ja Bhaizilaeli kubhoka ku inchi ja Misili, chenihechi chakabhi chaka cha kachechi cha utawala waka Solomoni mu Izilaeli, ukabhi mwehi wa Zivu, yani mwehi wa kabheli wa chaka. <verse eid="1KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Nyumba jeniheji ambaju nkolongwa Solomoni akunchengi Bambo Chapanga jakabhi na ulachu wa mita ishilini na saba, upana wa mita tisa, na kimu cha mita komi na tatu na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Liwangala la palongi la Nyumba jaka Chapanga heji, lakabhi na upana wa mita ncheche na nusu, kutumbu upambala ghumu wa nyumba mbaka upambala ghongi wa nyumba, na ulachu wa nyumba jeniheji ukabhi mita tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji akajibhekiki madilisha ghaghabhonakini kubha mapana kwa mkati na mapepandau kwa kunja. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Akalenganaki yumba ya munkeghi kuyongolota Nyumba jokapi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli ikamulana na lumatu yokapi ya Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Yumba ya gholofa ja pahi nakanopi yakabhi na upana wa mita ibheli na sentimeta ishilini na nhwanu, yumba ya gholofa ja pachilanda yakabhi na upana wa mita ibheli na sentimeta sabini na nhwanu, na yumba ya gholofa ja kunani nakanopi yakabhi na upana wa mita itatu. Gholofa yeniheyi yakalekini kwa upana waki, maghambu Solomoni akakepishi pandu pa lumatu lwa kunja kujiyongolota nyumba, nahuli boliti ngaikamulana na lumatu ya Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Mu chikahi cha kuchenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji, ngachepajowaniki nyundu pandu pa kuchenga nyumba heji, wala chombu chokapi chela cha choma, maghambu jakachengakiki kwa maganga ghaghakabhi ghahonguliwi na kulenganakeka tayali koghakabhi ghatolakeka hoku.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Ndyangu wa kujingalila chumba cha pahi nakanopi chakabhi upambala wa kunkachi wa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. Mkati kukabhi na chikwelelu ambachu bhandu bhakaweziki kukwela nahuli kujenda ku gholofa ja pachilanda na ku gholofa ja katatu. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Bhela Solomoni akachengiki Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga na kujomola, najombi akabhekiki nhwaghala kwa boliti na mbau ya mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akachengiki yumba ya munkeghi kuyongolota Nyumba jokapi jaka Bambo Chapanga, yeyakabhi na kimu cha mita ibheli na sentimita ishilini na nhwanu kwa chumba cha pahi, chumba cha pachilanda, na chumba cha kunani nakanopi. Yumba heyi yakalombini na Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji kwa boliti ya mielezi.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Solomoni, <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Kubhokana na Nyumba jenjenu jeuchenga, ngati anaujengalela amuli yangu, na kuighoha shelia yangu, na kughakamula malaghalakilu ghangu ghokapi na kughatii, kwa kupetela wehapa anandimiza mambu ghokapi ghanakundaghili tati waku Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Nepani anandama pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli, nanatu nganabhaleki bhandu bhangu Izilaeli ng'o.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Bhela Solomoni akachengiki Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga na kujomola.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapambu gha mkati ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:8-14">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 3:8-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Akaluyekalili lumatu lwaki lwa mkati kwa mbau ya mielezi, akaikomangalili mu lumatu kutumbula sakafu ja Nyumba jaka Chapanga mbaka ku boliti ya nhwaghala, na kujala pa sakafu ja Nyumba jaka Chapanga kwa mbau ya misonobali. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Chumba cha mkati, chechalowakiki Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, chakachengakiki mu pandu pa kunyuma ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. Chakabhi chichengakiki kwa mbau ya mielezi kutumbula pa sakafu mbaka ku nhwaghala, na ulachu waki ukabhi wa mita tisa. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Chumba chikolongwa chechakabhi palongi ja Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, chakabhi na ulachu wa mita komi na nane. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Mbau ya mielezi yeyabhekakiki mu lumatu lwa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji, kwa mkati yakabhi ipambakiki kwa ulenganesu wa mongu na malobha ghaghaliyekwile. Kila pandu pakabhi payekaliwi kwa mbau ya mielezi, wala njeta liganga lelabhonakini.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Mkati nakanopi ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji, Solomoni akalenganakili chumba ambamu akabhekiki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Chumba chenihechi chakabhi na ulachu wa mita tisa, upana wa mita tisa na kimu cha mita tisa. Akachiyekiki chumba chenihechi kwa zahabu jinyahi, bhelabhela akayekiki pandu pa kubhokeha nhupu kwa mbau ya mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Solomoni akayekiki pandu pa mkati ja Nyumba jaka Chapanga heji kwa zahabu jinyahi, akabekiki mikufu ja zahabu kutumbu upambala ghumu mbaka upambala ghongi palongi ja chumba cha mkati, na akapayekiki kwa zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Solomoni akapayekiki pandu pa mkati ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji kwa zahabu jinyahi, bhelabhela akayekiki meza jokapi ja kubhokeha nhupu ya kuhuwa ubani jejakabhi mkati ja chumba cha mkati hechi kwa zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Mu chumba cha mkati nakanopi hechi akalenganaki ulenganesu wa makelubi ghabheli ghaghabhi na mapapila kwa mbau ya mizeituni, kila jumu akabhi na kimu cha mita ncheche na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Lipapanila limu laka kelubi hoju lakabhi na ulachu wa mita ibheli na nusu, na lipapanila lengi lakabhi na mita ibheli na nusu, bhela ulachu kutumbu ujomukelu wa lipapanila limu mbaka ujomukelu wa lipapanila lengi ukabhi mita nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Ulachu wa mapapanila ghaka kelubi wa kabheli lakabhi na ulachu wa mita nhwanu, ihumbi yokapi ibheli heyi yakalengini kwa ipemu na kwa kila chindu. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Kimu chaka kelubi jumu akabhi mita ncheche na nusu, na kelubi jongi akabhi bhelabhela. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Akaghabhekiki makelubi ghanihagha mkati ja chumba cha mkati nakanopi ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, koni mapapanila ghabhu ghakabya ghahatambuliwi. Lipapanila laka kelubi jumu lakagusiki mu lumatu lumu, na lipapanila laka kelubi jongi jola lakagusiki ku lumatu longi, na mapapanila ghabhu ghangi ghakagusini pachilanda ja chumba. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Akaghayekiki makelubi ghanihagha kwa zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Panani ja lumatu yokapi kujiyongolota Nyumba jaka Chapanga, lumatu ya yumba ya mkati na lumatu ya yumba ya kunja, akaipambiki kwa micholu ja makelubi, mikongu ja mitende, na malobha ghaghaliyekwile. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Bhelabhela akajiyekiki sakafu yokapi ya yumba ya mkati na yumba ya kunja ya Nyumba jaka Chapanga kwa zahabu.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Pundyangu wa kujingalila mu chumba cha mkati nakanopi akalenganakili milyangu kwa mbau ya nkongu wa mzeituni. Ngelaketi na mapanda ghaki ghakalenganakili kwa liumbu la pembi nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Panani ja milyangu jibheli ja mbau ya mzeituni heji, akalenganakili makelubi, mikongu ja mitende, na malobha ghaghaliyekwile, bhelabhela akaghayekiki makelubi hagha na mikongu ja mitende heji kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Bhelabhela akalenganaki ngelaketi jejibhi na pembi nchechi kwa mikongu ja mizeituni, kwa ndandi ja ndyangu wa kujingalila mu liwangala likolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Kukabhi na milyangu jibheli jejakaweziki kuhatambuka jejakalenganakiki kwa mbau ya msonobali, na kila ghumu ukabhi na bawaba ambaju jakaweziki kulikunja kila chipandi panani ya chengi. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Panani ja iyekalelu ya milyangu heji akalenganakili makelubi, mikongu ja mitende na malobha ghaghaliyekwi, na kuiyeka kwa zahabu jejijochakiki wichu panani ja micholu jeniheji.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Bhelabhela akachengiki liwangala la mkati safu itatu ya maganga ghaghahonguliwi, na safu jimu ja boliti ya mielezi yeipambakiki wichu.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Luhuli lwa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji, Solomoni akaluchengiki mu chaka cha kachechi wa utawala waki, mu mwehi wa Zivu, yani mwehi wa kahanu. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Mu chaka cha komi na jimu, mwehi wa Buli, yani mwehi wa nane, Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji jakabhi jijomwiki, na lihengu lakabhi lijomwiki ngati mokwapangakike. Bhela Solomoni akatumi hyaka saba kujichenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga heji.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s">Nyumba ja kikolongwa jaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomoni akalichengili nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa, najombi jakuntoliki hyaka komi na itatu kujomola nyumba jaki jokapi. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Bhela, Solomoni akachengiki nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa jejalowakiki lihina la Chitengu cha Lebanoni, ulachu waki ukabhi mita alobaini na ncheche na nusu, upana waki ukabhi mita ishilini na ibheli na sentimita ishilini na nhwanu, na kimu chaki chakabhi mita komi na itatu na nusu. Jakachengakiki panani ja safu nchechi ya nguzu ya mielezi, nguzu ambayu yakakamulakili boliti ya mielezi kwa upambala wa kunani. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Kila safu jakabhi na nguzu komi na nhwanu, bhela yokapi kwa papamu yakabhi nguzu alobaini na nhwanu. Yumba yeyachengakiki panani ja nguzu yeniheyi, akaibheki dali ja mbau ya mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Madilisha ghaki ghakabhekakiki panani kwa safu itatu, ghakatehi kulingalanila. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Milyangu jokapi na ngelaketi yakabhi ya mlaba, yakabhi upambala wa kulongi mu safu itatu, yakatehi kulingalanila.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Akachengiki liwangala la nguzu, ambalu ulachu waki ukabhi mita ishilini na ibheli na sentimita ishilini na nhwanu, na upana waki ukabhi mita komi na itatu na nusu. Palongi ja lichengu leniheli kukabhi na balaza. Palongi ja balaza kukabhi na nguzu, na palongi ja nguzu yeniheyi pakabhi na nhwaghala uchoku. <verse eid="1KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Solomoni akachengiki liwangala la chitehu cha ukolongwa, liwangala la kutemula matakilu gha bhandu. Panihapa pakalowakiki Liwangala la Utemulu. Liwangala leniheli lakapambakiki kwa mbau ya mielezi kutumbu pa sakafu mbaka kugholu.<verse eid="1KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Nyumba jaki ja kutama mweni, jejakabhi kunyuma ja liwangala la utemulu, jakabhi jakachengakiki kwa ntundu ghumu ngati yengi yela. Bhelabhela Solomoni akachengiki nyumba ja kikolongwa jejilengana na liwangala likolongwa kwa ndandi jaka mwali waka Falao, joakabhi antowile. <verse eid="1KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Nyumba yeniheyi yokapi yakachengakiki kwa maganga gha mbija yamaheli kutumbu luhuli mbaka kunani, maganga ambaghu ghakabhi ghabhachakiki kwa hipemu na kuheketwa kwa msumenu upambala wa mkati na wa kunja. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Luhuli ya nyumba yeniheyi yakachengakiki kwa maganga makolongwa ghaghabhi wichu, ghaghabhi na ulachu wa mita itatu na nusu, na upana wa mita ncheche na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Pandu pa panani pakachengakiki kwa maganga manyahi nakanopi ghaghahekitwi kwa hipemu, na boliti ya mielezi. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Liwangala likolongwa lela lakayongalwitwi na lumatu lwa misitali jitatu ja maganga ghaghabhachakiki, na msitali ghumu wa boliti ya mielezi yeilenganakiki wichu, ngati molakabheli liwangala la mkati la Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, na balaza jaki.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu laka Hilamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 2:13-14">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 2:13-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akatumiki bhandu ku Tilo kujenda kundoha Hilamu. <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />Hilamu akabhi mwana waka mbomba joakaweliwi na ndomi waki wa likabila laka Nafutali, na tati waki akabhi mundu wa ku Tilo, bhelabhela akabhi ndenganakela wa shaba. Hilamu akabhi na mbulau yamaheli na umanyi, na ndenganakela mnyahi wa mahengu ghokapi gha shaba. Bhela akahikiki kwaka nkolongwa Solomoni na kuhenga lihengu lokapi lela leakapekiwi.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguzu ibheli ya shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 3:15-17">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 3:15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hilamu akalenganaki nguzu ibheli ya shaba, kila jimu jakabhi na ulachu wa mita tisa, na kuyongolotwa kwa mita nhwanu na nusu. Mkati ja nguzu yeniheyi kukabhi na limboghi ambalu kunenepa kwaki kukabhi kwa sentimita ibheli. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Kabheti akalenganaki mataji ghabheli gha shaba ja kuyeyusha, nahuli kughabheka panani ja nguzu yeniheyi, kila litaji lakabhi na kimu cha mita ibheli na sentimita ishilini na nhwanu kujenda kunani. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Akalenganaki wavu wa mikufu ghoakaulokiki mu mapambu ghanighala panani ja nguzu saba yela kwa kila litaji. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Akalenganaki makomamanga mu misitali jibheli kuyongolota kila wavu kughapamba mataji ghaghabhi panani ja nguzu. Akatendiki bhenibhela kwa kila nguzu.<verse eid="1KI 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Mataji ghaghakabhi panani ja nguzu mu balaza, ghakabhi mu liumbu la lilobha la yungiyungi, ulachu waki lakabhi mita jimu na sentimita nane. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Panani ja mataji gha nguzu ibheli yela, bhelabhela yakabhi panani ja pandu pa kuyongolota papakapitali pambipi na wavu yela. Pakabhi na maumbu mia ibheli gha mapambiku gha makomamanga, ghakapangakiki misitali jibheli kuliyongolota kila litaji.<verse eid="1KI 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Hilamu akaijemiki nguzu yeniheyi mu balaza ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. Nguzu ja upambala wa kunkachi akajilohiki Yakini, na jela jeakajijemiki upambala wa kungondi akajilohiki Boazi. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Mataji ghaghakabhi panani ghakabhi na maumbu gha yungiyungi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:22">Bhela lihengu la kulenganakela nguzu lakajomwike.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liteleku likolongwa la shaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:2-5">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 4:2-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Hilamu akalenganaki liteleku likolongwa lelalowakiki Bahali ja choma. Lakabhi na liumbu lilobha la kuyongolota, lelakabhi na upana wa mita ncheche na nusu, kutumbu ukengu ghumu mbaka ukengu ghongi, na ulachu wa mita ibheli na sentimita ishilini na nhwanu, na kuliyongolota liteleku heli lakabhi na mita komi na tatu na nusu. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Pahi ja ukengu waki kuliyongolota liteleku heli, kukabhi na misitali jibheli ja itamilu yeibhi ngati liumbu la lilobha la mongu, kila chimu chakabhi na ulachu wa mita komi na itatu na nusu. Itamilu yeniheyi yakalenganakiki chikahi chelachela liteleku heli palakabhi lilenganakeka. <verse eid="1KI 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Liteleku leniheli lakabhekakiki panani ja ulenganesu wa ng'ombi ikambaku komi na ibheli yela: Itatu yakalingali upambala wa kungondi, itatu yakalingali upambala wa kolijibhi lyobha, itatu yakalingali upambala wa kunkachi, na itatu yakalingali upambala wa kolipita lyobha. Liteleku leniheli lakabhekakiki panani ja ng'ombi ikambaku yela, na upambala wabhu wa kunyuma yakatehi kulingalanila. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Kunenepa kwa liteleku heli lakabhi na sentimita saba na nusu. Ukengu waki ukalengini na ukengu wa chikombi chechibhonikana ngati liumbu la lilobha la yungiyungi. Liteleku lenilela lakabhi liweza kutwele machi lita elufu alubaini.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hitamilu ya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Hilamu akalenganaki hitamilu komi ya shaba, kila chitamilu chakabhi na ulachu wa mita jimu na sentimita nane, upana waki ukabhi mita jimu na sentimita nane, na kimu chaki chakabhi mita jimu na sentimita ishilini na nhwanu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Hitamilu heyi yakalenganakiki anana: Yakabhi na mbau munkeghi yeyakamulini na nguzu. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Panani ja mbau heyi pakabhi na imong'umong'u ya lihimba, ng'ombi makambaku, na makelubi. Imong'umong'u ya lihimba heyi na ngo'mbi makambaku yakabhi iyekaliwi na kutandika mapambu ghaghalokakiki wichu. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Kila chitamilu chakabhi na maguludumu nchechi gha shaba, na yoma ya pachilanda ya kuyongoloha maguludumu ghanihagha, yakabhi ya shaba. Mu kona nchechi ya hitamilu heyi kukabhi na hikamulilu ya shaba kwa ndandi ja liteleku. Pambipi ja kila chikamulilu kukabhekakiki mapambu gha malobha ghaghalokakiki. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Mkati ja chitamilu kukabhi na mbekenyu ja lipala jejakabhi na ubhonikanu wa kuyongolota lelakabhi na kimu cha nusu mita. Mbekenyu heji ja lipala jakabhi ja kuyongolota, chitamilu chaki chakabhi na nusu mita. Kuyokolota ndomu waki hoghu kukajeghaliki micholu, hitamilu heyi yakabhi ya mlaba, wala nga ya kuyongolota. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Maguludumu nchechi ghaghakabhi pahi ja papi, na yoma ya pachilanda ya kuyongolotela maguludumu ghanihagha yakabhi ilombanishwi mu chitamilu. Mbekenyu ja kila liguludumu jakabhi sentimita sitini na sita. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Maguludumu ghakalenganakiki ngati gha magali gha ngondo gha kuhutakika, yoma ya pachilanda ya maguludumu, uyongolotu waki, mataluma ghaki na ikombi yaki yokapi yakabhi ya kuyeyusha. <verse eid="1KI 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Pahi ja kila chitamilu kukabhi na mataluma ncheche mu kona yaki, naghombi ghakakamulini na chitamilu. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Panani ja chitamilu kukabhi na utepe wa shaba wa kuyongolota ghoukabhi na kimu cha sentimita ishilini na ibheli. Hikamulilu na papi yakakamulini mu upambala wa kunani wa chitamilu. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Akabhekiki micholu ja makelubi, lihimba na mikongu ja mitende panani ja pamihu ja hikamulilu, na panani ja papi, mu kila mbekenyu jejakabhi, papamu na mataji ghaghalokakiki kuyongolota ipambala yokapi. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Bhenibhela nde Hilamu moakalenganakili hitamilu komi yela. Yokapi yakabhi ya kuyeyusha, yakabhi na chipemu chimu, na yokapi yakabhi ya ntundu ghumu.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Hilamu akalenganaki mateleku komi gha shaba, liteleku limu kwa kila chitamilu. Kila liteleku lakabhi na upana wa mita jimu na sentimita nane, na lakabhi na uwezu wa kutwele machi lita mia nane. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Akabekiki hitamilu nhwanu upambala wa kunkachi wa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, na hitamilu nhwanu upambala wa kungondi wa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. Akalibekiki liteleku lela pa kona ja upambala wa kunkachi wa Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hindu ya mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 4:11-5:1">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 4:11-5:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Hilamu akalenganakili mateleku, sepetu na mabakuli gha kumichila. Bhela, Hilamu akajomwi lihengu lokapi mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga ngati nkolongwa Solomoni moakundaghalakile. <verse eid="1KI 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />Nguzu ibheli, mabakuli ghabheli gha mataji ghaghakabhi panani ja kila nguzu, wavu ibheli kwa ndandi ja kuyekalela mataji ghabheli hagha ghaghabhi panani ja nguzu, <verse eid="1KI 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />makomamanga mia ncheche kwa ndandi ja wavu ibheli heyi, misitali jibheli ja makomamanga kwa kila wavu, nahuli kughapamba mataji ghabheli hagha ghaghabhi panani ja nguzu. <verse eid="1KI 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />Bhelabhela, Hilamu akalenganaki hitamilu komi, na mateleku komi panani ja hitamilu, <verse eid="1KI 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />na liteleku limu na imong'umong'u ya makambaku gha ng'ombi komi na ibheli pahi ja liteleku heli. <verse eid="1KI 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />Mateleku, sepetu na mabakuli gha kumichila, na yombu yokapi yeyakabhi mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, ambayu Hilamu akabhi andenganakili nkolongwa Solomoni, yakabhi ya shaba jejigholulike. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Hindu yokapi heyi nkolongwa akalaghalaki ilenganakikaje kwa kuyeyusha mu uwanda wa Yoludani, pandu pa lutopi lolubhi pachilanda ja Sukoti na Saletani. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomoni ngacheapemiki kutopa kwa hindu yeniheyi jokapi, maghambu yakabhi yamaheli namaa, nde ndandi kutopa kwaki ngachewamanyakine.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Bhelabhela Solomoni akalenganaki hindu yokapi yeyakabhi mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga: Meza ja zahabu ja kubhokeha nyambiku, meza ya zahabu ja kubhekela mabumunda palongi jaka Chapanga, <verse eid="1KI 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />Inala ya taa ya zahabu jinyahi yeyabhekakiki palongi ja chumba cha mkati, nhwanu upambala wa kunkachi na nhwanu upambala wa kungondi, malobha, taa, na makoleu gha kujokule moto, yokapi yakabhi ya zahabu, <verse eid="1KI 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />na masinia, ikombi, mikasi ja kulenganakalela utambi, mabakuli, mbundi ya kujokule moto, na chetezu, yokapi yakabhi ya zahabu jinyahi, bhelabhela kukabhi na bawaba ya zahabu kwa ndandi ja milyangu ja chumba cha mkati nakanopi, yani Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, na bawaba ya milyangu ja liwangala likolongwa la Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni akajomwi lihengu lokapi la Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, akaijingihi mkati hindu yokapi ambayu Daudi tati waki akabhi aibhekiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga: Yani madini gha feza, zahabu na hindu ya mbija yamaheli, bhela, akaibhekiki mu chikoku cha Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku la Lulaghilu liletakeka mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 5:2-6:2">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 5:2-6:2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni akabhalohiki palongi jaki ihongozi bhokapi bha Izilaeli ku Yelusalemu hoku, na ihongozi bhokapi bha makabila, na ihongozi bha ngolu ya Izilaeli, nahuli bhakaletaje Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga kuhuma ku muchi wa Sayuni, yani muchi waka Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Chikahi cha Uwangalalu wa Etanimu, yani mwehi wa saba, bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakalibhongini kwaka nkolongwa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Chikahi ihongozi bhokapi pabhakapiti, bhapenganyambiku bhakatotwi Lisanduku la Lulaghilu. <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />Nabhombi bhakalibhohiki Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga, na Lihema Lihuhu, papamu na yombu yokapi ihuhu yeyakabhi mkati ja Lihema heli. Bhapenganyambiku na Bhalawi nde bhabhakaitotwili hindu yeniheyi. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Nkolongwa Solomoni na lipogha lokapi la Bhaizilaeli bhakalibhongini palongi ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, nabhombi bhakabhohiki nyambiku yamaheli ya mambeleli na ng'ombi yangakubhalangika. <verse eid="1KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Bhela bhapenganyambiku bhakalijingihi Lisanduku la Lulaghilu laka Bambo Chapanga mbaka pandu paki, mu chumba cha mkati cha Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, yani Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, na kulibheka pahi ja mapapanila gha ulenganesu wa makelubi ghala. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Makelubi ghanihagha ghakahatambwili mapapanila ghabhu panani ja pandu pa Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, makelubi ghanihagha ghakayekiki Lisanduku lela na mipeku jaki ja kutotulela. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Mipeku heji jakabhi milachu namaa, incha yaki yakabhonakini mu liwangala, yani Pandu Pahuhu palongi ja chumba cha mkati, yani Pandu Pahuhu Nakanopi, nambu ngacheyabhonakini kunja ja Pandu Pahuhu. Najombi mipeku heji jikali jibhi mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Mkati ja Lisanduku la Lulaghilu ngachekukabhili na chindu chengi chokapi chela, nambu pela hibau ibheli ya maganga ambayu Musa akabhi abhekiki mkati jaki ku chitombi cha Holebu hoku, pandu ambapu Bambo Chapanga akatendiki Lulaghilu na Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhi bhajomwi kubhoka ku inchi ja Misili.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Bhapenganyambiku pabhakabhokiki mu Pandu Pahuhu, lihundi lakatweli mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Nabhombi bhapenganyambiku ngachebhakaweziki kuhenga lihengu labhu kwa ndandi ja lihundi lela, maghambu ulumbalilu waka Bambo Chapanga ukatwelili mu Nyumba jaki. <verse eid="1KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Bhela Solomoni akapwaghike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">“Bambo Chapanga akapwaghiki kubha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:12">anatama mu lubhendu lukolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Chakaka, nukuchengili Nyumba jinyahi namaa ja kutama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1KI 8:13">pandu paku pa kutama mileli.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni abhatangazi bhandu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:3-11">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 6:3-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Bhela, lipogha lokapi la Bhaizilaeli palakabhi lijemiki panihapa, nkolongwa Solomoni, akabhang'anambukili na kubhapengalela. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Akapwaghiki, “Alumbalika Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, ambaju kwa uwezu waki atendiki lela leakundaghili tati wangu Daudi kwa ndomu waki mweni. Kwa ndandi akapwaghiki, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Kutumbula lichobha lenakabhabhohiki bhandu bhangu Izilaeli kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, ngachenakahawili muchi mu likabila lokapi lela la Izilaeli nahuli Nyumba jangu jichengakika monihomu, nahuli bhandu bhanyojabya monihomu, nambu nunhawi Daudi kubhatawala bhandu bhangu Izilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />Solomoni akajendali kupwagha, “Bhela, tati wangu Daudi akaholalili muntima waki kuchenga nyumba kwa ndandi ja kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi tati wangu Daudi, ‘Kwa kubha muntima waku ukaholalili kuchenga Nyumba kwa ndandi jangu nepani, ukatendiki wichu kubha na lijambu aleli muntima waku. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Hata bhela, ngawehapa weanaunjengila Nyumba nepani, nambu mwana waku, joanaumbelakaje, jombi nde joanachenga Nyumba kwa ndandi jangu.’<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />“Bhela Bambo Chapanga atimizi chilanga cheakabhekike: Nanatu nyingili pandu paka tati wangu Daudi, na kutama pa chitehu cha ukolongwa cha Izilaeli, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakalaghile, bhelabhela njengiki Nyumba ja kunjojabhela Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Nakanopi ja ghanihagha, mekiki pandu pa kubheka Lisanduku la Lulaghilu, ambamu mkati jaki kubhi na Lulaghilu lola lwaka Bambo Chapanga loakatendiki na akahoko bhitu chikahi paakabhabhohiki ku inchi ja Misili.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malobhu ghaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 6:12-42">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 6:12-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Bhela Solomoni akajemiki palongi ja meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku paka Bambo Chapanga, palongi ja lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli, na kukweha mabhoku ghaki kunani kumahunde, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />na kupwagha, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, njeta Chapanga jongi ngati wehapa kunani kumahunde wala pahi pundema, wehapa ughoha Lulaghilu lwaku lwa upalu, na kubhapeke chiha bhatumika bhaku bhabhatama koni bhakabya bhakutii wehapa kwa mtima wokapi. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Utimizi chilanga chaku kwaka mtumika waku tati wangu Daudi, kwa ndomu waku ukalaghili na kwa uwezu waku utehi kutimiza, ngati mokubheli lalenu. <verse eid="1KI 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, bhelabhela nukulobha untimazya chilanga chela cheukundaghi mtumika waku tati wangu Daudi, ukapwaghaje, ‘Machobha ghokapi anaukubha na mbelakeka wa kutama pa chitehu cha kikolongwa cha Izilaeli, ngati bhabhelakeka bhaku anabhahengiki ghokapi wichu kwa kujenda palongi jangu, ngati wehapa moujendi palongi jangu.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Bhela, wenga wa Chapanga wa Izilaeli, nukulobha utimizaje lilobhi laku lela leukundaghi mtumika waku tati wangu Daudi kwa kulitenda lipitalyaje.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Nambu Chapanga, bho, chakaka le anautama pundema? Ngati mbengu, hata mbengu ya kunani nakanopi ngacheyukujaghanila, bho, anajukujaghanya bholi nyumba ajeji jenjengike? <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Hata bhela, wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, nepani mtumika waku nukulobha unyowanyaje malobhu ghangu na kuniyanga malobhu ghangu ghanukulobha lalenu. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Ujighohaje nyumba jaku jenu ikilu na muhi, pandu ambapu ukapwaghiki, ‘Machobha ghokapi anangubha monihomu.’ Nahuli ujowanyaje malobhu ghangu nepani mtumika waku panihika pandu pambani kulobha. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Ujowanyaje malobhu ghangu nepani mtumika waku na gha bhandu bhaku bhandu bha Izilaeli chikahi pabhalobha bhakabya pandu pambani. Ujowanyaje kuhuma kunani kumahundi, pandu pa matamu ghaku, na chikahi paujowana, utulekakyaje.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Ngati mundu anaanhokihi njaki na kupalakika kulapa, anahikiki na kulapa palongi ja meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku mkati ja Nyumba jenjenu, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />bhela, wehapa ujowanaje kuhuma kunani kumahundi, na ubhatemula bhatumika bhaku. Jola joabhi na mahakau untemula kulengana na mahakau ghaki, na jwangakubha na mahakau umpekya ghamboni kulengana na ulongwana waki.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Ngati bhandu bhaku bha Izilaeli pabhikubha bhalepalili na maadui bhabhu kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghabhakutendili wehapa, pabhakung'ambukyaje na kulijetakela lihina laku, ngati anabhalobhiki kulekakewa kwaku wehapa kwa kuliheleya mu Nyumba jenjenu, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />bhela, ubhajowanyaje kuhuma kunani kumahundi hoku, ubhalekakyaje mahoku gha bhandu bhaku Izilaeli, na ubhakelabhuhaje mu inchi jeukabhapekihi akatati bhabhu.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Ngati mbengu anaikongakiki, hata njeta iyula, kwa ndandi bhandu bhaku bhakutendili mahoku wehapa, ngati anabhalobhiki pandu pambani na kulijetakela lihina laku, na kughaleka mahoku ghabhu, chikahi chela paubhalakalila, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />bhela, ubhajowanyaje kuhuma kunani kumahundi, na ubhalekakyaje mahoku gha bhatumika bhaku bhandu bha Izilaeli. Ubhabholaje matamu manyahi ghaghapalika kutama, na ukabhatonyila iyula mu inchi jabhu jenjenu, inchi jeukabhapeki bhandu bhaku kubha jabhu bheni.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Ngati mu inchi anapajingi injala, chitamu chikolongwa, kulepa kubha na iyula, chitamu cha mahunu, nzige au mapahi, au anangati bhandu bhaku bhayongalitwi na maadui bhabhu mu muchi wabhu wokapi ghola, ngati anakubhi na lilapuliku lokapi lela au chitamu chokapi chela, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />bhela, ujowanyaje kusali na malobhu ghokapi ghabhilobha bhandu bhaku bha Izilaeli, au ghailobha mundu jokapi jola, kila jumu anaamanyi mang'ahiku gha muntima waki mweni, najombi anaakulobhiki kwa kuhatambula chiwoku chaki kulolakela ku Nyumba jenjenu, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />bhela, ujowanyaje kuhuma kunani kumahunde, mu matamu ghaku. Ulekakyaje na utenda chela chekipalika, na unhengila kila mundu kulengana na matendu ghaki, maghambu whepa pela kanjika jaku nde weujimanya mitima ja bhandu bhokapi, <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />nahuli bhatama kwa kukutopela wehapa chikahi chokapi pabhitamaje mu inchi jeukabhapekihi akatati bhitu.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Bhelabhela hata ngeni ambaju nga jumu wa bhandu bhaku bha Izilaeli, nambu ahikiki kuhuma ku inchi ja kutali kwa ndandi ja kukujojabhe wehapa, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />kwa ndandi bhandu bha inchi nayenge anabhajowana sifa yaku na kubhokana na makili ghaku, mundu jonihoju ngati anahikiki kukulobha mu Nyumba ajeji, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />bhela, ujowanyaje kuhuma kunani kumahunde, pandu pa matamu ghaku, ukatendaje lokapi ambalu ngeni hoju anaakulobhaje, nahuli bhandu bha inchi yokapi pundema bhakumanya wehapa, na kukutii wehapa ngati mobhatende bhandu bhaku Izilaeli, na bhapata kumanya kubha nyumba ajeji jenjengiki, nde pandu pa kukujojabhe wehapa.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Chikahi bhandu bhaku pabhijenda kukomana ngondo na maadui bhabhu, pokapi paubhapelakaje, nabhombi pabhilobha kwaku wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga koni bhakalolakya ku muchi ghouhawili na Nyumba jenukuchengili kwa ndandi ja kukujojabhe wehapa, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />bhela, ujowanyaje kusali kwabhu na malobhu ghabhu kunani kumahundi hoku, na ubhahengila ngati moipalakila.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Chikahi pabhakutendila mahoku wehapa, maghambu njeta mundu jwangakutenda mahoku, nanau anaubhayomili na kubhaleka bhalepalyaje na maadui bhabhu, hata kutolakeka kwa makili mbaka ku inchi ja maadui bhabhu jejibhi kutali au ja pambipi, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />na ngati anabhang'anambwiki mitima yabhu mu inchi jebhapelikwi kwa kutolakeka kwa makili, nabhombi anabhang'anambwiki na kukulelela wehapa kwa kulobha kulekakewa mahoku ghabhu, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Tuhengiki mahoku, tuhobhiki na kutenda mahakau,’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />bhelabhela chikahi chebhikubha mu inchi ja maadui bhabhu, anabhang'anambwiki kwa mtima wabhu wokapi na kwa roho yabhu yokapi, na ngati anabhakulobhiki koni bhakalolakya ku inchi yabhu jeukabhapekihi akatati bhabhu, analolakili ku muchi ghongoni ghouhawili na Nyumba jenjenu jenukuchengili kwa ndandi ja kukujojabhe wehala, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />bhela, ujowanyaje kusali na malobhu ghabhu kuhuma kunani kumahundi hoku, pandu pa matamu ghaku, na ubhahengila ngati moipalakila. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Ubhalekakya mahoku gha bhandu bhaku, ghabhehengiki kwa kukupenga wehapa, ubhabhonila chiha palongi ja maadui bhabhu, nahuli nabhombi maadui bhapata kubhabhone chiha. <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />Maghambu bhanihabha nde bhandu bhaku wamwete, bhaubhabhohiki ku inchi ja Misili, kobhakabhi bhapata mang'ahiku makolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Ujowanyaje lilobhu laka mtumikwa waku, na lilobhu la bhatumika bhaku, Izilaeli, nanau ubhajowanyaje kila pabhakulobha. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Kwa ndandi ukabhahawili bhombi kuhuma kwa bhandu bha inchi yengi yokapi ya pundema nahuli bhakubha bhaku wamwete, ngati moukapwaghile kwa kupetela kwaka mtumika waku Musa, chikahi wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga, paukabhabhohiki akatati bhitu kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilobhu la kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Chikahi Solomoni paakajomwi kulobha molobhu ghanihagha kwaka Bambo Chapanga, akajinwiki kuhuma palongi ja meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku jaka Bambo Chapanga, pandu paakabhi achikime, koni mabhoku ghaki akabya aghakwehiki kunani kumahunde. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Akajemiki na kulipengalela lipogha lokapi la bhandu bha Izilaeli kwa sauti ngolongwa, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="1KI 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Alumbalikaje Bambo Chapanga, joabhapekihi bhandu bhaki Izilaeli lukwale, ngati moakabhi alaghile. Atimizi chilanga yaki yokapi inyahi, yeakalaghili kwa kupetela kwaka mtumika waki Musa. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, na akubhaje papamu na nepani, ngati moakabheli papamu na akatati bhitu, ngawatuleka, wala ngawatulekela ng'o. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Jombi na ajing'anambula mitima jitu kwaki, nahuli tujengalya indela yaki, koni tukakamula amuli yaki, shelia yaki, na malaghalakilu ghaki, ghaakabhapeki akatati bhitu. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Bhela, malobhi ghangu aghagha, ghanobhiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na ghakubhaje pambipi na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, ikilu na muhe, nahuli najombi anjangatya mtumika waki, na bhandu bhaki Izilaeli, nahuli kila lichobha abhajangatya ghala ghabhapala. <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />Nahuli bhandu bha inchi yengi yokapi ya pundema bhamanya kubha wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, nde Chapanga, wala njeta Chapanga jongi. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Nanamu mkubha bhalongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga witu, kwa kutama kwa kujengalela malaghalakilu ghaki, na kutii amuli yaki yokapi, ngati montende chikahi chenu.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga jibhekakeka palongi jaki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 7:4-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhabhakabhi papamu naku, bhakabhohiki nyambiku ya kujochakeka palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Najombi nkolongwa Solomoni akumboki Bambo Chapanga nyambiku ya lukwali: Ng'ombi elufu ishilini na ibheli, na mambeleli laki jimu na elufu ishilini. Bhenibhela nde nkolongwa na bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli mobhakajibheki Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga palongi jaki. <verse eid="1KI 8:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Lichobha lelalela nkolongwa Solomoni akabhekiki pandu pa pachilanda ja liwangala lelakabhi palongi ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, panihapa nde paakabhokili nyambiku ya kujochakeka, nyambiku ya mahunu, mahuta gha nyambiku ya lukwali. Akahengiki bhenibhela maghambu pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku papalenganakiki kwa shaba pala, ngachepajaghanili kubheka nyambiku yeniheyi yokapi.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni kwa chikahi cha machobha saba, na machobha ghani saba nakanopi, yani machobha komi na ncheche, akatendiki uwangalalu papamu na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Pakabhi na bhandu bhamaheli namaa, nabhombi bhakahumiki ku ujingalilu wa kungonde ja Hamati, mbaka ku ulindakanilu wa kunkache wa kikoka cha Misili. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Lichobha la nane, Solomoni akabhatawiki bhandu bhabhokaje, nabhombi bhakumpengalili nkolongwa, bhakakelawiki kunyumba yabhu koni bhakahekalyaje kwa ndandi ja mambu ghokapi ghamboni ambaghu Bambo Chapanga aghatendiki kwa ndandi jaka mtumika waki Daudi, na kwa bhandu bhaki Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ampitali Solomoni mala ja kabheli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 7:11-22">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 7:11-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Nkolongwa Solomoni paakajomwi kuchenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga na nyumba ja kikolongwa, na kujomola kughahenga ghokapi hagha ghaakapaliki kuhenga, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpitalili Solomoni mala ja kabheli ngati moakumpitalili ku muchi wa Gibeoni hoku. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Solomoni, “Nyowini kusali kwaku na malobhu ghaku ghaunobhike, nijigholwili Nyumba ajeji jeunjengili, nahuli bhandu bhanyojabya nepani monihomu mileli. Ananijighohaji na kujipala machobha ghokapi. <verse eid="1KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />Nanau ngati anaujendiki kwa mtima wamboni kwangu na kubha na ulongwana ngati tati waku Daudi moakatendili, na anaukamwi amuli yangu na kughahenga ghokapi ghanukulaghalakila, kwa kughaghoha malaghalakilu ghangu na shelia yangu, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />bhela, nepani ananichitenda chitehu chaku cha kikolongwa chitamakya panani ja Izilaeli mileli, ngati monundaghili tati waku Daudi, nakapwaghaje, ‘Ngawilepi kubha na mundu wa kutama panani ja chitehu chaku cha kikolongwa cha Izilaeli.’ <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />Nambu ngati mwehapa na bhana bhinu anamung'anambwiki na kuileka shelia yangu, na amuli yangu yenumpeki mwehapa, na kujenda kutumakila ichapanga nayengi na kuijojabhela, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />bhela, ananabhabhoha bhandu bhangu Izilaeli kuhuma mu inchi jenjenu jenabhapekihe, bhelabhela na Nyumba jenjenu jenijigholwili kwa ndandi ja kunyojabhe nepani. Ananijilekala kutali na nepani, na kujitenda chindu cha kupohakeka lihamu na bhandu, na Bhaizilaeli anabhatondulikaje kwa bhandu bha inchi yokapi. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Hata ngati nyumba jenjenu jihutila namaa sajenu, nambu chikahi bhandu pabhipeta pambipi jaki anabhakangachaje na kulongama, bhakapwaghaje, ‘Bho, maghambu kiki Bambo Chapanga ajitendili mambu aghagha inchi ajeji na Nyumba ajeji?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Bhandu bhangi anabhayangaje, ‘Maghambu bhundekiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wabhu, joakabhabhohiki akahoko bhabhu kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili, nabhombi bhakamulini na ichapanga nayengi kwa kuijojabhela na kuitumakila, kwa ndandi jeniheji Bambo Chapanga abhaletili mahakau aghagha ghokapi panani jabhu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni atenda majetanganelu na Hilamu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:1-2">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 8:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Mu ujomukelu wa hyaka ishilini, ambayu Solomoni akachengiki nyumba ayeyi ibheli, yani Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga na nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />nkolongwa Solomoni akumpekihi Hilamu, nkolongwa wa ku muchi wa Tilo, michi ishilini mu nkoa wa Galilaya, akahengiki bhenibhela maghambu Hilamu akabhi ampeki Solomoni mbau ya mielezi na misonobali, na zahabu jokapi jela jeakapalike. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Nambu Hilamu paakabhokiki ku Tilo kujenda kujibhona michi jeniheji jeakapekiwi na Solomoni, ngacheakanyambakiki naju. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Bhela, Hilamu akundalukiki Solomoni, “Ndongu wango, bho, ajeji nde michi ja ntundu bhole jeumbekihi?” Najombi Hilamu akajilohiki inchi ja Kabuli, yani inchi janga na ndandi, lihina lelibhi mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Hilamu akabhi ampelaki nkolongwa Solomoni zahabu kilu elufu itatu na mia sita.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matendu ghangi ghaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 8:3-18">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 8:3-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Ghangani nde malobhi kubhokana na mahengu gha kujomalakewa ambaghu nkolongwa Solomoni, moakabhahengili bhandu nahuli kujichenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa, na ngomi ja Milo, lumatu lwa Yelusalemu, michi ja Hazoli, Megido na Gezeli. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />Falao, nkolongwa wa Misili, akabhi aulapwili na kuutola kwa makili muchi wa Gezeli hoghu. Akabhi aujochiki kwa moto, na kubhakoma Bhakanaani bhabhakabhi bhatama monihomu. Panakatahi, mwali waka Falao paakatoghuliki na Solomoni, nkolongwa wa Misili akumpekihi mwali waki muchi wa Gezeli hoghu ubya nhupu wa ndowa. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Najombi Solomoni akauchengiki kabhete muchi wa Gezeli, akachengiki muchi wa Beti Holoni ja pahi, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />akachengiki muchi wa Baalati na Tamali, muchi ghoubhi ku chingwenji mu inchi ja Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />bhelabhela akachengiki michi ja chikoku, na michi kwa ndandi ja magali ghaki gha kuhutakika, na kwa ndandi ja falasi yaki, chokapi cheakapaliki kuchenga mu Yelusalemu, mu Lebanoni, na mu inchi jokapi jela jeatawalaje. <verse eid="1KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Bhandu bhokapi bhabhakahighalili kuhuma kwa Bhaamoli, Bhahiti, Bhapelizi, Bhahivi na Bhayebusi, bhandu bha inchi ayeyi ngachebhakabhi Bhaizilaeli, <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />papamu na bhabhelakeka bhabhu bhabhakahighali mu inchi, ambabhu Bhaizilaeli ngachebhakaweziki kubhayonanga nakanopi, bhanihabha Solomoni akabhajomalakili kubha bhatumwa mu mahengu gha kujomalakewa ngati mokubheli mbaka lalenu. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Nambu pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli, Solomoni ngacheakuntendiki mundu jokapi jola kubha mtumwa, bhombi nde bhakabhi manjolinjoli, bhatumika bhaki, bhakolongwa bhaki bha manjolinjoli, ihongozi bhaki, bhakolongwa bha magali ghaki gha kuhutakika, na bhabhajendesha falasi.<verse eid="1KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Bhelabhela kukabhi na ihongozi bhakolongwa bhabhakabhi bhajemalela mahengu ghaka Solomoni: Bhandu mia nhwanu na hamsini, bhanihabha bhakabhajemali bhandu bhabhakabhi bhahenga lihengu.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Baada jaka mwali waka Falao kuhama kuhuma ku muchi waka Daudi, na kujenda ku nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa ambaju Solomoni akabhi anchengili, bhela Solomoni akachengiki ngomi ja Milo.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Solomoni akabhi abhoha nyambiku ya kujochakeka na nyambiku ja lukwali mala patatu kwa chaka, pa meza ja maganga pa kubhokeha nyambiku paakachengiki kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akahuwiki ubani palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga papamu na nyambiku heji. Bhela akajomwili kujichenga Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Bhelabhela nkolongwa Solomoni akalenganaki sitima yamaheli ku muchi wa Esioni Gebeli hoku, ambayu ibhi pambipi na muchi wa Elati mu inchi ja Edomu, mu ukengu wa bahali ja Shamu. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Najombi nkolongwa Hilamu akatumiki bhatumika bhaki bha mumachi, bhabhajimanyi bahali, na kuhenga lihengu papamu na bhatumika bhaka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Bhakatendiki mwanja kwa bahali mbaka ku mkoa wa Ofili na kukelabhuka na zahabu kilu elufu komi na ncheche, na kumpelakela nkolongwa Solomoni.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Nkolongwa wa chimbomba wa ku Sheba anjendela Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 9:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Nkolongwa wa chimbomba wa ku muchi wa Sheba paakajowini malobhi gha kumanyikana kwaka Solomoni, na upambipi waki na Bambo Chapanga, akahikiki kundenga kwa malalukilu ghaghanonwipe. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Akahikiki ku Yelusalemu akabya na bhahemba bhamaheli namaa, papamu na ngamia yeitotwi manungilu, zahabu yamaheli namaa, na maganga gha mbija yamaheli. Akahikiki kwaka Solomoni na kulonge naku kubhokana na mambu ghokapi ambaghu akabhi naghu muntima waki. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Solomoni akamyangiki nkolongwa wa chimbomba hoju malalukilu ghaki ghokapi, na ngachepakabhi na lijambu lokapi lela lelanonwipi kwaka nkolongwa Solomoni langakuweza kundandila. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Nkolongwa wa chimbomba wa ku Sheba paakamanyiki mbulau yokapi yaka Solomoni, na nyumba ja chikolongwa jeakabhi achengiki, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />bhelabhela paakaweni chilebhi chechakabhi pameza jaki, ntundu ihongozi bhaki mobhakatamili, bhatumika bhaki mobhakawati kanzu yabhu wichu, bhakenga bhaki na nyambiku ya kujochakeka yeabhohiki mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, akakangichi namaa. <verse eid="1KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Bhela, akumpwaghi nkolongwa Solomoni, “Mambu ghokapi ghanyowini ku inchi jangu kubhokana na kuneng'anela kwaku na mbulau yaku nde chakaka! <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Nambu ngachenahobhalili mambu ghanihagha mbaka panakahikiki na kughabhona kwa mihu ghangu namwete. Lingalyaje, ngachebhambwaghi hata nusu jaki. Mbulau yaku na hindu yokapi yeubhi nayu ipetiki mambu ghanajowine. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Mbanga bhandu bhaku! Mbanga bhatumika bhaku abhabha bhabhajema palongi jaku chikahi chokapi na kujowanela mbulau yaku! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Alumbalika Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, ambaju anyambakiki namaa na wehapa na kukubheka panani ja chitehu cha ukolongwa cha Izilaeli. Maghambu kwa upalu wa mileli waka Bambo Chapanga kwa ndandi ja Izilaeli, akutendiki wehapa kubha nkolongwa, nahuli ujendalya kuighoha shelia na wambone.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Najombi akumpeki nkolongwa Solomoni kilu elufu ncheche ya zahabu, na manungilu ghamaheli namaa, na maganga gha mbija yamaheli. Ngachekulabhali ng'o kuletakeka kabheti manungilu ghamaheli ngati ghanihagha, ambaghu nkolongwa wa chimbomba wa ku Sheba ghaakumpeki nkolongwa Solomoni.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />Bhelabhela sitima yaka Hilamu yakaletiki zahabu kuhuma ku Ofili, bhelabhela kuhuma konihoku yakaletiki mikongu ja msandali jamaheli namaa, papamu na maganga gha mbija yamaheli. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akatumili mikongu ja msandali heji kubha nguzu ya Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kwa ndandi ja nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa, na kwa ndandi ja kulenganakela hilimba na zeze kwa ndandi ya bhajemba. Umaheli wa mikongu jeniheji ngachekulabhali kuletakeka mu inchi jeniheji kutumbu lichobha lenilela.<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akumpekihi nkolongwa wa chimbomba wa ku Sheba kila chindu cheakatokulili na cheakalobhiki, papamu na hindu yengi ambayu Solomoni akumpekihi kubhokana na ntetu wabhu na wamboni wa chikolongwa. Bhela nkolongwa wa chimbomba hoju akabhokiki na kubhuja ku inchi jaki, jombi papamu na bhatumika bhaki.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umaheli wa hindu waka nkolongwa Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 9:13-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Kila chaka nkolongwa Solomoni akapelakiwi kilu elufu ishilini na ibheli ya zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />Yeniheyi nga papamu na kodi yeakapatiki kuhuma kwa bhabhahemela na kulombesa na bhachuuzi, na kwa bhakolongwa bhokapi bha ku Alabia na ihongozi bha mikoa ja Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akalenganaki ngau ikolongwa mia ibheli kwa zahabu jejigholuliki, kila ngau jakabhi ja kilu saba ya zahabu. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Akalenganaki ngau ichoku ichoku mia itatu ya zahabu jejigholuliki, kila ngau jimu jakabhi ja kilu jimu na nusu. Nkolongwa akaibhekiki ngau yeniheyi mu nyumba ja jikolongwa jejalowakiki chitengu cha ku Lebanoni.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Bhelabhela nkolongwa akalenganaki chitehu chikolongwa cha kikolongwa kwa kutumila manyelu gha ndembu, na kuchipaka kwa zahabu jinyahi. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Chitehu chenihechi chakabhi na hikwelelu sita. Pandu pa panani pakabhi pa kuyongolota na chakabhekakiki na pandu pa kujeghamakela mabhoku ipambala yokapi ibheli, na imong'umong'u ya mahimba ghabheli ijemiki chimu punkeghi ja pandu pala pa kujeghamakela mabhoku kwa kila chiwoku. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Kukabhi na imong'umong'u komi na ibheli ya mahimba ijemakiki, chimu mu kila upambala wa kila chikwelelu. Chitehu ngati chenihechi ngachechilabhali kulenganakeka mu ukolongwa wokapi ghola.<verse eid="1KI 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Ikombi yokapi ya kunywelela yaka nkolongwa Solomoni yakabhi ya zahabu, na yombu yokapi yeyakabhi mu nyumba ja Chitengu cha ku Lebanoni yakabhi ya zahabu jinyahi. Ngachepakabhili na chindu chechalenganakiki kwa madini gha feza, maghambu madini gha feza ngacheghabhalangiki kubha chindu mu chikahi chaka nkolongwa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Nkolongwa Solomoni akabhi na sitima yamaheli ikolongwa ya Tashishi yeyakabhi ijenda mu bahali. Yakabhi ilongana na sitima yaka nkolongwa Hilamu. Kila chaka cha tatu sitima yeniheyi ya Tashishi yakundeti nkolongwa zahabu, madini gha feza, manyelu gha ndembu, majani makolongwa na majani machoku, na tausi.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni akabhapetiki bhakolongwa bhokapi bha pundema, kwa kubha na hindu yamaheli na mbulau. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Bhandu bhokapi bha pundema bhakabhi na chilolu cha kunjendela Solomoni nahuli kujowanela mbulau ambayu Chapanga akabhi abhekiki muntima waki. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Kila jumu wabhu akaletiki nhupu: Yambu ya madini gha feza, yombu ya zahabu, ingobhu, silaha, manungilu, falasi, na nyumbu. Nhupu yeniheyi akaijopalili mu chaka mbaka chaka.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Solomoni akabhongini magali gha kuhutakika na falasi, na bhabhajendesha falasi, najombi akabhi na magali elufu jimu na mia nchechi na bhabhajendesha falasi elufu komi na ibheli, ambabhu akabhabhekiki mu michi jejibhi na pandu pa kujemakela magali gha kuhutakika na falasi, na magali ghangi akaghabhekiki ku Yelusalemu hoku. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Bhela, nkolongwa Solomoni akaghatendiki madini gha feza mu muchi wa Yelusalemu kubha chindu cha kawaida ngati maganga, na mbau ya mielezi yakabhi yamaheli ngati mbau ya mikoju jejimela mu uwanda wa pahi. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Solomoni akalaghalakili falasi kuhuma ku Misili, na Kilikia, bhakapekiwi bhahemela na bhalombesa bhaka nkolongwa kwa mapogha, na kila lipogha lakabhi na samani jaki. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Bhakalaghalaki magali kuhuma ku Misili kwa kilu saba ya madini gha feza, na falasi jimu bhakahemi kwa kilu ibheli ya madini gha feza. Bhelabhela falasi yeniheyi bhakailombisi kwa bhakolongwa bhokapi bha Bhahiti na bhakolongwa bha ku Silia.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Solomoni ajileka indela jaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Solomoni akabhapaliki namaa akambomba bhamaheli bha chigheni: Mwali waka nkolongwa Falao, akambomba bha Bhamoabu, akambomba bha Bhaamoni, akambomba bha Bhaedomu, akambomba bha Bhasidoni na akambomba bha Bhahiti. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Akambomba bha inchi ambayu Bambo Chapanga akabhi abhakanakili Bhaizilaeli, akapwagha, “Ngamwitogho akambomba bha chigheni, wala bhombi ngabhitogho akambomba kuhuma kwinu, kwa ndandi akambomba bhanihabha anabhajing'anambula mitimi jinu nahuli muitumakyaje ichapanga yabhu.” Nambu Solomoni akabhapaliki namaa akambomba bhanihabha. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Solomoni akabhi na akabhahanu mia saba, bhokapi bhakabhi akakamwali bha bhabhelakeka bha kikolongwa, bhelabhela akabhi na akabhahanu mia itatu ambabhu bhakabhi bhatumika bhaki bha chimbomba. Akabhahanu bhaki habha bhakung'anambwili mtima waki. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Solomoni paakabhi mzee, akabhahanu bhaki bhakundongwihi kutumbu kuitumakila ichapanga nayengi, wala ngacheakabhi ndongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, ngati tati waki Daudi moakabheli ndongwana. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Panihapa, Solomoni akuntumakili Ashitoleti, joakabhi chapanga wa chimbomba wa Bhasidoni, na Moleki chapanga ambaju Bhaamoni pabhakunjojabhili bhakunhakalihi Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Bhela, Solomoni akatendiki mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, wala ngacheakunjengali kwa ulongwana Bambo Chapanga, ngati tati waki Daudi moakatendile. <verse eid="1KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Panani ja chitombi chechibhi upambala wa kolipita lyobha wa muchi wa Yelusalemu, Solomoni akachengiki pandu pa kunjojabhela kichapanga Kemoshi, kichapanga ambaju Bhamoabu pabhakunjojabhili bhakunhakalihi Chapanga, na pandu pa kunjojabhela kichapanga Moleki, kichapanga ambaju Bhaamoni pabhakunjojabhili bhakunhakalihi Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Bhelabhela akabhachengili akabhahanu bhaki bhokapi bha chigheni pandu pa kuhukila ubani, na kuibhokeha ichapanga yabhu nyambiku.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akamuyomi Solomoni kwa ndandi mtima waki ukang'anambwiki kutali na Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, joakumpitali mala pabheli, <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />na kundakali Solomoni ngaijojabhela ichapanga ya chigheni, nambu Solomoni ngacheakakamwili amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Solomoni, “Kwa kubha uhengiki ghanihagha, wala ngachewakamwili Lulaghilu lwangu, na shelia yangu yenukulaghalakili, chakaka ananukachula ukolongwa kuhuma kwaku, na kumpekeha mtumika waku. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Hata bhela, kwa ndandi jaka tati waku Daudi, nga ndendi lijambu leniheli chikahi cha womi waku. Nambu ananukachula ukolongwa hoghu kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaka mwana waku. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Nganaukachuli ukolongwa wokapi kuhuma kwaki, nambu ananumpekya mwana waku likabila limu, kwa ndandi jaka mtumika wangu Daudi, na kwa ndandi ja Yelusalemu, muchi ghonuhawili kubha wangu namwete.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maadui bhaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Bhela Bambo Chapanga akuntendiki Hadadi joakabhi wa lukolu lwaka nkolongwa wa ku Edomu, kubha adui waka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Chikahi Daudi paakabhi nkolongwa, akapiti kukomana na bhandu bha ku Edomu. Yoabu, joakabhi nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli ghaka nkolongwa Daudi, akapiti kubhatagha Bhaizilaeli bhabhakomakiki kungondo. Mu chikahi chenihechi, Yoabu akabhakomiki akanalomi bhokapi bha ku Edomu. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoabu na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakatami konihoku kwa myehi sita, mbaka pabhakajomwili kubhayonanga akanalomi bhokapi bha ku Edomu hoku. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Nambu Hadadi, akabya akona nkombu nchoku, akatilili ku Misili papamu na Bhaedomu bhakumu, bhabhakabhi bhatumika bhaka tati waki. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Hadadi na bhajaki bhakatendiki mwanja kuhuma ku Midiani, bhakabhatoliki bhandu bhangi ku Palani hoku, bhakapiti nabhu mbaka ku Misili, kwaka Falao nkolongwa wa inchi ja Misili, Falao akumpekihi Hadadi nyumba, chilebhi, na mighonda. <verse eid="1KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Falao akanyambakiki namaa na Hadadi, hata akuntoghuki ndamu waki, ndongu waka nhwanu waki nkolongwa wa chimbomba Tapenesi, kubha nhwanu waka Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Ndongu waka nkolongwa wa chimbomba Tepenesi hoju akumbelakili Hadadi mwana joakalowakiki Genubati. Genubati akaleliwi na Tapenesi mu nyumba jaka nkolongwa Falao. Konihoku Genubati akatami papamu na bhana bhaka nkolongwa Falao.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Chikahi Hadadi paakabhi ku Misili hoku, akajowini kubha Daudi apotili na kutaghakika kobhakataghakiki akahokolu bhaki, bhelabhela Yoabu joakabhi nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli najombi apotile. Bhela, Hadadi akumpwaghi Falao, “Chondi, nukulobha unyetakyaje ngelabhuka ku inchi jangu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Falao akundalukile, “Bho, pambani ukepakiwi na kiki mbaka upala kubhuja ku inchi jako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Hadadi akamuyangiki Falao,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">“Nga chindu, nambu unyetakya pena nyendaje.”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Bhelabhela Chapanga akuntendiki Lezoni mwana waka Eliada, kubha adui jongi waka Solomoni. Lezoni akabhi antiliki bambo waki Hadadezeli, nkolongwa wa ku Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Chikahi Daudi paakabhakomiki bhandu bha ku Soba hoku, Lezoni akabhongini bhandu na kulenganakela lipogha la bhandu bha kupenga, najombi Lezoni akabhi chiongozi wabhu. Bhela, bhakapiti ku Damasko, bhakatami konihoku na kuntenda Lezoni kubha nkolongwa wa Damasko. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Lezoni akabhi adui wa Izilaeli kwa machobha ghokapi gha ukolongwa waka Solomoni, akung'ahiki namaa Solomoni ngati najombi Hadadi moakung'ahi Solomoni. Bhela, Lezoni akajitawili inchi ja Silia, koni akabya abhahakalila namaa bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilanga chaka Chapanga kwaka Yeloboamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Bhelabhela, Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati, Mwefulaimu wa ku Seleda, mtumika waka Solomoni, ambaju mabhu waki joakaweliwi na ndomi waki akalowakiki Selua, najombi akumpengiki nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Na aghagha nde malobhi gha ntundu jombi moakumpengi nkolongwa: Solomoni akayelalili mabhomba na kuchenga ngazi yeyalowakiki Milo yeyakabhi ijenda ku lumatu lwa muchi waka tati waki Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Bhela Yeloboamu akabhi mundu joakangamili na mwana makili, najombi Solomoni paakumbweni ntundu nkombu hoju moakahengi lihengu laki, akumbekiki kubha chiongozi wa mahengu ghokapi gha kujomalakewa gha munyumba jaka Yusufu. <verse eid="1KI 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Lichobha limu, Yeloboamu paakabhi atenda mwanja kuhuma ku Yelusalemu, mlota Ahiya, Mshiloni akahimangini naku mu indela, Ahiya akabhi awati likanzu lahenu. Bhokapi bhabheli bhakabhi kanjika jabhu ku mighonda. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Najombi Ahiya akalihuliki likanzu laki lahenu, akalikachwili ipandi komi na ibheli. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Bhela akumpwaghi Yeloboamu, “Utolaje ipandi komi kwa ndandi jaku, kwa kubha anana nde Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, moapwaghila, ‘Lingalyaje, ananukachula ukolongwa kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaka Solomoni na kukupeke wehapa makabila komi. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Nambu jombi ananundekila likabila limu kwa ndandi jaka mtumika wangu Daudi, na kwa ndandi ja muchi wa Yelusalemu, ambau nuhawili kubha wangu mu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Anandenda bhenibhela maghambu Solomoni anekiki nepani na kujojabhela ichapanga ya kigheni: Ashitoleti chapanga wa chimbomba wa Bhasidoni, Kemoshi chapanga wa Bhamoabu, na Moleki chapanga wa Bhaamoni. Solomoni atehi kuneka, atendiki mahakau palongi jangu, na ngacheamwili shelia yangu, na malaghalakilu ghangu, ngati moakatendi tati waki Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />Nambu nganibhohi ukolongwa wokapi kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaka Solomoni, nuntendiki kubha nkolongwa machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaki kwa ndandi jaka mtumika wangu Daudi, jonunhawili na joakabhi akamu amuli yangu na shelia yangu. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Anamoha ukolongwa kuhuma mu mabhoku ghaka mwana waki, na kukupeke wehapa makabila komi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Mwana waka Solomoni hoju ananumpekya likabila limu, nahuli mtumika wangu Daudi, apata kubha na taa machobha ghokapi palongi jangu mu Yelusalemu, muchi ghola ghonuhawili kubha pandu pangu pa kunyojabhela. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Bhela, wehapa wa Yeloboamu, ananukutenda kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, nanau anautawala ngati moupalila. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Na ngati anautendiki kila chenakulaghalakyaje, kujenda mu indela yangu na kutenda ghaghabhi ghamboni palongi ja mihu ghangu, kwa kuikamula amuli yangu na malaghalakilu ghangu ngati moakatendi mtumika wangu Daudi, anangubha papamu na wehapa. Ananukuchengila ukolongwa ghoanautamakya ngati ghola ghonukunchengi Daudi, nanatu ananukupekyaje wehapa Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Kubhokana na ghanihagha ananabhang'ahaje bhabhelakeka bhaka Daudi kwa ndandi ja leniheli, nambu nga mileli.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Bhela, Solomoni akalengiki kunkoma Yeloboamu, nambu Yeloboamu akatilili ku Misili, kwaka nkolongwa Shishaki, najombi akatami konihoku mbaka Solomoni paakapotile.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Solomoni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 9:29-31">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 9:29-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Mambu ghangi ghaka Solomoni, ghokapi ghaakahengiki na mbulau yaki, ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha matendu ghaka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Solomoni akatawili Izilaeli jokapi kwa yaka alobaini, akabya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Bhela, Solomoni akapotile, akataghakiki mu muchi waka tati waki Daudi. Najombi Lehoboamu mwana waka Solomoni, akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Makabila komi gha kungondi ghalitenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 10:1-19">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 10:1-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Bhela, Lehoboamu akapiti ku Shekemu, kwa kubha Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakabhi konihoku nahuli kuntenda jombi kubha nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Najombi Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati paakajowini lijambu leniheli, akabhi akona ku Misili koakabhi atilili nahuli kubha kutali na nkolongwa Solomoni, akatami ku Misili. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Bhela bhakatumiki bhandu kundoha Yeloboamu, jombi na lipogha lokapi la Izilaeli bhakunjendili Lehoboamu, na kumpwaghila, <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Tati waku akatutwekiki hibwahila yeitopiki. Bhela, utujeluha chibwahila hechi, na tepani anatukutumakyaje.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Lehoboamu akayangike, “Njendaje, na anaghapetiki machobha ghatatu, mkelabhuka kwangu.” Bhela, bhandu bhakabhokike.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Bhela nkolongwa Lehoboamu akapaliki kumanya maholalelu gha ihongozi ambabhu bhakuntumaki tati waki Solomoni chikahi cha womi waki, akabhalalukile, “Bho, muholake nabhapekya liyangu bholi bhandu abhabha?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Ihongozi bhanihabha bhakamuyangike, “Ngati lalenu anaubhi mtumika wa bhandu abhabha na kubhatumakila na kubhapekeha liyangu linyahi, anabhakubha bhatumika bhaku machobha ghokapi.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Nambu Lehoboamu akakaniki maholalelu ghaakapekiwi na ihongozi na kupala maholalelu kuhuma kwa akakombu bha chikambaku bhabhakakoliki papamu naku, na bhabhakabhi bhuntumakila. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Bhela akabhalalukile, “Bho, na mwehapa mbi na maholalelu bhole?” Nahuli tubhayanga bhandu abhabha bhabhanaluki, bhakapwaghaje, “Nyeluhaje chibwahila yeakabhatwekiki tati wangu?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Akakombu bhanihabha bhakamyangike, “Bhandu habha bhabhakupwaghi kubha tati waku akabhatwekiti chibwahila chechitopiki, bhakakulobhiki ujeluhaje chibwahila hechi, wehapa ubhapwaghila anana, ‘Wehapa anaubhapekya lihengu lelitopiki nakanopi, kupeta mahengu ghala ghabhakapekiwi na tati waku. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Chibwahila chaka tati wangu chakabhi chechitopike, nambu chibwahila changu nepani anachikubha chechitopiki nakanopi. Tati wangu akundapwi kwa iboku ya ndomondo, nambu nepani ananundapula kwa iboku yeibhi na miha!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Bhela lichobha la katatu, Yeloboamu papamu na bhandu bhokapi bhakakelawiki kwaka nkolongwa Lehoboamu ngati moakabhalaghalakile. <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Nkolongwa Yeloboamu akabhayangiki bhandu bhanihabha kwa ukale, akaghalekiki maholalelu ghaakapekiwi na ihongozi, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />na akajengalili maholalelu gha akakombu bhajaki, akapwaghaje, “Chibwahila chaka tati wangu chakabhi chechitopike kwinu, nambu chibwahila changu nepani anachikubha chechitopiki nakanopi. Tati wangu akabhalapwili kwa iboku ya ndomondo, nambu nepani ananundapula kwa iboku yeibhi na miha!” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Bhela nkolongwa ngacheakabhajowani bhandu, kwa ndandi lijambu leniheli lakahumiki kwaka Bambo Chapanga, nahuli kutimiza lilobhi laki, leakumpwaghi Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati kupetela kwaka mlota Ahiya, kuhuma ku Shilo.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Nambu bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhakaweni kubha nkolongwa akaniki kubhajowanela, bhakumpwaghile, “Ngachetubhi na majetanganelu ghokapi na Daudi! Tepani ngachetubhi na upwelelu kwaka mwana waka Yese. Njendanyaje mu mahema ghinu, mwenga mabhandu bha Izilaeli! Wenga wa Daudi ujighoha nyumba jaku wamwete!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Bhela Bhaizilaeli bhakapiti mu mahema ghabhu. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Nambu bhandu bha Izilaeli bhabhakabhi bhatama mu michi ja inchi ja Yuda, bhanihabha pena nde bhabhahighalili pahi ja utawala waka Lehoboamu.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Nkolongwa Lehoboamu akuntumiki Adolamu, joakabhi njemalela wa bhala bhabhakabhi bhahenga lihengu linonopi la kujomalakewa, nambu bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakundapwi kwa maganga mbaka kupotela. Hata bhela, nkolongwa Lehoboamu, akakweliki manyata mu ligali laki la kuhutakika na falasi, na kutilila ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Bhela, bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakapengiki panani ja lukolu lwaka nkolongwa Daudi mbaka lalenu.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli pabhakajowini kubha Yeloboamu akelawiki kuhuma ku Misili, bhakatumiki bhandu na kundoha pa uhimanganu, na kuntenda kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli jokapi. Njeta likabila lengi lelakalombini na lukolu lwaka Daudi, nambu likabila laka Yuda pela.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota waka Shemaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 11:1-4">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 11:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Chikahi Lehoboamu paakahikiki ku Yelusalemu, akabhongini manjolinjoli ghaghabhi wichu laki jimu na elufu semanini gha makabila gha Yuda na likabila laka Benyamini, nahuli kukomana ngondo na utawala wa Izilaeli, nahuli kuukelabhuha kabheti ukolongwa kwaka Lehoboamu mwana waka Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Nambu lilobhi laka Chapanga lakunhiki mlota Shemaya, mundu waka Chapanga, kupwagha, <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Umpwaghila Lehoboamu mwana waka Solomoni, nkolongwa wa Yuda, na bhandu bhokapi bha likabila laka Yuda na likabilalaka Benyamini na bhandu bhangi bhokapi, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />‘Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana: Ngamwijenda, wala ngamwikomana ngondo na bhalongu bhinu Bhaizilaeli, mbuja kila mundu kunyumba jaki, maghambu lijambu leniheli nilitendiki nepani.’ ” Bhela bhakalijengalili lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga, bhakabhujiki kunyumba yabhu kabheti, ngati Bambo Chapanga moakabhalaghalakile.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeloboamu andeka Bambo Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Bhela, nkolongwa Yeloboamu akauchengiki kabheti muchi wa Shekemu mu inchi ja itombi yaka Efulahimu, na kutama konihoku. Bhelabhela akabhokiki konihoku na kujenda kuuchenga muchi wa Penueli. <verse eid="1KI 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Yeloboamu akaholalili muntima waki, “Sajenu iwezikana ukolongwa kukelabhuka munyumba jaka Daudi. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Ngati bhandu abhabha anabhajendali kukwela kujenda kubhoha nyambiku mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga ku Yelusalemu hoku, mitima jabhu anajung'anambukya bambo wabhu, yani Lehoboamu nkolongwa wa Yuda. Nabhombi anabhangoma nepani na kunkelabhukila nkolongwa Lehoboamu.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Bhela, nkolongwa paakalongili na bhandu bhangi, akalenganakili imong'umong'u ya matoli gha ng'ombi ghabheli gha zahabu. Akabhapwaghili bhandu, “Mwenga mabhandu bha Izilaeli, kunonwipi namaa kwinu mwehapa kukwela kujenda ku Yelusalemu. Ndingalyaje, ichapanga hinu yepambane, yeyakumbohiki mwehapa kuhuma ku inchi ja Misili.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Chimong'umong'u chimu cha litoli la zahabu akachibhekiki ku muchi wa Beseli, na chengi ku muchi wa Dani. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Chitendu hechi chakabhi lihoku, maghambu bhandu bhakabhi bhajenda mbaka ku muchi wa Beseli na Dani kuijojabhalela imong'umong'u heyi. <verse eid="1KI 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Bhelabhela Yeloboamu akachengiki nyumba pandu pa panani ja tutombi, na kubhahaghu bhapenganyambiku kuhuma kwa bhandu ambabhu ngachebhakabhi likabila laka Lawi.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujojabhela ku Beseli kupengakeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yeloboamu akalaghalaki kutendakika uwangalalu mu lichobha la komi na nhwanu la mwehi wa nane, ngati uwangalalu ghoukabhi ukahengakeka ku Yuda hoku, na kubhoha nyambiku pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku jejakabhi pandu pala payakabhi imong'umong'u ja litoli la zahabu lelakabhi ku Beseli. Akatendiki bhenibhela ku Beseli hoku, akabhohiki nyambiku palongi ja imong'umong'u ya matoli gha zahabu yeakalenganakile. Akabhabhekiki bhapenganyambiku bhala bhaakabhahawili nahuli bhatumika pa kila meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku papakalenganakiki ku tutombi hoku. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Mu lichobha la komi na nhwanu la mwehi wa nane, mwehi ghoakahawili mweni, akabhohiki nyambiku panani ja meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku jeakachengiki ku muchi wa Beseli hoku. Bhela akatumbulili uwangalalu kwa ndandi ja Bhaizilaeli na akakweliki pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, na kuhuwa ubani.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Lichobha limu nkolongwa Yeloboamu akabhi ajemiki punkeghi ja meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku nahuli kuhuwa ubani. Mundu waka Bambo Chapanga kuhuma ku Yuda akahikiki pa Beseli hapa na ubholu waka Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Bhela, mundu hoju akalapwi njobhela panani ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku, kwa lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, wenga wa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, lendenu nde leapwagha Bambo Chapanga: Anaabhelakika mwana mu lukolu lwaka Daudi, lihina laki anaalowakika Yosia. Jonihoju nde joatumikaje pandu pa kujojabhela na kuhuwa ubani panani jaku, na kutambikila ichapanga panani jaku, na ihupa ya bhandu anaijochakikaje panani jaku.” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Lichobha lelalela mundu waka Chapanga akabhohiki nginyulila, akapwaghaje, “Jenjenu nde nginyulila jeakapwaghiki Bambo Chapanga, lingalyaje, meza jenjenu ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku anajikajukaje, na ilihu yeibhi panani jaki anaijitakaje.” <verse eid="1KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Nkolongwa Yeloboamu paakajowini chela cheakapwaghiki mundu waka Chapanga, chikahi paakalapwi njobhela pa meza ja maganga ja pandu pa kubhokeha nyambiku ku Beseli hoku, akahatambwi chibhoku chaki pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, na kupwagha, “Munkamulaje!” Palapala chibhoku chaki cheakahatambwi chela ngacheakaweziki kuchikunja. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Najombi meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku pakakajwiki, na ilihu yakajitiki pahi, ngati nginyulila jela jeakabhohiki mundu waka Chapanga hoju kwa lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Bhela, nkolongwa Yeloboamu akumpwaghili mundu waka Chapanga, “Chondi unobhila kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, nahuli chibhoku changu chipata kulama.” Najombi mundu waka Chapanga akundobhi kwaka Bambo Chapanga, chibhoku chaka nkolongwa chakalamiki na kubha ngati moukabheli pakutumbula hapa. <verse eid="1KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Nkolongwa akumpwaghi mundu waka Chapanga jola, “Kambokaje kunyumba jangu ukakula chilebhi, nanatu ananikupekya nhupu.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Nambu mundu waka Chapanga jola akamuyangiki nkolongwa, “Hata ngati anaumbeki nusu ja hindu yaku, nganyendi papamu na wehapa, wala nganguli chilebhi, wala ngangunywi machi pandu pambane. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga anaghalaki, ‘Ngawikula chilebhi, wala kunywa machi, wala ngawikelabhuka kwa indela jeukahikiki pambani ng'o.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Bhela, mundu jola akabhokiki kwa kupetela indela jengi, wala ngacheakelawiki kwa indela jela jeakahikili ku Beseli.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlota mzee wa ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Chikahi chenihechi kukabhi na mlota jumu mzee ku Beseli hoku, bhana bhaki bhakapiti kundandila mambu ghokapi ghaatendiki mundu waka Chapanga jola lichobha leniheli. Bhelabhela bhakumpwaghi tati wabhu malobhi ambaghu mundu jola akumpwaghi nkolongwa Yeloboamu. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Tati wabhu akabhalalukile, “Bho, apetiki indela bhole?” Nabhombi bhana bhaki bhakundangihi indela jela jeapetiki mundu waka Chapanga kuhuma ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Najombi akabhapwaghi bhana bhaki, “Mniandalya liponda langu la mwanja.” Pabhakajomwi kuliandaa liponda heli, mzee jola akakweliki panani ja liponda, <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />na kunjengalela mundu waka Chapanga jola. Akunhimanili atami pahi ja nkongu wa mwaloni. Bhela, akundalukile, “Bho, wehapa le nde wa mundu waka Chapanga kuhuma ku Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Najombi akunjangiki, “Ena, nde nepani.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Bhela mlota mzee jola akumpwaghile, “Kambokaje kunyumba jangu, ukakula chilebhi.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Nambu mundu waka Chapanga jola akumpwaghile, “Nganhwezi kujenda papamu na wehapa, wala nganhwezi kula chilebhi, wala nganhwezi kunywa machi pandu pambani. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />Maghambu Bambo Chapanga anaghalakili, ‘Ngawikula chilebhi, wala kunywa machi, wala ngawikelabhuka kwa indela jeukahikiki pambani ng'o.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Mlota mzee wa ku Beseli hoju akumpwaghile, “Nepani nanatu nde mlota ngati wehapa, na mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga akambwaghili kwa lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga, ‘Unkeluha ahika munyumba jaku, nahuli akula chilebhi, na kunywa machi.’ ” Nambu mlota mzee hoju akabhi mpuhi pela.<verse eid="1KI 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Bhela, mundu waka Chpapanga akakelawiki papamu naku, akakuliki chilebhi, na kunywa machi kunyumba jaka mlota mzee jola. <verse eid="1KI 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Chikahi pabhakabhili bhatami pameza, lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhiki mlota mzee joakunkelawihi mundu waka Chapanga jola. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Najombi akunjamalalili mundu waka Chapanga joakahumiki ku Yuda jola, akapwaghaje, “Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Wehapa ukaniki kujowanela lilobhi laka Mambo Chapanga, na ngachewajengali amuli jeakakupekihi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Nambu ukakelawiki, na kula chilebhi, na kunywa machi pandu ambapu akakupwaghili ngawikula, wala kunywa machi. Kwa ndandi jeniheji ntuhi waku ngawitaghakiki mu litengeli la akahoko bhaku.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Chikahi mundu waka Chapanga jola paakajomwi kula chilebhi na kunywa machi, mlota mzee hoju akamuandali liponda mundu waka Chapanga kuhuma ku Yuda, najombi akabhokiki. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Paakabhi ajenda akahimangini na lihimba mwindela, lihimba lakunkomiki na ntuhi waki ukabhi ulekaliki mu indela, liponda laki na lihimba heli ghakabhi ghajemiki pambipi na ntuhi. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Bhandu bhakumu bhabhakapetiki indela jenijela bhakauweni ntuhi pahi pala, na lihimba lijemiki pambipi na ntuhi, nabhombi bhakapiti kubhoha ubholu ku muchi ambau mlota mzee jola akabhi atama.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Mlota mzee joakabhi ankelawihi mundu kuhuma mu mwanja waki paakajowini ubholu ghonihoghu, akapwaghiki, “Jonihoju nde mundu waka Chapanga ambaju akalilekiki lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga! Bambo Chapanga alitumiki lihimba, lunkachulini na kunkoma, ngati lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga molakunkanakile.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Mlota mzee jola akabhapwaghi bhana bhaki, “Mniandalya liponda langu la mwanja.” Nabhombi bhakamuandalile. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Bhela mzee hoju akabhokiki, akauhimanili ntuhi waka mundu waka Chapanga mu indela, liponda na lihimba ghakabhi ghajemiki pambipi ja ntuhi, lihimba ngachelakakuliki ntuhi, wala kulikachulana liponda. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Bhela, mlota mzee jola akautoliki ntuhi waka mundu waka Chapanga, akaughoniki panani ja liponda laki, na kuukelabhuha mu muchi waki, nahuli kundelela na kuntagha. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Panihapa bhakautaghiki ntuhi mu litengeli laka mlota mzee jola, nabhombi bhana bhaki bhakaombulizi, bhakapwaghaje, “Wehapa undongu witu!” <verse eid="1KI 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Pabhakajomwili kuntagha, mlota mzee jola akabhapwaghi bhana bhaki, “Anambotili, mwindagha mu litengeli leniheli leataghakiki mundu waka Chapanga, mwibheka ihupa yangu punkeghi ja ihupa yaki. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Mambu ghokapi ghaghalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga kupetela pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku pa ku Beseli na kupetela pa meza yokapi pa kubhokeha nyambiku mu itombi ya Samalia, chakaka anaghapitalyaje.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeloboamu atenda mahoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Nambu nkolongwa Yeloboamu ngacheakaulekiki uhakau waki, nambu mala jengi kabhete akabhekiki bhapenganyambiki bhatumikaje pa meza ya maganga ya kubhokeha nyambiku ku itombi. Mundu jokapi jola joakalibhohiki kubha mpenganyambiku, akuntendiki kubha mpenganyambiku pandu pa kujojabhela ichapanga ku itombi. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Chitendu chenihechi chakabhi lihoku kwa lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu, hata chakamuyoningi na kubhohakeka panani ja ndema.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka mwana waka Yeloboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Chikahi chenihechi, Abiya mwana waka nkolongwa Yeloboamu, akabhi mtamwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />Yeloboamu akumpwaghi nhwanu waki, “Ujenda ukaling'anambulaje, nahuli bhandu ngabhimanya kubha wehapa nde nhwanu waka Yeloboamu. Bhela ujenda ku muchi wa Shilo. Mlota Ahiya abhi konihoku, jola joakambwaghi kubha nepani anangubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Utolaje mabumunda komi, maandazi na busi libotolu limu. Jombi anaakupwaghila chechipitalyaje kwaka nkombu witu.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Bhela nhwanu waka Yeloboamu akatendiki ngati moakapwaghiki ndomi waki, akapiti mu nyumba jaka Ahiya ku muchi wa Shilo hoku. Chikahi chenihechi Ahiya akabhi ngacheweza kulola, kwa ndandi ja uzee waki. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Nambu Bambo Chapanga akabhi ampwaghi Ahiya, “Nhwanu waka Yeloboamu ahika kukulalukila kubhokana na mwana waki, maghambu atenda kulwala, na wehapa umuyanga anana na anana. Paakahikiki, akalitendiki kubha ngati mundu jongi.” <verse eid="1KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Nambu Ahiya paakajowini nganyatu ya kujenda kwaki pundyangu, akapwaghike, “Ujingala mkati, nhwanu waka Yeloboamu. Bho, maghambu kiki utehi kuling'anambula? Mili na ubholu wangakubha unyahi kwaku. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Ujenda ukampwaghila Yeloboamu kubha Bamba Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, apwagha anana, ‘Nakakuhawili pachilanda ja bhandu, na kukutenda kubha chilongozi wa bhandu bhangu Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Nakaukachwili ukolongwa kuhuma kwa bhabhelakeka bhaka Daudi na kukupekeha wehapa, nambu ngacheubhi ngati mtumika wangu Daudi, joakakamwi malaghalakilu ghangu na kunyengalela kwa mtima waki wokapi, akatendiki pe lela lelakabhi lamboni palongi jangu. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Wehapa utendiki mahakau ghamaheli kupeta bhakolongwa bhokapi bhabhukulongulile. Unekiki nepani na kundenda nhyomaje kwa kulilenganakela ichapanga nayengi, na imong'umong'u ya kuyeyusha. <verse eid="1KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />Kwa ndandi ja lijambu lendenu, ananeta mahakau panani ja bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu. Anangoma kuhuma kwaka Yeloboamu kila mbelakeka wa kujomukela bha chikambaku mu Izilaeli, akubhi mtumwa au mundu wa kulijeka. Ananabhayonanga bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu mbaka bhayonangikika bhokapi, ngati mundu joajocha mandipi gha hinyama. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Jokapi joabhi lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu jonaawelila mumbwani, nakawa anayunkulaje, na jokapi jonaawelila mu mighonda, ijuni ya kunani anayunkulaje. Maghambu Bambo Chapanga, mbwaghiki lijambu leniheli.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />Bhela, Ahiya akumpwaghi nhwanu waka Yeloboamu, “Ujemaje ubhuja kunyumba jaku. Chikahi pela pawijingala mu muchi waku, mwana waku anapotilaje. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli anabhaombulizaji kwa ndandi jaki na kuntagha. Maghambu jombi pela kanjika jaki kuhuma kwa bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu nde joanataghakikaje, ndandi jombi pela nde akunyambihi Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />Bambo Chapanga anaankweha mundu jongi kubha nkolongwa panani ja Izilaeli, ambaju anaabhayonanga bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Lehoboamu. Hata sajenu lijambu leniheli litumbwi kupitalila. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Najombi Bambo Chapanga anaabhalapula bhandu bha Izilaeli, nabhombi anabhanyuhakika ngati linyonyoli molinyuhakika panani ja machi. Anaajitupulaje Izilaeli kuhuma mu inchi jenu jinyahi jeabhapekihi akahokolu bhabhu na kubhapechangana kwihi ja nkoka Eufulati, maghambu bhandendiki nepani Bambo Chapanga niyomaje nakanopi, kwa kulilenganakela imong'umong'u ya ichapanga ya Ashela. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Bambo Chapanga anaabhaleka bhandu bha Izilaeli kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghaatendiki Yeloboamu, na kubhatenda bhandu bha Izilaeli nabhombi kutenda mahoku.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Panihapa nhwanu waka Yeloboamu akajemiki, na kubhoka kujenda ku muchi wa Tiliza. Najombi paakahikiki pela pundyangu, mwana akapotile. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Bhandu bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhakuntaghiki, na kuombuleza kwa ndandi jaki, ngati moakapwaghi Bambo Chapanga kwa kupetela kwaka mtumika waki, mlota Ahiya.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Yeloboamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Matendu ghangi ghaka nkolongwa Yeloboamu, ntundu moakakomani ngondo na kutawala, ghokapi ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yeloboamu akatawili kwa hyaka ishilini na ibheli, najombi akapotili na kutaghakika, najombi Nadabu mwana waki akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lehoboamu atawala mu inchi ja Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 11:5-12:15">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 11:5-12:15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Lehoboamu mwana waka Solomoni akatendakiki kubha nkolongwa wa ku Yuda. Akabhi na hyaka alobaini na jimu chikahi paakatumbwi kutawala, najombi akatawili kwa hyaka komi na saba koni akabya ku muchi wa Yelusalemu, muchi ambau Bambo Chapanga akabhi auhawili kuhuma mu makabila ghokapi gha Izilaeli, nahuli apata kujojabhalewa monihomu. Lihina laka mabhu waki akalowakiki Naama, kuhuma mu likabila la Bhaamoni.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Bhandu bha Yuda bhakatendiki mahoku polongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhakuntendiki Chapanga kubha na inyela ja wihu nakanopi kwa mahoku ghabhu ghamaheli ghabhakahengiki, kupeta hata ghabhakahengiki akahoko bhabhu. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Bhelabhela bhakalilenganakili pandu pa kujojabhela ichapanga ya upuhe, nguzu ya kujojabhela, na imong'umong'u ya Maashela panani ja kila katombi kakajinwiki, na kila nkongu ghoubhi na mahamba mabhehi. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Bhelabhela kukabhi na akanalomi mu inchi ja Yuda bhabhakabhi bhajingalanila kihyegha bheni mu inchi kwa ndandi ja kujojabhela imong'umong'u yabhu. Mambu ghanihagha gha kuhakaliha ghaghakabhi ghahengakeka na bhandu bha inchi nayengi, ambayu Bambo Chapanga akaghatopwili mangani Bhaizilaeli pabhakabhi bhakali ngakujingila mu inchi ja Kanaani.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Mu chaka cha kahanu cha utawala waka nkolongwa Lehoboamu, Shishaki nkolongwa wa ku Misili, akaulapwili muchi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Akatoliki hindu yokapi kuhuma mu chikoku cha Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga na chikoku cha mu nyumba ja kikolongwa. Akatoliki kila chindu, papamu na ngau yokapi ya zahabu yeakabhi alenganakili nkolongwa Solomoni. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Bhela Nkolongwa Lehoboamu akalenganaki ngau ya shaba na kubhapekeha bhakolongwa bha bhalonda, bhabhalendika ndyangu wa nyumba ja kikolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Kila chikahi nkolongwa paakapiti mu Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga, bhalonda bhakaitowi ngau heyi, na kuikelabhu kabheti mu chumba cha bhalonda.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Matendu ghangi ghaka nkolongwa Lehoboamu, na ghokapi ghaakahengiki, ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Chikahi chokapi kubhabhi na ngondo pachilanda jaka Lehoboamu na Yeloboamu. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Lehoboamu akapotili na kutaghakika mu matengeli gha akatati bhaki, mu muchi waka Daudi. Lihina laka mabhu waki akalowakiki Naama, kuhuma mu likabila la Amoni, najombi Abiya mwana waki, akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Nkolongwa Abiya atawala mu inchi ja Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 13:1-14:1">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 13:1-14:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Mu chaka cha komi na nane cha utawala waka Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati, Abiya akatendakiki kubha nkolongwa wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />Najombi akatawili mu Yuda kwa hyaka itatu koni akabya ku Yelusalemu hoku. Lihina laka mabhu waki akalowakiki Maaka, mwali waka Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Abiya akatendiki mahoku ghalaghala ghaakatendiki tati waki, wala ngacheakabhi na mtima wa ulongwana kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, ngati mtima waka hokolu waki Daudi moukabhelile. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Hata bhela, kwa ndandi jaka Daudi, Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waki, akumpekihi Abiya mwana joanatawalaje pandu paki, na kubha taa ja kumulakila mu Yelusalemu na kuubheka Yelusalemu ujemakyaje. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Bambo Chapanga akehengiki bhenibhela maghambu Daudi akatendiki ghaghabhi ghamboni palongi jaki, ngacheakalepalili kukamula malaghalakilu ghokapi ghaka Bambo Chapanga machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaki, nambu pela kubhokana na mambu ghaka Uria, Mhiti. <verse eid="1KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Bhela kukabhi na ngondo pachilanda jaka Lehoboamu na Yeloboamu machobha ghokapi gha matamu ghaka Abiya. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Matendu ghangi ghaka Abiya, na ghokapi ghaakahengiki ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Yuda. Kukabhi na ngondo pachilanda jaka Abiya na Yeloboamu.<verse eid="1KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Abiya akapotili na kutaghakika mu muchi waka Daudi. Najombi Asa, mwana waki akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkolongwa Asa tawala mu inchi ja Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 15:16-16:6">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 15:16-16:6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Mu chaka cha ishilini cha utawala waka Yeloboamu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, Asa akabhi nkolongwa wa Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />Najombi akatawili mu Yelusalemu kwa hyaka alubaini na jimu. Lihina laka mabhu waki akalowakiki Maaka, mwali waka Abisalomu. <verse eid="1KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa akatendiki mambu ghaghabhi ghamboni palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati moakatendi Daudi, hokolu waki. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Akabhatopwi mu inchi akanalomi bhokapi bhabhajilanya kihyegha na akanalomi bhajabhu kwa ndandi ja kujojabhalela ichapanga, na kubhoha imong'umong'u yokapi ambayu akahokolu bhaki bhakabhi bhalenganakile. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Akumbohiki mbuja waki Maaka mu pandu paki pa ukolongwa waki wa chimbomba, maghambu akabhi alenganaki chimong'umong'u cha kunjojabhela Ashela, chapanga wa chimbomba. Bhela Asa akachikajulini chimong'umong'u hechi na kuchijocha pa moto pa libondi la Kidiloni. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Nambu pandu pa panani pa kujojabhalela ichapanga ku itombi hoku, ngacheakabombwile, hata bhela mtima waka Asa ukabhi ulibhekiki wichu kwaka Bambo Chapanga kwa matamu ghaki ghokapi. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Akaletiki mkati ja Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga madini gha feza, zahabu na yombu yokapi ambayu jombi na tati waki bhakabhi bhaibhekiki palongi jaka Chapanga.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Chikahi chokapi cha utawala wabhu kukabhi na ngondo pachilanda jaka Asa nkolongwa wa Yuda, na Baasha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Nkolongwa Baasha wa Izilaeli akaulapwi muchi wa Yuda na kutumbula kuchenga lumatu mu muchi wa Lama, nahuli kuhibhalakila mundu jokapi ngaipita kunja, wala kujingila mu inchi jaka Asa, nkolongwa wa ku Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Bhela nkolongwa Asa akatoliki madini gha feza na zahabu yokapi yeikahighalili mu chikoku cha Nyumba jaka Bambo Chapanga na chikoku cha nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa. Akabhapekihi bhatumika bhaki, na kubhatuma kwaka Beni Hadadi mwana waka Tabilimoni, nchokolu waka Hezioni, nkolongwa wa ku Silia, joakabhi atawala ku Damesko, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />“Tutenda majetanganelu pachilanda jangu na wehapa, ngati mokwabheli pachilanda jaka tati wangu na tati waku. Lingalyaje, nukuletili nhupu wa madini gha feza na zahabu. Bhela uhekataje majetanganelu ghaku na Baasha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, nahuli abhokaje mu inchi jangu.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Panihapa nkolongwa Beni Hadadi akunjetakili nkolongwa Asa, na kubhatuma bhakolongwa bha manjolinjoli ghaki kujenda kujilapula michi ja Izilaeli. Nabhombi bhakajiweziki michi ja Iyoni, Dani, Abeli Beti Maaka na Kineleti jokapi, papamu na Nafutali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Nkolongwa Baasha paakajowini mambu gha ngondo hagha, akakotwiki kuuchenga muchi wa Lama na akapiti kutama ku muchi wa Tiliza.<verse eid="1KI 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Bhela nkolongwa Asa akatangizi kwa bhandu bhokapi bha Yuda, panga kundeka mundu hata jumu, bhatotulaje maganga na mbau kuhuma ku Lama, ambayu Baasha akatumili kuchengela. Nkolongwa Asa akaitumili kuchengela muchi wa Geba, jejibhi ku Benyamini na ku Misipa.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Matendu ghangi ghaka nkolongwa Asa, makili ghaki na michi jokapi jeachengiki, ghokapi ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Yuda. Nambu, chikahi cha uzee waki, Asa akapatiki chitamu cha magholu. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Bhela, Asa akapotili na kutaghakika mu matengeli gha kikolongwa, mu muchi waka Daudi, najombi mwana waki Yehoshafati akatawili pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nadabu atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Nadabu mwana waka Yeloboamu akabhi nkolongwa wa Izilaeli mu chaka cha kabheli cha utawala waka Asa wa ku Yuda, najombi akatawili Izilaeli kwa hyaka ibheli. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Nadabu akatendiki mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, ngati moakatendi tati waki, joakabhatendiki bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatenda mahakau.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasha mwana waka Ahiya, wa likabila laka Isakali, akuntendili njama Nadabu. Bhela chikahi Nadabu na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi pabhakabhi bhauyongalwiti muchi wa Gibetoni, ghoubhi ku muchi wa Bhafilisti, Baasha akundapwili na kunkoma. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasha akunkomiki Nadabu mu chaka cha katatu cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa Yuda, najombi Baasha akabhi nkolongwa wa Izilaeli pandu paka Nadabu. <verse eid="1KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Chikahi pela Baasha paakatumbwi kutawala, akabhakomiki bhandu bhokapi bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu, ngacheakundekiki kubha mwomi mundu hata jumu pachilanda ja lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu, ngati lilobhi leakapwaghiki Bambo Chapanga kwa indela jaka mtumika waki Ahiya wa ku Shilo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Mambu ghanihagha ghakatendakiki kwa ndandi Yeloboamu akuntendiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, ayomaje, kwa mahoku ghaki na kwa kubhatenda bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatenda mahoku.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Matendu ghangi ghaka Nadabu, na mambu ghangi ghokapi ghaakahengiki, ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Kukabhi na ngondo pachilanda jaka Asa nkolongwa wa Yuda, na Baasha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, chikahi chokapi cha utawala wabhu.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkolongwa Baasha atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Mu chaka cha katatu cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa ku Yuda, Baasha mwana waka Ahiya akabhi nkolongwa wa Izilaeli jokapi koni akabya ku Tiliza hoku, najombi akatawili kwa hyaka ishilini na ncheche. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Nkolongwa Baasha akatendiki mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akunjighiki Yeloboamu na kutenda uhakau gholaghola ambau akabhatendiki bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatenda mahakau.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Bhela lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhiki Yehu mwana waka Hanani, panani jaka Baasha, akapwaghaje, <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Wehapa Baasha, ukabhi wa mundu wangakumanyikana, nukutendiki kubha chiongozi wa bhandu bhangu Izilaeli. Wehapa unjighiki Yeloboamu, jombi akabhatendiki bhandu bhangu Izilaeli bhatenda mahoku na kundenda niyomaje kwa mahoku ghabhu. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Bhela mi tayali kukuyonanga wa Baasha papamu na bhandu bha lukolu lwaku, nanatu ananabhatenda bhandu bha lukolu lwaku ngati monakatendi kwa bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Mundu jokapi joabhi ndongu waku wa Baasha joanawelila kumbwani, nakawa anajunkulaje, na jokapi joanawelila mu mighonda, ijuni ya kunani anayunkulaje.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Matendu ghangi ghaka Baasha, na ghokapi ghaakahengiki ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Bhela Baasha akapotili, na akataghakiki ku muchi wa Tiliza hoku. Najombi Ela, mwana waki akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Bhelabhela lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhiki Baasha papamu na bhandu bha lukolu lwaki, kupetela kwaka mlota Yehu mwana waka Hanani, kwa ndandi ja mahakau ghokapi ghaakabhi ahengiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Bhela Bambo Chapanga akayomiki kwa ndandi ja mambu ghaakahengiki Baasha, na kubha ngati bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu, na kwa ndandi jeniheji akatehi kubhayonanga.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ela atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Mu chaka cha ishilini na sita cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa ku Yuda, Ela mwana waka Baasha akatendakiki kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, najombi akatawili mu Izilaeli kwa hyaka ibheli koni akabya ku Tiliza hoku. <verse eid="1KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Najombi Zimili, jumu wa linjolinjoli waki nkolongwa, joakabhi na amuli panani ja nusu ja magali ghaki gha kuhutakika na falasi, akatendiki njama ja kunkoma Ela. Chikahi hechi Ela akabhi ku muchi wa Tiliza hoku, akakunywiki mbaka kulobhela mu nyumba jaka Alisa, mundu joakabhi njemalela wa nyumba ja kikolongwa ku Tiliza hoku. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Bhela Zimili akajingi mkati mu nyumba akundapwili mbaka kunkoma mu chaka cha ishilini na saba cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa ku Yuda. Bhela Zimili akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki. <verse eid="1KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Chikahi pela Zimili paakatumbwi kutawala na kutama panani ja chitehu cha ukolongwa, Zimili akabhakomiki bhandu bhokapi bha lukolu lwaka Baasha. Ngacheakundekiki mwanalomi hata jumu, akubhi ndongu waki, wala nkochi waki. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Bhela Zimili akabhayoningi bhandu bhokapi bha lukolu lwaka Baasha, ngati lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga leapwaghiki panani jaka Baasha kupetela kwaka mlota Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />Mambu aghagha ghakahengakiki kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghokapi ghaakahengiki Baasha na mwana waki Ela. Bhanihabha bhakuntendiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli ayomaje, kwa kutenda mahoku na kubhatenda bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatenda mahoku kwa kujojabhela imong'umong'u ya ichapanga yabhu. <verse eid="1KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Matendu ghangi ghaka Ela, na ghokapi ghaakahengiki mu chikahi cha utawala waki ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimili atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Mu chaka cha ishilini na saba cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa ku Yuda, Zimili akatendakiki kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, najombi akatawili kwa machobha saba pela koni akabya ku Tilisa hoku. Manjolinjoli ghakabhekiki likambi pambipi na Gibetoni, muchi wa Bhafilisti. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Chikahi Bhaizilaeli bhabhakabhi mu likambi pabhakajowini kubha Zimili atendiki chindu chihakau kwa kunkoma nkolongwa Ela, bhakuntangizi Omili, nkolongwa wa manjolinjoli, kubha nkolongwa wa Bhaizilaeli lichobha lelalela pabhakabhi kulikambi. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Omili na Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhakabhokiki ku Gibetoni na kujenda kuulapula muchi wa Tiliza. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Chikahi Zimili paakaweni kubha muchi utolakiki kwa makili, akajingi mkati ja ngomi ja nyumba ja kikolongwa, na kujijocha moto nyumba ja kikolongwa na mweni, na akawelili monihomu. <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />Lijambu heli lakatendakiki kwa ndandi ja mahoku ghaakatendiki Zimili palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, na kunjigha Yoloboamu kwa mahoku ghaakatendiki, kwa kubhatenda bhandu bha Izilaeli kutenda mahoku. <verse eid="1KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Matendu ghangi gha utawala waka Zimili, na kupenga kwaki, ghokapi ghaakahengiki, ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Omili atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Bhela bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakaghabhaniki mu mapogha ghabheli: Lipogha limu lakummanyi Tibini mwana waka Ginati kubha nkolongwa, na lipogha lengi la kabheli lakummanyi Omili kubha nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Nambu bhahemba bhaka Omili bhakabhapetiki makili bhahemba bhaka Tibini mwana waka Ginati. Bhela, Tibini akapotili na Omili akabhi nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Mu chaka cha selasini na jimu cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa ku Yuda, Omili akabhi nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, najombi akatawili kwa hyaka komi na ibheli. Hyaka sita akabhi atawala kuhuma ku muchi wa Tilisa. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Akahemili katombi ka Samalia kwa hipandi elufu sita ya madini gha feza kuhuma kwaka mundu jumu joakalowakiki Shemeli, akachengiki ngomi panani jaki, na muchi. Akaulohiki Samalia, kubhokana na lihina Shemeli laka joakabhi mweni katombi kanihaka pakutumbula hapa.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Nambu Omili akatendiki mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akatendiki mahakau kupeta bhakolongwa bhokapi bhabhakundongulile. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Kwa kubha akunjighiki Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati, akuntendiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, ayomaje, kwa kubhatenda bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatenda mahoku kwa kujojabhela imong'umong'u ya ichapanga. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Matendu ghangi ghaakahengiki Omili mu chikahi cha utawala waki na ukangamalu waki, ghokapi ghalembakiki mu chitabu cha kombukombu ya bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omili akapotili, na kutaghakika ku Samalia hoku, najombi mwana waki Ahabu akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahabu atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Mu chaka cha selasini na nane cha utawala waka Asa nkolongwa wa ku Yuda, Ahabu mwana waka Omili, akatumbwi kutawala ku Izilaeli. Akatawili ku Samalia hoku kwa hyaka ishilini na ibheli. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ahabu mwana waka Omili akatendiki mahakau ghamaheli palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga kupeta bhakolongwa bhokapi bhabhakundongulile. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Kabheti, papamu na kujigha mambu mahakau ghaka Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati, Ahabu akuntowili Yezebeli mwali waka Etibaali, nkolongwa wa ku Sidoni, na akatumbwi kuntumaki Baali, na kunjojabhela. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Akunchengi Baali nyumba ku Samalia hoku, na mkati jaki akalenganaki pandu pa kumbokeha nyambiku. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Bhelabhela Ahabu akalenganakili chimong'umong'u cha Ashela, chapanga wa chimbomba. Bhela akuntendiki Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli ayomaje. Ahabu akatendiki mahakau ghamaheli kupeta ghabhakatendiki bhakolongwa bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhabhakundongulile. <verse eid="1KI 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Chikahi cha utawaka waka Ahabu, Hieli kuhuma ku Beseli, akauchengiki kabheti muchi wa Yeliko. Nambu chikahi paakabhi achenga luhuli lwa muchi, mwana waki wa kutumbula joakalowakiki Abilamu akapotile, bhelabhela chikahi paakabhi abheka milyangu mikolongwa ja muchi, mwana waki nchoku joakalowakiki Segubu akapotile. Ghanihagha ghakapitalili kulengana na lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga leakapwaghiki kupetela kwaka Yoshua.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Eliya ahibhalaki iyula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Bhela Eliya wa chijiji cha ku Tishibi ku Gileadi hoku, akumpwaghi nkolongwa Ahabu, “Napa kwaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, joabhi mwomi ambaju nepani nuntumakila, ngapikubhi na lyangami wala iyula mu hyaka yenu, mbaka panipwagha lilobhi.” <verse eid="1KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Bhela, Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi Eliya, kupwagha, <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Ubhoka pambane, na ujenda ku upambala wa kolipita lyobha ukajobhyaje pambipi na chikoka cha Keliti, chechibhi kolipiti lyobha mwa nkoka Yoludani. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Konihoku anaukunywa machi kuhuma mu chikoka chela, nanatu naghalakili makongolu ghakuletila chilebhi.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Bhela Eliya akatendiki chela cheakalaghalakiwi na Bambo Chapanga. Akapiti ku chikoka cha Keliti, kolipita lyobha mwa nkoka Yoludani, na kutama konihoku. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Makongolu ghakundeti libumunda na inyama, lukela na pakamihe, akapatiki na machi gha kunywa mu chikoka hechi. <verse eid="1KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Machobha machokopi ghakapetiki, chikoka chela chakajomalili, maghambu iyula ngachejatonyiki pa inchi.<verse eid="1KI 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eliya amuhyoha mwana waka mbomba joakaweliwi na ndomi waki wa ku Saleputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Bhela lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhiki Eliya, kupwagha, <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Ubhokaje ujenda kumbwani ku Saleputa, pambipi na muchi wa Sidoni, ukatama konihoku. Nundaghalakili mbomba jumu joakaweliwi na ndomi waki akupekya chilebhi.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Bhela, Eliya akabhokiki, na kujenda ku Saleputa. Paakahikiki pundyangu wa muchi, akunhimani mbomba jumu joakaweliwi na ndomi waki akatondula hanju. Eliya akundohiki mbomba jola na kumpwaghila, “Chondi, nobha machi gha kunywa.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Mbomba jola paakabhi ajenda kundete machi, Eliya akundohiki akapwaghaje, “Chondi, nukulobha unetila na chipandi cha libumunda.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Mbomba jola akamuyangike, “Nukulapila kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, joabhi mwomi, ngachemi na libumunda hata lichokopi. Nambu mi pela na lihumbatu limu la uhembi mu ndundu, na mahuta machokopi mu libotolu. Nhikiki pambani kutondo hanju ichokopi nahuli nyenda kunyumba kujocha libumunda heli, kwa ndandi jangu na mwana wangu, nahuli tukulaje anachijomwiki, tupotilaje.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Eliya akumpwaghile, “Ngawijoghopa. Ujendaje kunyumba ukatenda ngati moupwaghile. Nambu unenganakya nepani hoti libumunda lichokopi, anaujomwi kunenganake nepani, ulilenganakya libumunda wamweti na mwana waku. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Kwa kubha Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, apwagha Anana: ‘Ndundu wa uhembi ngawijomoki, wala libotolu la mahuta lela ngalijomoki, mbaka lichobha lela Bambo Chapanga payileta iyula panani ja inchi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Bhela mbomba joakaweliwi na ndomi waki jola, akapiti kuhenga ngati Eliya moakumpwaghile. Bhela kukabhi na chilebhi kila lichobha kwa ndandi jaka Eliya, na kwaka mbomba na bhalongu bhaki. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Uhembi ghoukabhi mu ndundu ghola ngachewajomwiki, wala mahuta mu libotolu ngacheghajomwiki, kulengana na lilobhi lela laka Bambo Chapanga leakapwaghiki Eliya.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, mwana waka mbomba joakaweliwi na ndomi waki jola, akalwaliki, na hali jaki ngachejakabhi jinyahi, na pakujomukela akapotile. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Mbomba hoju akumpwaghi Eliya, “Wenga wa mundu waka Chapanga, ubhi na kiki na nepane? Bho, uhikiki nahuli kuhyekula mahoku ghangu, na kunkoma mwana wangu?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Eliya akumpwaghile, “Umbekya mwana waku.” Bhela Eliya akuntoliki mwana kuhuma pachihimba jaka mabhu waki, akumpapiki mbaka kuchumba chaki cha kunani moakabhi atama, na kungoneka panani ja chitanda chaki. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Bhela akundobhiki Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, bho, mbaka mbomba joakaweliwi na ndomi waki ajoju ambaju nepani ndama kwaki, najombi atenda kung'oha, undetili chilelu kwa kunkoma mwana waki?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Bhela Eliya akungonalili mwana hoju mala patatu, na kundobha Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wangu, nukulobha roho jaka mwana ajoju junkelabhukyaje mkati jaki kabhete!” <verse eid="1KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Bambo Chapanga akajowanili lilobhu laka Eliya, palapala mwana akahyokiki.<verse eid="1KI 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Eliya akuntoliki mwana jola kuhuma ku chumba cha kunani, na kunheleha pahi kwaka mabhu waki, na kumpwaghila, “Lingalyaje, mwana waku abhi mwomi!”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Bhela mbomba joakaweliwi na ndomi waki jola, akumpwaghi Eliya, “Henu manyi kwa uchakaka kubha wehapa nde wa mundu waka Chapanga, na malobhi ghaka Bambo Chapanga ghaghahuma mundomu waku nde chakaka!”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Eliya apengana na bhalota bhaka kichapanga Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Bhela paghapetiki machobha ghamaheli, mu chaka cha katatu cha kulepa kubha na iyula, lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhiki Eliya, kupwagha, “Ujenda ukalilangiha kwaka nkolongwa Ahabu, na nepani ananijitenda iyula jitonyaje panani ja inchi.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Bhela, Eliya akapiti kulilangiha kwaka nkolongwa Ahabu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Chikahi chenihechi injala jakabhi ngolongwa namaa ku Samalia hoku. <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />Najombi nkolongwa Ahabu akundohiki Obadia njemalela wa nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa. Obadia akabhi mundu joantopela namaa Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Chikahi Yezebeli paakabhi abhakoma bhalota bhaka Bambo Chapanga, Obadia akabhi abhatoliki bhalota mia jimu na kubhahiya mu mambaku ghabheli, bhalota hamsini kwa kila limbaku na kubhapelakela chilebhi na machi. <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Ahabu akumpwaghi Obadia, “Ujendaje mu inchi jokapi mu tukoka twokapi na mu mabondi. Pangi tuweza kupata manyonyoli gha kuileha falasi na nyumbu ipata kutama nahuli ngachikuwa chinyama hata chimu.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Bhela bhakaghabhini pandu pa kujenda, nahuli bhapata kujipete jokapi kulonda manyonyoli, Ahabu akapiti upambala ghumu na Obadia akapiti upambala ghongi.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Chikahi Obadia paakabhi mu indela, akahimangini na Eliya, najombi Obadia paakummanyi Eliya, akajinimi na kuchikama mbaka pahi paluhombi, na kupwagha, “Bho, chakaka le wehapa wa bambo wangu wa Eliya?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Eliya akamuyangike, “Ena, nepani nde Eliya, ujenda ukumpwaghila bambo waku Ahabu, ‘Eliya abhi pambane.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadia akundalukile, “Bho, nhokihi kiki mbaka kumeka nepani mtumika waku mu mabhoku ghaka Ahabu, nahuli angomaje? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Chakaka ngati Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waku, moatamila, njeta inchi hata jimu au ukolongwa ambau bambo wangu ngacheakuntumiki mundu kukulonda. Kila chikahi bhandu bha inchi au ukolongwa pabhakapwaghiki kubha ngacheubhi konihoku, Ahabu akuntendiki nkolongwa wa konihoku alapaje kubha ngacheakuweni. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Nambu sajenu upala nyenda kwaka bambo wangu, na kumpwaghila, ‘Eliya abhi pambane!’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Ngachemanyi kubha nde kwaku Roho waka Bambo Chapanga anaapala kukupeleka chikahi panakulekaje. Ngati anambiti kumpwaghi Ahabu kubha ubhi pambani, najombi nangakukuhimanila, anaangomaje. Hata bhela nepani mtumika waku nundongwana kwa Bambo Chapanga kutumbula ukombu wangu. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Bho, ngacheujowini kubha Yezebeli paakabhi abhakoma bhalota bhaka Bambo Chapanga? Ntundu nepani monakabhahiiki bhalota bhaka Bambo Chapanga mia jimu mu mambaku ghabheli, bhalota hamsini mu kila limbaku limu, na kubhapekeha chilebhi na machi? <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Na wehapa umbwaghi nyenda kwaka bambo wangu, na kumpwaghi: Eliya abhi pambane! Manyi Ahabu anaangomaje!”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Eliya akamuyangike, “Ngati Bambo Chapanga wa manjolinjoli moatamila, jombi jonuntumakila, chakaka ananililangiha kwaka nkolongwa Ahabu lalenu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Bhela, Obadia akapiti kuhimangana na nkolongwa Ahabu, na kumpwaghila, najombi Ahabu akapiti kuhimangana na Eliya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Ahabu paakumbweni Eliya, akumpwaghile, “Bho, wehapa le nde weubhang'aha bhandu bha Izilaeli?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Eliya akamuyangike, “Nepani ngachenabhang'aha bhandu bha Izilaeli. Nambu wehapa na bhalongu bhaka tati waku nde mwentenda ghanihagha. Muilekiki amuli yaka Bambo Chapanga, na kujojabhela ichapanga ya Mabaali. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Bhela ubhalohaje bhandu kuhuma ku Izilaeli jokapi tuhimangana nabhu panani ja chitombi cha Kalimeli. Na wehapa ubhaleta bhalota mia nchechi na hamsini habha bhaka Baali na bhalota mia nchechi habha bhaka Ashela, kichapanga wa chimbomba, bhabhakula chilebhi pameza na nkolongwa wa chimbomba Yezebeli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Bhela, Ahabu akatumiki ubholu mu Izilaeli jokapi, na kubhabhongana bhalota bhanihabha panani ja chitombi cha Kalimeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Bhela, Eliya akajemiki palongi ja bhandu na kupwagha, “Bho, anamnyema nyema mu maholalelu ghabheli mbaka lile? Anangati Bambo Chapanga, nde Chapanga, munjengalya jombi, nambu anangati Baali nde Chapanga, bhela munjengalya jombi.” Nambu bhandu bhanihabha ngachebhakayangiki lilobhi lokapi lela. <verse eid="1KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Bhela, Eliya akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Nepani kajika jangu nde mlota waka Bambo Chapanga nenhighalile, nambu Baali abhi na bhalota mia nchechi na hamsini. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Ndetaje ng'ombi ibheli ikambaku, na bhalota bhaka Baali bhahaghula ng'ombi jimu jikambaku, bhachinjaji na kuheketa ipandi ipandi na kuibheka panani ja hanju, panga na kupambaki moto. Nanatu anandola ng'ombi jikambaku jengi heji, ananjinjaji na kujibheka panani ja hanju panga kupambaki moto. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Mwehapa ndobhaje kwa lihina laka chapanga winu, na nepani ananobhaje kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga. Chapanga jola joanayangaje kwa kuleta moto, jonihoju nde Chapanga wa chakaka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Panihapa lipogha lokapi lakapwaghike, “Leniheli leupwagha nde lambone.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Bhela, Eliya akabhapwaghili bhalota bhaka Baali, “Muhaghulaye litoli limu pachilanda ja matoli makambaku hagha na mukabya bhakutumbula kundenganakela, kwa ndandi mwehapa mbili bhamaheli namaa. Mukundobhaje chapanga winu, nambu ngamwipambaki moto.”<verse eid="1KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Bhalota bhanihabha bhakatoliki likambaku la ng'ombi lebhapekiwi lela, bhakalilenganakili, bhela bhakatumbwili kulobha kwa lihina laka Baali, kutumbula lukela mbaka saa sita ja muhi, bhakalapula njobhela, “Wenga wa Baali, utuyangaje!” Nambu ngachepakabhi na liyangu lokapi lela, njeta joakayangiki. Nabhombi bhakakiniki kuyongolota pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku pabhakalenganakile.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Saa sita ja muhi, Eliya akatumbwi kubhalongama, akapwaghaje, “Ndapula njobhela nakanopi! Maghambu jonihoju nde chapanga! Pangi abhi mu maholalelu ghaki makolongwa, au abhi na lihengu lamaheli, au atendiki mwanja, au pangi aghoni lughonu lukolongwa, impalika munjumuhaje!” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Bhela bhalota bhanihabha bhakalapwi njobhela nakanopi, na kuliheketa heketa kwa mapanga na mipamba, ngati moukabhelili ntetu wabhu, mbaka mwahi ukabhapitike. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Saa sita ja muhi jakapetike, nabhombi bhakajendali kulapu njobhela ngati bhabhabhi na mangongu mbaka chikahi cha kubhoha nyambiku ja pakamihe. Nambu ngachepakabhi na liyangu lokapi lela, njeta joakabhayangiki, wala joakabhalingalile.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Bhela, Eliya akabhapwaghi bhandu bhokapi, “Muheghalyaje pambipi na nepane.” Bhandu bhokapi bhakunheghalile, bhela Eliya akachengiki kabhete meza ja maganga ja kumbokeha Bambo Chapanga nyambiku, jejakabhi jibombuliwi. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Eliya akaghatoliki maganga komi na ghabheli, limu kwa ndandi ja kila likabila la bhana bhaka Yokobo, ambaju lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhikili, lakapwaghaje, “Lihina laku analikubha Izilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Kwa maganga ghanihagha, Eliya akunchengi Bambo Chapanga meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, akahembiki nkolulela kupayongolota pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku hapa, nkolulela ghouweza kutola ngati lita selasini ya machi. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Akachochaki hanju, akachinjiki likambaku la ng'ombi lela na kuheketa ipandi ipandi na kuibheka panani ja hanju. Bhela akabhapwaghi bhandu, “Ntwelakya mapipa nchechi machi na kughajiti panani ja nyambiku ja kujochakeka na panani ja hanju.” <verse eid="1KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Akabhapwaghile, “Mtenda mala ja kabheli.” Nabhombi bhakatendiki mala ja kabheli. Akalaghalaki kabhete, “Mtenda kwa mala ja katatu.” Nabhombi bhakatendiki bhelabhela mala ja katatu. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Machi ghakanyiliki kuyongolota pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku, na kuutwelakela nkolulela machi.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Chikahi cha kubhoha nyambiku ja pakamihe, mlota Eliya akaheghali pa meza ja maganga ja kubhokeha nyambiku na kundobha Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghaje, “Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga waka Ibulahamu, Isaka na Izilaeli, imanyikana lalenu kubha wehapa nde Chapanga mu Izilaeli, na kubha nepani nde mtumika waku, na ndendiki mambu ghangani ghokapi kwa lilobhi laku. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Uniyangaje nepani, Wenga wa Bambo Chapanga, uniyangaje nahuli bhandu abhabha bhamanya kubha wehapa wa Bambo Chapanga, nde Chapanga, na kubha ujing'anambula mitima jabhu jukukelabhukya kabhete.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Palapala moto waka Bambo Chapanga ukahelili na kujijocha nyambiku ja kujochakeka jela, hanju, maganga na luhombi, na kughajomeha machi ghokapi ghaghakabhi ghatwelili mkati ja nkolulela. <verse eid="1KI 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Bandu bhokapi pabhakaghaweni mambu ghanihagha, bhakajinimi na kuchikama ukupama mbaka paluhombi, bhakapwaghaje, “Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga! Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Bhela Eliya akabhalaghalakile, “Mubhakamulaje bhalota bhokapi bhaka Baali. Ngamwandeka hata jumu wabhu atilaje!” Bhakabhakamwili, na Eliya akabhatoliki mbaka kulibondi la nkoka Kishoni, na akabhakomiki konihoku.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujomoka kwa Ulale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Baada ja ghanihagha, Eliya akumpwaghi nkolongwa Ahabu, “Ujendaje, ukakula na kunywa, kwa ndandi kubhi na sauti ngolongwa ja ihula.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Bhela Ahabu akabhokiki nahuli kula na kunywa. Nambu Eliya akakweliki panani ja chitombi cha Kalimeli, na kujinimi na kuchikama ukupama mbaka pahi na kubheka chibhongi chaki pachilanda ja majuwa ghaki. <verse eid="1KI 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Akumpwaghi mtumika waki, “Ujendaje ukalingaje upambala wa ku bahali.” Mtumika akapiti, akalingalili na kukelabhuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Akapwaghike, “Njeta chindu chokapi konihoku.” Eliya akumpwaghile, “Ujenda kabheti mala saba.” <verse eid="1KI 18:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Mala ja saba, mtumika akaletiki ubholu, akapwaghaje, “Niliweni lihundi lichokopi ngati chiwoku chaka mundu lakakwela kuhuma mu bahali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Bhela Eliya akapwaghike, “Ujenda ukumpwaghila Ahabu, ‘Uliandia ligali laku la kuhutakika na falasi, na uhelala mangani iyula ngachejukuhibhalakile.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Chikahi chelachela kunani kumahundi kukabhi kupili kwa ndandi ja mahundi, mpongu ukapuliki, na iyula jikolongwa jakatonyiki, najombi Ahabu akakweliki ligali laki la kuhutakika na falasi, na kukelabhuka ku Yezileeli. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Makili ghaka Bambo Chapanga ghakunhikili Eliya, najombi akalikongiki na kulikaza likanzu laki, akakembili na kundongulela Ahabu kujingila ku muchi wa Yezileeli.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Eliya akembalela ku chitombi cha Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Nkolongwa Ahabu akundandi nhwanu waki Yezebeli mambu ghokapi ghaahengiki Eliya, na ntundu moakabhakomi bhalota bhokapi bhaka Baali kwa lipanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Bhela Yezebeli akuntumiki mbolu kwaka Eliya, kupwagha, “Nukulapila, ichapanga ingomila kutali, mbaka kuhika chilabhu chikahi ngati chenjenu ngati nganukukomi ngati jumu wa bhalota abhabha.” <verse eid="1KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Eliya akajowipi, na akatiliki nahuli kukengalela womi waki. Akahikiki ku Beeli Sheba mu muchi wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:3">Najombi akundekiki mtumika waki konihoku, <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />nambu mweni Eliya akajendiki lujendu lwa lichobha limu kujingila mulipololu. Akahikiki punkongu wa mletemu, akatami pahi jaki na kulobha nahuli apotilaje. Akapwaghike, “Ijaghanila Bambo Chapanga, ngachenhweza kabheti, ubhohaje womi wangu, maghambu nepani nga wamboni kupeta akahokolu bhangu!”<verse eid="1KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Bhela, Eliya akaghoni pahi ja nkongu ghonihoghu, na kughochela lughonu. Palapala mtumika wa kunani kwaka Chapanga akamgusiki na kumpwaghila, “Ujumuka na ukulaje.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Eliya akalingalili ipambala yokapi, na pambipi na mmutu waki pakabhi na libumunda lelijochakiki pa makalakala gha moto na ligudulia la machi. Akalili na kunywa, na kughone kabhete. <verse eid="1KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Mtumika wa kunani kwaka Bambo Chapanga jola akunhiki mala ja kabheli, akamgusiki na kumpwaghila, “Ujumuka na ukulaje, maghambu mwanja nde ulachu kwaku.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Eliya akajumwiki, akakuliki na kunywa. Paakabhi apatiki makili kwa ndandi ja chilebhi chela, akatendiki mwanja machobha alubaini ikilu na muhi mbaka akahikiki ku Holebu, yani Sinai, chitombi chaka Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Konihoku akajingi mulimbaku, na kughonela monihomu ikilu jela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Palapala Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Eliya, bho, uhenga kiki pambane?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Eliya akayangiki, “Mweni wihu wamaheli kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa manjolinjoli. Bhaizilaeli bhalukaniki Lulaghilu lwaku, bhabombwili meza yaku ya maganga ya kubhokeha nyambiku, na kubhakoma bhalota bhaku kwa lipanga. Nepani kanjika yangu pela nde nenhighalile, nabhombi sajenu bhanonda nahuli bhaniyonangaye.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Upita kunja ukajema panani ja chitombi palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, maghambu Bambo Chapanga abhi pambipi kupeta panihapa.” Panihapa mpongu wamaheli na ghoubhi na makili ukakajwili itombi yela na kukaju matalaghu palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, nambu Bambo Chapanga ngacheakabhi mu mpongu ghola. Pawapetiki mpongu chakahikiki chinyukunyuku cha ndema, nambu Bambo Chapanga ngacheakabhi mu chinyukunyuku chela. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Pachapetiki chinyukunyuku cha ndema hechi, ukahikiki moto. Nambu Bambo Chapanga ngacheakabhi mu moto ghonihoghu. Pawakapetiki moto jakahikiki sauti njokopi, ja kuteluka.<verse eid="1KI 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Bhela, Eliya paakajowini sauti jeniheji, akaliyekalili pamihu jaki kwa likanzu laki, akapitiki na kujema pundomu wa limbaku. Panihapa sauti jela jakumpwaghile, “Eliya, bho, uhenga kiki pambane?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Eliya akayangike, “Mweni wihu wamaheli kwa ndandi jaka Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa manjolinjoli. Bhaizilaeli bhalukaniki Lulaghilu lwaku, bhabombwili meza yaku ya kubhokeha nyambiku, na kubhakoma bhalota bhaku kwa lipanga. Nepani kanjika jangu pela nde nenhighalile, nabhombi sajenu bhanonda nahuli bhaniyonangaje.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghile, “Ukelabhukaje kwa kupetela indela ja kulipololu mbaka ku Damasko. Chikahi pawihika konihoku, unjeghala Hazaeli mahuta kubha nkolongwa wa Silia. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Bhelabhela unjeghala mahuta Yehu mwana waka Nimushi kubha nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, na unjeghalaje mahuta Elisha mwana waka Shafati kuhuma ku Abeli Mehola kubha mlota pandu paku. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Bhela, jokapi joanatilaje lipanga laka Hazaeli, Yehu anaankomaje, na jokapi joanatilaje lipanga laka Yehu, Elisha anaankomaje. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Nambu, nabhabhekiki akiba bhandu elufu saba mu inchi ja Izilaeli, ambabhu ngachebhunjojabhi Baali, wala kuchibusu chimong'umong'u chaki.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha alowakeka kubha mlota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Bhela, Eliya akabhokiki konihoku na kunhimani Elisha mwana waka Shafati. Akabhi alema kwa kutumila ng'ombi makambaku komi na ibheli, najombi mweni akailongwihi ng'ombi komi na ibheli yela. Eliya akapetiki pambipi jaki, na kundekalela likanzu laki. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Bhela, Elisha akailekiki ng'ombi yaki, akunkembali Eliya, na kumpwaghila, “Unyetakalyaje nyenda nakabhalaghila tati wangu na mabhu wangu, nahuli nukujengalyaje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Eliya akamuyangike, “Ujenda, na ukelabhukaje, nambu ukombukaje lenukuhengile.”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Bhela, Elisha akundekiki Eliya, akaikelawihi ng'ombi yaki, akachichinjiki ng'ombi makambaku komi na ghabheli ghala na kuteleka kwa kutumila mangolingoli ngati hanju, akabhapekihi bhandu, nabhombi bhakakuliki. Panihapa Elisha akabhokiki, na kunjengale Eliya na kubha mtumika waki.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Ngondo pachilanda ja Bhaizilaeli na Bhasilia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Chikahi chenihechi, Beni Hadadi nkolongwa wa ku Silia, akaghabhongini manjolinjoli ghaki ghokapi, akalombini na bhakolongwa bhangi selasini na ibheli papamu na falasi na magali ghabhu gha kuhutakika gha ngondo. Akaujendili muchi wa Samalia, akauyongalwiti na kuulapula. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Bhela, akabhatumiki bhabholu bhaki ku muchi waka nkolongwa Ahabu wa Izilaeli, bhakumpwaghilaje, “Nkolongwa Beni Hadadi apwagha anana, <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Madini ghaku gha feza na zahabu yaku yokapi nde yangu, na akabhahanu bhaku bhabhabhi bhanyahi nakanopi na bhana bhaku nde bhangu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akayangike, “Bambo wangu nkolongwa, kubya ngati moupwaghile. Nepani na yokapi yeminayu nde mali ghaku.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Bhabholu bhala bhakakelawiki kabhete kwaka Ahabu, bhakumpwaghile, “Nkolongwa Beni Hadadi apwagha anana, ‘Nukutumili ubholu umbekya madini gha feza, zahabu, akabhahanu bhaku, papamu na bhana bhaku. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Nambu chilabhu chikahi ngati chenjenu, ananabhatuma bhatumika bhangu kukaghulila nyumba jaku ja kikolongwa na nyumba ja bhatumika bhaku. Chindu chokapi chela chebhibhona uchipala nakanopi, anabhachitolaje.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Panihapa Ahabu nkolongwa wa ku Izilaeli, akabhalohiki ihongozi bhokapi bha inchi, na kubhapwaghila, “Ndingalyaje ntundu mundu ajoju moatumbulila milomu! Atumiki ubholu kubha apala akabhahanu bhangu, bhana bhangu, madini ghangu gha feza na zahabu yangu, nanatu ngachenunjimike.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Bhazee na bhandu bhokapi bhakayangike, “Ngawanjowanela, wala ngawijetakela ghaaghapala.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Bhela, Ahabu akabhapwaghi bhabholu bhaka Beni Hadadi, “Mumpwaghila bambo wangu nkolongwa anana, ‘Mtumika waku anaahenga ghokapi ghaukapaliki pakutumbula, nambu malaghalakilu gha kabheli hagha nganyetakeli hata pachokopi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:9">Bhakabhokiki na kupeleka liyangu kwaka nkolongwa Beni Hadadi. <verse eid="1KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Bhela Beni Hadadi akatumiki ubholu ghongi kwaka Ahabu, kupwagha, “Ichapanga na inetila mahakau, hata nakatopi ja ghanihagha, nukulapi kubha ananijiyonanga Samalia hata ngapihighalili chindu chokapi chela ambachu kila jumu wa manjolinjoli wangu aweza kuchitola kubha ngati kombukombu.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Nkolongwa Ahabu wa ku Izilaeli akayangike, “Mumpwaghila nkolongwa Beni Hadadi kubha mwana makili alilumbalila baada ja kukomana ngondo, nga mangani ja kukomana.”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Beni Hadadi akajopalili ubholu aghoghu kuhuma kwaka Ahabu chikahi jombi na bhakolongwa bhaakalombini nabhu pabhakabhi mu mahema ghabhu bhakakunywaje. Bhela, akabhalaghalaki bhandu bhaki, “Muliandia kujenda kukomana ngondo.” Bhela bhakaliandii wichu nahuli kujenda kuulapula muchi wa Samalia.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Chikahi chelachela, mlota jumu akunjendili Ahabu, nkolongwa wa ku Izilaeli, na kumpwaghila, “Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Bho, ubhona wamaheli wa manjolinjoli aghagha? Lalenu ananabhatenda bhalepalyaje palongi jaku, nanau anaumanya kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ahabu Akalalukile, “Bho, ananyangatya nane?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Mlota akayangike, “Anana nde moapwaghi Bambo Chapanga, ‘Kwa ujangatilu wa akakombu bhakolongwa bhabhahenga lihengu la manjolinjoli pahi ja ihongozi bha wilaya bhanihabha nde bhabhihenga leniheli.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Najombi nkolongwa akalalukile, “Bho, nde nane joanatumbula ngondo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Mlota akamuyangike, “Anautumbula wehapa.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Bhela, nkolongwa Ahabu akabhalohiki akakombu bhabhakabhi ihongozi bha bhakomana ngondo bha wilaya, bhokapi bhakabhi akakombu mia ibheli na selasini na ibheli. Bhela, akabhabhongini manjolinjoli gha Bhaizilaeli bhokapi bhabhakahighalile, nabhombi bhakabhi manjolinjoli elufu saba.<verse eid="1KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Bhela, chikahi cha saa sita ja muhe, nkolongwa Ahabu na manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli bhakabhokiki chikahi Beni Hadadi na bhakolongwa bhajaki selasini na bhabheli bhaakalombini nabhu bhala, pabhakabhi mu mahema ghabhu bhakakunywaji na kulobhela. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Akakombu bhabhakabhi ihongozi bha bhakomana ngondo bha wilaya bhala, bhakalongulile. Chikahi chenihechi Beni Hadadi akabhi abhatumiki bhapelelezi, ambabhu bhakaletiki ubholu kupwagha, “Manjolinjoli ghahika kuhuma ku muchi wa Samalia.” <verse eid="1KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Beni Hadadi akabhapwaghile, “Mubhakamula bhakabya bhomi. Hata ngati bhahikiki kwa ndandi ja ngondo, au kwa ndandi ja lukwali.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Bhela, akakombu bhabhakabhi ihongozi bha bhakomana ngondo bha wilaya bhala, bhakalonguli pangondo, na kujengalewa na manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli kunyuma jabhu. <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />Kila jumu wabhu akunkomiki adui jumu. Bhandu bha Silia bhakatilike, nabhombi manjolinjoli bha Izilaeli bhakabhajengalile. Nambu Beni Hadadi, nkolongwa wa Silia akatiliki akabya akweliki panani ja lifalasi laki, papamu na bhakumu bha bhakwela falasi bhaki. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Bhela, nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akaweziki ngondo, akatoliki kwa makili falasi na magali ghamaheli gha kuhutakika, na kubhakoma bhandu bhamaheli bha Silia. <verse eid="1KI 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Paghakapetiki ghanihagha, mlota jola akunjendili nkolongwa wa Izilaeli na kumpwaghila, “Uliandia wichu, na uholalyaje la kuhenga, maghambu pamwaka nkolongwa wa Silia anahika kukulapu kabheti.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhasilia bhabhalapu kabheti bhandu bha Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Ihongozi bhabhakabhi pahi jaka nkolongwa Beni Hadadi bhakumpwaghi anana, “Ichapanga ya bhandu bha Izilaeli nde ichapnga ya mwitombi, nde ndandi bhakabhi na makili kutupeta tepani. Nambu ngati anatukomini nabhu mu inchi ja uwanda, chakaka anatubhawezaje. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Henu, utenda anana: Ubhabhoha bhakolongwa bhokapi selasini na bhabheli habha kuhuma mu pandu pabhu pa ukolongwa na ubheka ihongozi bhakomana ngondo badala jabhu. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Uandia manjolinjoli bhamaheli ngati bhala bha kutumbula, bhelabhela uandia falasi na magali gha kuhutakika ngati ghala gha kutumbula, nahuli tuweza kukomana na Izilaeli mu inchi ja uwanda. Chakaka anatukubha na makili kupeta bhombi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:25">Najombi nkolongwa Beni Hadadi akajowanili maholalelu ghabhu, na akatendiki bhenibhela. <verse eid="1KI 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Chaka chechajengalyaje, pachapetiki chikahi cha imbepu, Beni Hadadi akabhabhongini Bhasilia, na kujenda ku muchi wa Afeki kukomana na bhandu bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Nabhombi bhandu bha Izilaeli bhakabhonginwi na kupekewa silaha, nabhombi bhakapiti kukomana ngondo na Bhasilia. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhekiki likambi pambipi nabhu ngati mapogha ghabheli machokumachoku gha imbuhi, nambu Bhasilia bhakajaghani mu inchi jokapi.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Bhela, mundu waka Chapanga akunhikili na kumpwaghi Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, “Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Kwa ndandi Bhasilia bhaholalela Bambo Chapanga nde Chapanga wa mwitombi na nga Chapanga wa inchi ja uwanda, ananabhatenda manjolinjoli abhabha bhalepalya palongi jaku, nanau anaumanya kubha nepani nde Bambo Chapanga.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Bhandu bha Izilaeli na Bhasilia bhakabhekiki likambi kwa machobha saba bhakalingalanyaje, na lichobha la saba ngondo jakatumbwile. Bhaizilaeli bhakabhakomiki manjolinjoli ghaghajenda kwa magholu gha Bhasilia laki jimu kwa lichobha limu. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Bhabhahighalili, bhakatilili ku muchi wa Afeki, konihoku lumatu lwa muchi lukabhahabhukili na kubhakoma manjolinjoli elufu ishilini na saba bhabhakahighalili bhala. Najombi nkolongwa Beni Hadadi akatilili kumbwani, na kujenda kulihiya mu chumba cha mkati. <verse eid="1KI 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Bhatumika bhaki bhakapiti kumpwaghila, “Lingalyaje, tujowini kubha bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli nde bhandu bhabhabhi na chiha. Tujendaje kwaka nkolongwa wa Izilaeli tukabya tuweti ingobhu ya magunila mu ibhunu hitu, na mighoji kuyongolota mimutu jitu. Pangi aweza kukuleka kubha mwomi.” <verse eid="1KI 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Bhela, bhalikongiki ingobhu ya magunila mu ibhunu yabhu na mighoji kuyongolota mimutu jabhu, bhakapiti kwaka nkolongwa wa Izilaeli na kumpwaghila, “Mtumika waku Beni Hadadi apwagha, ‘Chondi, nobha uneka mwomi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Nkolongwa Ahabu akayangike, “Bho, akona le abhi wome? Jombi nde ndongu wangu.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Bhatumika bhaka Beni Hadadi bhakabhi bhapendakela nginyulila jokapi jejibhi jinyahi, bhela Ahabu paakapwaghiki bhenibhela, bhombi bhakayangiki, bhakapwaghaje, “Ena, Beni Hadadi nde ndongu waku!” Ahabu akabhapwaghile, “Njendanya mukundetaje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Bhela, Beni Hadadi paakahikiki, Ahabu akunkwehiki Beni Hadadi mu ligali laki la kuhutakika la ngondo. <verse eid="1KI 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Bhela, Beni Hadadi akumpwaghile, “Michi jokapi ambaju tati wangu akunyawi tati waku, ananukukelabhukyaje. Uweza kutumbulila pandu pa kuhemela na kulombesa ku Damasko hoku, ngati moakatendi tati wangu ku Samalia hoku.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ahabu akapwaghike, “Ananukulekakya kulijeka kwa majetanganelu ghanihagha.” Panihapa, akabhekiki majetanganelu naku, na kundeka abya wa kulijeka.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlota ampekeha masolu Ahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Bhela, kwa lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga, mundu jumu wa bhana bhaka mlota akumpwaghi njaki, “Chondi, nukulobha unapula kwa silaha jaku.” Nambu njaki jola akakaniki kundapula. <verse eid="1KI 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Mlota jola akumpwaghile, “Kwa kubha ukaniki kutii sauti jaka Bambo Chapanga, lingalyaje, chikahi pela pawibhoka kwangu lihimba analukukomaje.” Na chikahi pela mundu jola paakabhokiki, lihimba lakumpitalili na kunkoma.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Mlota akunhimani mundu jongi na kumpwaghila, “Chondi, nukulobha unapula kwa silaha jaku.” Panihapa mundu jola akundapwi na kumpoteka. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Bhela, mlota akabhokiki na kujenda kujema punkeghi ja indela kundendalela Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, koni alikongiki chitambala pamihu, nahuli ngaimanyikana. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Nkolongwa paakabhi apeta, mlota jola akundohiki, akapwaghaje, “Mtumika waku akapiti kungondo chikahi ngondo pajakabhi jijendalela, mundu jumu akanetili mundu joatolakiki kwa makili, akapwaghaje, ‘Undendaje mundu jonjone. Anatiliki anaunepa womi waku wamwente au ipandi elufu itatu ya madini gha feza.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Chikahi mtumika waku paakabhi na lihengu la maheli pambani na palapala, mundu jola akatilike.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akapwaghike, “Bhenibhela nde mokwibhelila utemulu waku. Ulitemwi wamwete.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Panihapa, mlota jola akatendiki manyata kuchibhoha chitambala pamihu jaki, najombi Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akummanyiki kubha nde jumu wa bhalota. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Bhela, mlota jola akumpwaghi nkolongwa, “Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Undekiki kulijeka mundu joakapalakiki apotilaje. Bhela womi waku anaulepa kwa womi wake, na bhandu bhaku kwa bhandu bhaki.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Bhela, Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akapiti kunyumba jaki ku Samalia hoku, koni akabya atweli inyela, na mabhinilu makolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Nabosi akana kundombase Ahabu ngonda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Paghapetiki ghanihagha, Nabosi, kuhuma ku muchi wa Yezileeli, akabhi na ngonda wa mizabibu pambipi na nyumba ja kikolongwa jaka Ahabu, nkolongwa wa ku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Bhela, lichobha limu Ahabu akumpwaghi Nabosi, “Umbekyaje ngonda waku wa mizabibu ndumilaje kubha chijongu cha likolu, kwa ndandi ubhi pambipi na nyumba jangu ja kikolongwa. Ananukupekya ngonda ghongi unyahi nakanopi wa mizabibu au ngati anaupala, ananukulepa mbija jeupala kulengana na ngonda waku.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Nambu Nabosi akamuyangiki nkolongwa Ahabu, “Bambo Chapanga na anyepisha kutali kukupeke wehapa upwelelu ghombatiki kuhuma kwa akatati bhangu.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Bhela, nkolongwa Ahabu akabhujiki kunyumba jaki, koni ukabya umbina mtima na inyela kwa ndandi jaka Nabosi, wa ku muchi wa Yezileeli, kwa kubha akumpwaghi, “Nganukupekei upwelelu ghombatiki kuhuma kwa akatati bhangu.” Bhela, akaghoni panani ja chitanda, koni akang'ong'utikaji, na akakaniki kula chilebhi. <verse eid="1KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Nambu Yezebeli nhwanu waka Ahabu akunjendili na kundalukila, “Bho, maghambu kiki ukubhina mtima anana, na wala ngacheukula chilebhi?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Najombi akamuyangike, “Maghambu nakumpwaghi Nabosi, kuhuma ku Yezileeli, ‘Unombasya ngonda waku wa mizabibu, au ngati anaupala, ananukupekya ngonda ghongi wa mizabibu, pandu pa ngonda waku.’ Nambu jombi akambwaghile, ‘Nganukupekehi ngonda wangu wa mizabibu.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Yezebeli nhwanu waki, akumpwaghile, “Bho, joatawala mu Izilaeli nde nane? Bho, nga wehapa? Ujumukaje, ukulaje chilebhi! Mtima waku na uhekalyaje. Nepani ananukupekya ngonda wa mizabibu waka Nabosi, kuhuma ku Yezileeli!”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Bhela, Yezebeli akalembiki baluwa kwa lihina laka Ahabu, akabhekiki muhuli waki panani ja baluwa heji, akajipeliki kwa bhazee na kwa bhandu bhabhabhi na yeu bhabhatamika mu muchi papamu na Nabosi. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Mu baluwa heji akalembiki anana, “Mtangazaje lichobha la bhandu kukonga kula chilebhi, na mukuntamika Nabosi pandu pa kutopela pachilanda ja bhandu. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Bhela, mubhatamika bhandu bhabheli bhahakau palongi jaki, nabhombi bhalandilaje kubha Nabosi ampeki masolu Chapanga na nkolongwa. Panihapa mumpiha kunja na kundapu kwa maganga mbaka apotilaje.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Bhela, bhazee na bhandu bhabhabhi na yeu bhabhatamika mu muchi waka Nabosi, bhakatendiki ngati Yezebeli moakapwaghi mu baluwa jeakabhapelakile. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Bhakabhatangizi bhandu kukonga kula chilebhi, na kuntamika Nabosi pandu pa kutopela pachilanda ja bhandu. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Bhela bhandu bhabheli bhahakau bhala bhakahikiki na kutama palongi jaki, nabhombi bhakuntakili Nabosi palongi ja bhandu, bhakapwaghaje, “Nabosi ampeki masolu Chapanga na nkolongwa.” Bhela bhakumpihiki Nabosi kunja ja muchi na kundapu kwa maganga mbaka akapotile. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Bhela bhakatumiki ubholu kwaka Yezebeli, kupwagha, “Nabosi alapuliki maganga, na apotili.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Chikahi pela Yezebeli paakapatiki ubholu ghonighola kubha Nabosi alapuliki maganga, na apotile, akumpwaghi Ahabu, “Ujumukaje na utola ngonda wa mizabibu waka Nabosi, kuhuma ku Yezileeli, ghoakakaniki kulombesa. Ngacheabhi mwomi kabheti, alapuliki kwa maganga mbaka ajomwi kupotela.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ahabu paakajowini kubha Nabosi apotili, akabhokiki na kuhelela nahuli kuutola ngonda wa mizabibu waka Nabosi.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Bhela, lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhikili Eliya, Mtishibi, kupwagha, <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Ubhokaje, na uhelalaje ukahimangana na Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, joatawala koni akabya ku Samalia. Anaunhimanya mu ngonda wa mizabibu waka Nabosi, jombi apiti kuutola, nahuli kuutenda kubha waki. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Umpwaghilaje, ‘Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, bho, ngacheunkomiki mundu na kutola mali ghaki?’ Kabheti umpwaghilaje: Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Pandu pala ambapu nakawa yakalambiki mwahi waka Nabosi, bhelabhela nakawa anailamba mwahi waku, ena, mwahi waku wehapa!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Bhela, Ahabu akumpwaghi Eliya, “Wehapa wa adui wangu, bho, umbatike?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Eliya akamuyangike, “Ena, nukupatike. Maghambu wehapa uholalili wamweti kuhenga mahakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Bambo Chapanga akupwaghila, ‘Ananeta mahakau panani jaku. Ananyonanga bhabhelakeka bha kujomulela bha chikambaku bhaka Ahabu mu Izilaeli, akubhi ntumwa au mundu wa kulijeka. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Bhela ananabhatenda bhandu bha lukolu lwaku bhakubha ngati bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Yeloboamu mwana waka Nebati, na ngati bhandu bha lukolu lwaka Baasha mwana waka Ahiya, kwa ndandi ja mahakau ghaundendili na kubhatenda bhandu bha Izilaeli kutenda mahoku.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />Bhelabhela Bambo Chapanga akapwaghiki anana panaji jaka Yezebeli, ‘Nakawa anayunkula Yezebeli pambipi na lumatu lwa muchi wa Yezileeli.’ <verse eid="1KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />Mundu jokapi jola kuhuma mu lukolu lwaka Ahabu joanawelila kumbwani, nakawa anajunkulaje, na jokapi joanawelila kumighonda, ijuni ya kunani anayunkulaje.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />Ngachepalabhalili kubha na mundu ngati Ahabu ng'o, joakapangiki mweni kutenda uhakau palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akabya achochakewa na Yezebeli, nhwanu waki. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Akatendiki mahakau kwa kujojabhela imong'umong'u ngati mobhakatendi Bhaamoli ambau pamwandi hapa Bambo Chapanga akabhatopwili palongi ja bhandu bha Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Nambu, Ahabu paakajowini malobhi ghanihagha, akakachwili ingobhu yaki, akawati magunila na kukonga kula chilebhi. Akaghonili na kuliyekalela magunila, nahuli kuliheleya.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Bhela, lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga lakunhikili Eliya, kuhuma ku Tishibi, kupwagha, <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Bho, uweni ntundu Ahabu moaliheleha palongi jangu? Kwa ndandi alihelihi mweni, nganeti mahakau ghangani chikahi akona mwomi, nambu ananaghaleta kwa bhandu bha lukolu lwaki mu machobha gha utawala waka mwana waki.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Mlota Mikaya andakali Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:2-27">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 18:2-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Kwa hyaka itatu ngachepakabhi na ngondo pachilanda ja bhandu bha inchi ja Silia na bhandu bha inchi ja Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Nambu mu chaka cha katatu, Yehoshafati nkolongwa wa Yuda akahelili kujenda kumbona nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Ahabu akabhi abhapwaghi ihongozi bhabhakabhi pahi jaki, “Bho, ngachemmanyi kubha muchi wa Lamosi Gileadi nde mali ghitu, na tukona ngachetuhengiki chokapi kuukelabhu kwitu kuhuma kwaka nkolongwa wa Silia?” <verse eid="1KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Bhela akundaluki Yehoshafati, “Bho, anaujenda le papamu na nepani kukomana ngondo ku Lamosi Gileadi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Yehoshafati akamuyangiki nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, “Nepani nde ngati wehapa, bhandu bhangu nde ngati bhandu bhaku, falasi yangu nde ngati falasi yaku.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Nambu Yehoshafati akajendali kumpwaghi nkolongwa wa Izilaeli, “Nambu lalenu, undalukya hoti Bambo Chapanga.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Bhela, nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akabhabhongini bhalota akanalomi mia nchechi, na kubhalalukila, “Bho, nyenda le kubhalapu bhandu bha muchi wa Lamosi Gileadi, au nganijenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Nabhombi bhakamuyangike, “Ujendaje! Bambo Chapanga anaakujangatya kuuweza muchi wa Lamosi Gileadi.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Nambu Yehoshafati akalalukile, “Bho, ngacheabhi mlota waka Bambo Chapanga pambani jotuweza kundalukila?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akamuyangiki Yehoshafati, “Abhi mundu jumu ambaju kupetela jombi tuweza kundalukila kubhokana na Bambo Chapanga, nambu nunhakalila kwa ndandi ngachealotela lijambu lambone kubhokana na nepani, nambu kila chikahi anotela mahakau pela. Jombi nde Mikaya mwana waka Imula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehoshafati akumpwaghile, “Nkolongwa ngacheapalika kupwagha bhenibhela.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Bhela, nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akundohiki jumu wa bhatumika bhaki, na kumpwaghila, “Ujombatikaje! Ujenda ukundeta Mikaya mwana waka Imula.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Chikahi hechi, nkolongwa wa Izilaeli papamu na Yehoshafati nkolongwa wa ku Yuda bhakabhi bhatami pa itehu yabhu ya kikolongwa mu chibhanja cha kupumundi mahunu, pu ndyangu wa kujingalila mu Samalia, papamu na bhalota bhokapi bhakabya bhalotela palongi yabhu. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Pachilanda ja bhalota bhanihabha akabhi mlota Sedekia mwana waka Kenaana. Jonihoju akabhi alenganakili manyelu gha choma, na kumpwaghi Ahabu, “Bambo Chapanga apwagha anana, ‘Kwa manyelu aghagha, anaubhalapula na kubhakelabhuha Bhasilia kunyuma mbaka bhayonangikikaje.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Bhalota bhangi bhokapi bhakabhi bhalotela chindu chechechi bhakapwaghaje, “Ujendaje ukaulapula muchi wa Lamosi Gileadi, anauwezaje. Maghambu Bambo Chapanga anaakujangatya unkolongwa kuuweza muchi ghonihoghu.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Mbolu joakapiti kundoha Mikaya akumpwaghile, “Lingalyaje, bhalota bhokapi kwa papamu bhundotili nkolongwa kubha anaawezaje. Chondi, nukulobha wehapa nanau utenda ngati bhombi, undotilaje nkolongwa ghamboni.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Nambu Mikaya akapwaghike, “Chakaka ngati Bambo Chapanga moatamila, ananumpwaghila chela pela Bambo Chapanga cheanambwaghilaje.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Bhela, Mikaya paakahikiki palongi jaka nkolongwa, nkolongwa akundalukile, “Bho, tujenda le tukakomana ngondo ku Lamosi Gileadi hoku au ngatwijenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Mikaya akamuyangike, “Ujendaje na ukaulapulaje, maghambu Bambo Chapanga anaakujangatya unkolongwa kuuweza muchi ghonihoghu.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Nambu nkolomgwa akumpwaghile, “Bho, nukulapisha mala palenga kubha paulonge na nepani kwa lihina laka Bambo Chapanga, ikupalika umbwaghila uchakaka pela?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Panihapa Mikaya akayangike, “Nakabhaweni manjolinjoli bhokapi bha Izilaeli bhapechangana mu itombi ngati mambeleli ghangakubha na mdima. Najombi Bambo Chapanga akapwaghike, ‘Bhandu abhabha ngachebhabhi na bambo wabhu. Mubhalekaje kila mundu ajenda kunyumba jaki kwa lukwali.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akumpwaghi Yehoshafati, “Bho, ngachenukupwaghi kubha ngaanoteli ghamboni, nambu mahakau pela?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Panihapa Mikaya akajendali kupwagha, “Henu ujowanya lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga: Nukumbweni Bambo Chapanga atami panani ja chitehu chaki cha ukolongwa, na linjolinjoli lokapi la kunani kumahundi bhajemiki upambala wa chibhoku chaki cha kumalelelu na chibhoku chaki cha kumangeja. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Najombi Bambo Chapanga akalalukile, ‘Bho, nde nane joanaantenda Ahabu ajetakya kujenda kuulapula muchi wa Lamosi Gileadi, na akahwelila konihoko?’ Kila jumu akayangiki cheaholalyaje. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Bhela akapitalili lijobhi jumu, akajemiki palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, akapwaghike, ‘Nepani ananunkoluhaje.’ <verse eid="1KI 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Bambo Chapanga akundaluki lijobhi jola, ‘Kwa indela bhole?’ Akapwaghike, ‘Ananyenda na kubhatenda bhalota bhaki bhokapi bhupwaghila upuhi.’ Bambo Chapanga akumpwaghi lijobhi jola, ‘Wehapa anauweza kunkoloha. Ujenda ukatenda bhenibhela.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />Bhela, Mikaya akajomuli kupwagha, “Anana nde mokubhelile: Bambo Chapanga abhatendiki bhalota bhaku bhokapi habha bhapwagha upuhi. Bambo Chapanga alaghalakili mahakau ghakupataje.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Panihapa, Sedekia mwana waka Kenaana akunheghalili Mikaya na kundapula lighanja mulutukwa, na kundalukila, “Bho, kutumbu lile Roho waka Bambo Chapanga aneka nepani, na kuhika kulonge na wehapa?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Mikaya akayangike, “Lingalyaje, lichobha lewijingala mu chumba cha mkati nahuli kujenda kujobhalela, panihapa nde pawimanyaje.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Najombi Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akabhohiki amuli, “Munkamula Mikaya na munkelabhuha kwaka Amoni, mtawala wa muchi, na kwaka Yoashi mwana waka nkolongwa. <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />Mkapwaghaje, ‘Nkolongwa apwagha kubha mumbeka mundu ajoju mu ligeleza, na mumpekya libumunda na machi pela, mbaka panikelabhuka lukwali.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Bhela Mikaya akapwaghike, “Ngati anaukelawiki lukwali, bhela umanya Bambo Chapanga ngacheapwaghiki na nepani.” Akajendali kupwagha, “Mwenga mabhandu bhokapi njowanya ghanumpwaghi nkolongwa Ahabu!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupotela kwaka Ahabu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 18:28-34">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 18:28-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Bhela, Ahabu nkolongwa wa Izilaeli na Yehoshafati nkolongwa wa Yuda, bhakapiti kuulapula muchi wa Lamosi Gileadi. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akumpwaghi Yehoshafati, “Nepani ananhwata ingobhu yangakubha ya kikolongwa na kujingi mu kukomana ngondo, nambu wehapa uwata ingobhu yaku ya kikolongwa.” Bhela nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akapiti kungondo panga kuwata ingobhu ya kikolongwa.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Chikahi chenihechi, nkolongwa wa ku Silia akabhili abhalaghalakili bhakolongwa bha manjolinjoli selasini na bhabheli bhajemalela bha magali ghaki gha kuhutakika, akapwaghaje, “Ngamwikomana ngondo na mundu jokapi jola, nchoku wala nkolongwa, nambu pela nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Chikahi bhakolongwa bha magali gha kuhutakika gha ngondo pabhakumbweni Yehoshafati, bhakapwaghike, “Chakaka ajoju nde nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.” Bhela bhakunjengalili nahuli bhundapulaje, nambu Yehoshafati akalapwili njobhela. <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />Bhakolongwa bha magali gha kuhutakika gha ndondo bhala pabhakamanyiki kubha ngacheakabhi nkolonga wa Izilaeli bhakakotwiki kunjengalela. <verse eid="1KI 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Mundu jumu akahutiki upendi waki panga kuholakela, akundapwi nkolongwa wa Izilaeli pandu pa kulombana ingobhu yaki ya choma. Nkolongwa wa Izilaeli akumpwaghi njendeha ligali laki la kuhutakika na falasi, “Ng'anambula ligali na umoha nepani pa ngondo, mbotakiki namaa!”<verse eid="1KI 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Ngondo jakajendalili muhi jokapi, najombi nkolongwa Ahabu bhakunjeghamakili mkati ja ligali koni akalingalanya Bhasilia. Mwahi kuhuma pa chilonda chaki ukaholwili na kunyila mbaka pahi ja ligali, na pakamihi jaki akapotile. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Lyobha palakabhi lijibhila, amuli jakabhokiki kulikambi: “Kila mundu abhuja kumbwani jaki, na kila mundu abhuja ku inchi jaki!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Bhela nkolongwa Ahabu akapotili na bhakundetiki ku Samalia, nabhombi bhakuntaghiki konihoku. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Ligali laki la kuhutakika na falasi bhakaligholwili mu litanda la Samalia, pandu ambapu bhakemi pabhajogha, na nakawa yakalambiki mwahi waki, ngati lilobhi laka Bambo Chapanga molakabhi lipwaghike.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Matendu ghangi ghaka nkolongwa Ahabu, papamu na ghokapi ghaahengiki, nyumba jaki ja kikolongwa jeachengiki na kupamba kwa manyelu gha ndembu, na michi jokapi jeakajichengi lumatu, ilembakiki mu chitabhu cha kombukombu cha bhakolongwa bha Izilaeli. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahabu akataghakiki pandu pabhakataghakiki akahokolu bhaki. Najombi Ahazia mwana waka Ahabu akabhi nkolongwa pandu paki.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoshafati atawala mu inchi ja Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="2CH 20:31-21:1">2 Mambu gha Chikahi 20:31-21:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Mu chaka cha kachechi cha utawala waka nkolongwa Ahabu wa ku Izilaeli, Yehoshafati mwana waka Asa, akatumbwi kutawala mu inchi ja Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehoshafati akabhi na hyaka selasini na nhwanu chikahi paakatumbwili kutawala, najombi akatawili koni akabya ku Yelusalemu hoku kwa hyaka ishilini na nhwanu. Lihina laka mabhu waki akalowakiki Azuba, mwali waka Shilihi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Mu kila lijambu akajendiki mu indela yaka tati waki Asa, wala ngacheakapiti chihanganyuma. Akahengiki ghaghabhi ghamboni palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga. Hata bhela, pa tutombi twa kujojabhalela imong'umong'u ngachepabhohakike. Bhandu bhakajendali kubhoha nyambiku ya kujochakeka na kuhuwa ubani konihoku. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Yehoshafati akabhi na lukwali na nkolongwa wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Mambu ghangi gha utawala waka Yehoshafati, uwezu ghoakabhi nau na umanyi waki mu mambu gha ngondo, ghokapi ghalembakiki mu chitabhu cha kombukombu cha bhakolongwa bha Yuda. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Bhelabhela akanalomi bhabhakabhi bhahimangana kihyegha na akanalomi bhajabhu, bhabhahighalili mu machobha gha utawala waka Asa tati waki, akabhabhohiki mu inchi.<verse eid="1KI 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Kutumbu panihapa ngachekukabhi na nkolongwa mu Edomu. Njemalela wabhu akabhi chiongozi joakahaghuliwi na nkolongwa Yehoshafati.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Yehoshafati akalenganaki sitima yamaheli ya Talishishi nahuli ijenda ku Ofili kutola zahabu, nambu ngacheikapiti, kwa ndandi sitima yakatunyukini ku Esioni Gebeli hoku. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Bhela, Ahazia mwana waka Ahabu akumpwaghi Yehoshafati, “Ubhaleka bhatumika bhangu bhatenda mwanja papamu na bhatumika bhaku mu sitima,” nambu Yehoshafati akakanike.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Pakujomukela, Yehoshafati akapotili, na kutaghakika pandu pabhakataghakiki akahokolu bhaki mu matengeli gha kikolongwa mu muchi waka hokolu waki Daudi, najombi Yeholamu akatawili pandu paka tati waki Yehoshafati.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahazia atawala mu inchi ja Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Mu chaka cha komi na saba cha utawala waka Yehoshafati, nkolongwa wa Yuda, Ahazia, mwana waka Ahabu, akatumbwi kutawala mu Izilaeli. Akatawili kwa hyaka ibheli, koni akabya ku Samalia. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Ahazia akatendiki mahoku palongi jaka Bambo Chapanga, maghambu akajighiki matendu ghaka tati waki na matendu ghaka Yezebeli, mabhu waki, na matendu ghaka Yeloboamu, mwana waka Nebati, joakabhatendiki bhandu bha Izilaeli bhatenda mahoku. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Akuntumakili na kunjojabhe chapanga Baali, na kuntenda Bambo Chapanga, Chapanga wa Izilaeli, ayomaje, ngati moakahengi tati waki.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>